// Multilevel Master Listening — Part 4
window.LISTENING_L4=[{"n":1,"title":"Library, Main Hall, Computer Laboratory…","img":"img/l4/m1.jpg","letters":"ABCDEF","dur":214.3,"items":[{"p":"Library","a":"E","ps":31.0,"en":47.68,"si":3,"ev":"…along past the language laboratory and then past the library, which is next to the language lab on the same side…","uz":"…til laboratoriyasi yonidan, keyin kutubxona yonidan o'tasiz — u til laboratoriyasi bilan bir tomonda, yonma-yon joylashgan…","why":"Kutubxona til laboratoriyasining yonida, bir tomonda — E.","hl":"library"},{"p":"Main Hall","a":"C","ps":22.9,"en":47.68,"si":2,"ev":"To get to the main hall, you walk on to the end of this corridor in front of you and then you turn left… and facing you is the main hall at the end of the corridor.","uz":"Asosiy zalga borish uchun oldingizdagi yo'lak oxirigacha borib, chapga burilasiz… yo'lak oxirida ro'parangizda asosiy zal.","why":"Yo'lak oxirida, chapga burilgandan keyin ro'parada — C.","hl":"main hall"},{"p":"Computer Laboratory","a":"D","ps":50.87,"en":81.34,"si":5,"ev":"This time, don't turn left, turn right away from the main hall. The computer lab is immediately on your right.","uz":"Bu safar chapga emas, asosiy zaldan teskari — o'ngga buriling. Kompyuter laboratoriyasi darhol o'ng tomoningizda.","why":"Yo'lak oxirida o'ngga — D.","hl":"computer"},{"p":"Staff Room","a":"A","ps":66.52,"en":81.34,"si":6,"ev":"The staff room is near the main entrance, on the left over there, just opposite the reception desk.","uz":"O'qituvchilar xonasi asosiy kirish yaqinida, chap tomonda, qabulxona qarshisida.","why":"Kirish yonida, chapda, qabulxona qarshisida — A.","hl":"staff room"},{"p":"Student Common Room","a":"B","ps":91.58,"en":101.05,"si":8,"ev":"It's this area here, very close to where we are now, to the right of the reception desk as you come in the main entrance.","uz":"Mana shu joy, hozir turgan joyimizga juda yaqin — asosiy kirishdan kirganda qabulxonaning o'ng tomonida.","why":"Qabulxonaning o'ngida — B.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":5.18,"e":13.89,"t":"How do I find the main hall? Right. If you look on the back of the booklet I gave you, you'll see a map of the school. Let me show you."},{"s":14.52,"e":21.5,"t":"Look, you came in through the main entrance here and now we're here at reception."},{"s":22.9,"e":30.27,"t":"Now to get to the main hall, you walk on to the end of this corridor in front of you and then you turn left."},{"s":31.0,"e":47.68,"t":"along past the language laboratory and then past the library, which is next to the language lab on the same side, and facing you is the main hall at the end of the corridor. You can't miss it. So it's next to the library, in fact? Yes, that's right."},{"s":48.54,"e":50.14,"t":"I should be able to find that."},{"s":50.87,"e":65.95,"t":"And do you have a computer laboratory? Yes, we do. Could you tell me where that is? Certainly, yes. You go down to the end of this corridor again, but this time, don't turn left, turn right away from the main hall."},{"s":66.52,"e":81.34,"t":"The computer lab is immediately on your right, okay? Mm-hmm. And where's the staff room in case I need to find a teacher at some stage? The staff room is near the main entrance, on the left over there, just opposite the reception desk."},{"s":81.88,"e":90.91,"t":"In a day or two I'm sure you'll find your way around very easily. Oh, one last thing. Is there a student common room? Oh yes, I forgot to mention that."},{"s":91.58,"e":101.05,"t":"It's this area here, very close to where we are now, to the right of the reception desk as you come in the main entrance. There's tea and coffee facilities there. Great."},{"s":101.53,"e":103.04,"t":"Thank you very much. You're welcome."}]},{"n":2,"title":"football, reception area, dance studio…","img":"img/l4/m2.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":193.8,"items":[{"p":"football","a":"B","ps":11.35,"en":19.71,"si":2,"ev":"This room we're in at the moment is called the main hall, and it's used mainly for team sports such as football, volleyball and basketball.","uz":"Hozir turgan xonamiz asosiy zal deb ataladi, u asosan futbol, voleybol va basketbol kabi jamoaviy o'yinlar uchun.","why":"Futbol asosiy zalda o'ynaladi — xaritada Main Hall = B.","hl":"football"},{"p":"reception area","a":"F","ps":23.86,"en":27.49,"si":5,"ev":"On the other side of the reception area, there's the dance studio.","uz":"Qabulxona hududining narigi tomonida raqs studiyasi bor.","why":"Qabulxona — asosiy zal va raqs studiyasi o'rtasida — F.","hl":"reception area"},{"p":"dance studio","a":"C","ps":23.86,"en":36.35,"si":5,"ev":"On the other side of the reception area, there's the dance studio. It provides a smaller, more intimate space.","uz":"Qabulxonaning narigi tomonida raqs studiyasi bor. U kichikroq, shinamroq joy.","why":"Qabulxona (F) dan keyingi kichik bino — C.","hl":"dance studio"},{"p":"squash courts","a":"A","ps":37.5,"en":46.46,"si":7,"ev":"In a separate building… on the other side of the car park… there are the squash courts, six of them.","uz":"Alohida binoda… avtoturargohning narigi tomonida… oltita squash korti bor.","why":"Avtoturargoh (E) ortidagi alohida bino, oltita kort (\"19\" belgilari) — A.","hl":"squash courts"},{"p":"fitness room","a":"D","ps":47.22,"en":49.85,"si":9,"ev":"And at the far end of the building, a fitness room.","uz":"Binoning eng oxirida esa fitnes xonasi.","why":"Squash kortlari binosining oxiri — D.","hl":"fitness room"}],"segs":[{"s":4.44,"e":9.21,"t":"So, what exactly are the facilities? What sports can you play here?"},{"s":10.2,"e":10.53,"t":"Well"},{"s":11.35,"e":14.3,"t":"This room we're in at the moment is called the main hall."},{"s":14.87,"e":19.71,"t":"and it's used mainly for team sports such as football, volleyball and basketball."},{"s":20.28,"e":22.69,"t":"but also for badminton and aerobics."},{"s":23.86,"e":27.49,"t":"On the other side of the reception area, there's the dance studio."},{"s":28.47,"e":36.35,"t":"provides a smaller, more intimate space, which we use for ballet, modern dance and martial arts. Not at the same time, of course."},{"s":37.5,"e":43.71,"t":"Then, in a separate building, which you may have noticed on your way here, it's on the other side of the car park..."},{"s":44.31,"e":46.46,"t":"There are the squash courts, six of them."},{"s":47.22,"e":49.85,"t":"and at the far end of the building, a fitness room."},{"s":50.81,"e":53.63,"t":"This is our newest facility, only completed in the spring."},{"s":54.2,"e":56.7,"t":"but it's already proving to be one of the most popular."},{"s":57.59,"e":61.02,"t":"as well as all these facilities available here on the campus"},{"s":61.5,"e":64.32,"t":"We also have an arrangement with the local tennis club."},{"s":64.76,"e":66.33,"t":"which is only two miles away."},{"s":66.94,"e":71.45,"t":"in titling our students to use their courts on weekday mornings in the summer."},{"s":72.57,"e":76.09,"t":"So, I think that there should be something here for everybody."},{"s":76.6,"e":80.48,"t":"and I hope to see all of you at the centre making use of the facilities."},{"s":81.37,"e":87.93,"t":"If in the course of the year you have any suggestions as to how the service we provide might be improved..."},{"s":88.44,"e":89.92,"t":"or its appeal widened"},{"s":90.39,"e":91.97,"t":"I'll be interested to hear from you."}]},{"n":3,"title":"Woodside Road, the ticket office, the gift shop…","img":"img/l4/m3.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":299.4,"items":[{"p":"Woodside Road","a":"G","ps":14.55,"en":22.49,"si":2,"ev":"And of course, running along the bottom is Woodside Road.","uz":"Va, albatta, pastki tomondan Woodside yo'li o'tadi.","why":"Xaritaning eng pastki qismi, kirish oldidagi yo'l — G.","hl":"Woodside Road"},{"p":"the ticket office","a":"B","ps":26.55,"en":33.28,"si":5,"ev":"We're standing at the entrance… And immediately to our right is the ticket office.","uz":"Biz kirish oldida turibmiz… Darhol o'ng tomonimizda chipta kassasi.","why":"Kirishning o'ng tomoni — B. Undan narida hojatxonalar (Toilets).","hl":"the ticket office"},{"p":"the gift shop","a":"F","ps":42.68,"en":49.25,"si":9,"ev":"In front of us is the car park, as you can see, and to the left by the entry gate is the gift shop.","uz":"Oldimizda, ko'rib turganingizdek, avtoturargoh, kirish darvozasi yonida chapda esa sovg'alar do'koni.","why":"Kirishning chap tomoni — F.","hl":"the gift shop"},{"p":"the main workshop","a":"A","ps":62.07,"en":64.89,"si":13,"ev":"The big stone building at the top is the main workshop.","uz":"Tepadagi katta tosh bino — asosiy ustaxona.","why":"Yarim doiraning eng tepasi — A.","hl":"the main workshop"},{"p":"the showroom","a":"C","ps":73.43,"en":78.62,"si":15,"ev":"In the top right-hand corner, that building with bigger windows is the showroom.","uz":"Yuqori o'ng burchakdagi katta derazali bino — ko'rgazma zali.","why":"Yuqori o'ng burchak — C.","hl":"the showroom"}],"segs":[{"s":4.89,"e":7.49,"t":"Now I'm going to give you a plan of the site."},{"s":7.99,"e":13.63,"t":"And I'd just like to point out where everything is, and then you can take a look at everything for yourself."},{"s":14.55,"e":22.49,"t":"I've already pointed out the river, which is on the left, and of course, running along the bottom is Woodside Road."},{"s":23.06,"e":23.49,"t":"Got it"},{"s":25.05,"e":25.41,"t":"Okay."},{"s":26.55,"e":28.38,"t":"We're standing at the entrance."},{"s":28.82,"e":29.73,"t":"See it at the bottom"},{"s":30.55,"e":33.28,"t":"And immediately to our right is the ticket office."},{"s":34.14,"e":41.66,"t":"You won't need that because you've got your group booking, but just past it are the toilets. Always good to know where they are."},{"s":42.68,"e":45.63,"t":"In front of us is the car park, as you can see."},{"s":46.1,"e":49.25,"t":"and to the left by the entry gate is the gift shop."},{"s":50.04,"e":53.25,"t":"That's where you can get copies of the guide, like this one here."},{"s":54.84,"e":61.25,"t":"Now, beyond the car park, all the buildings are arranged in a half circle with a yard in the middle."},{"s":62.07,"e":64.89,"t":"The big stone building at the top is the main workshop."},{"s":65.53,"e":72.13,"t":"That's where the furnace is and where all the metal was smelted and the tools were cast, as you'll be able to see."},{"s":73.43,"e":78.62,"t":"In the top right-hand corner, that building with bigger windows is the showroom."},{"s":79.13,"e":83.2,"t":"where samples of all the tools that were made through the ages are on display."},{"s":84.5,"e":91.33,"t":"In the top left corner is the grinding shop where the tools were sharpened and finished."},{"s":92.25,"e":95.84,"t":"And on one side of that, you can see the engine room."},{"s":96.47,"e":104.45,"t":"and on the other is the cafe, which isn't an antique, you'll be pleased to know, though they do serve very nice old-fashioned teas."},{"s":105.88,"e":109.66,"t":"The row of buildings you can see on the left are the cottages."},{"s":110.52,"e":120.45,"t":"These were built for the workers towards the end of the 18th century and they're still furnished from that period so you can get a good idea of ordinary people's living conditions."},{"s":121.53,"e":123.1,"t":"Across the yard from them"},{"s":123.61,"e":128.0,"t":"You can see the stables, where the horses were kept for transporting the products."},{"s":128.82,"e":132.51,"t":"and the separate building in front of them is the works office."},{"s":132.95,"e":135.71,"t":"and that still has some of the old accounts on display."},{"s":137.11,"e":141.47,"t":"Right. If anyone wants a guided tour, then I'm starting at the engine room."},{"s":142.07,"e":144.96,"t":"If you'd like to come along this way, please, ladies and gentlemen."}]},{"n":4,"title":"kitchen garden, pear alley, mulberry garden…","img":"img/l4/m4.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":345.8,"items":[{"p":"kitchen garden","a":"I","ps":22.04,"en":26.17,"si":5,"ev":"As you go further down the path, there's the kitchen garden on the right.","uz":"Yo'l bo'ylab ilgarilaganingizda o'ng tomonda sabzavot bog'i bor.","why":"Mevazor (chapda)dan keyin, yo'lning o'ng tomonida — I.","hl":"kitchen garden"},{"p":"pear alley","a":"H","ps":26.62,"en":39.9,"si":6,"ev":"As you go round the first sharp corner you will find to your left an area where different types of pear tree have been planted… and this is known as Pear Alley.","uz":"Birinchi keskin burilishdan o'tganda chap tomonda turli nok daraxtlari ekilgan joyni ko'rasiz… bu \"Nok xiyoboni\" deb ataladi.","why":"Birinchi burilishdan keyin chapda — H.","hl":"Pear Alley"},{"p":"mulberry garden","a":"F","ps":49.53,"en":58.65,"si":12,"ev":"Follow the path round the second corner and on your right you will see the entrance to the Mulberry Garden.","uz":"Yo'l bo'ylab ikkinchi burilishdan o'tsangiz, o'ng tomonda tut bog'ining kirishini ko'rasiz.","why":"Ikkinchi burilishdan keyin o'ngda — F.","hl":"Mulberry Garden"},{"p":"shop","a":"B","ps":74.3,"en":91.81,"si":15,"ev":"Leave the house by the side entrance where you will find our shop, which is situated between the house and the garage.","uz":"Uydan yon eshik orqali chiqing — u yerda do'konimiz, uy va garaj o'rtasida joylashgan.","why":"Uy (HOUSE) va garaj o'rtasi — B.","hl":"shop"},{"p":"tea room","a":"D","ps":98.58,"en":104.29,"si":17,"ev":"So why don't you visit the tea room on the far side of the garage?","uz":"Garajning narigi tomonidagi choyxonaga kirmaysizmi?","why":"Garaj (C) ning narigi tomoni — D.","hl":"tea room"}],"segs":[{"s":5.18,"e":5.57,"t":"Now"},{"s":6.07,"e":9.5,"t":"Please look at the map I've given you of the house and gardens."},{"s":10.23,"e":11.04,"t":"We here?"},{"s":11.7,"e":13.18,"t":"the information center."},{"s":14.14,"e":20.89,"t":"Follow the path marked with the arrow and the first area you come to is the orchard on your left."},{"s":22.04,"e":26.17,"t":"As you go further down the path, there's the kitchen garden on the right."},{"s":26.62,"e":34.75,"t":"and as you go round the first sharp corner you will find to your left an area where different types of pear tree have been planted."},{"s":35.19,"e":37.02,"t":"as well as some lovely flowers."},{"s":37.53,"e":39.9,"t":"and this is known as Pear Alley."},{"s":40.38,"e":42.01,"t":"designed by George himself."},{"s":43.67,"e":45.89,"t":"Next to this is the greenhouse."},{"s":46.39,"e":48.86,"t":"where some exotic plants and fruits are grown."},{"s":49.53,"e":58.65,"t":"Follow the path round the second corner and on your right you will see the entrance to the Mulberry Garden with its 500 year old tree."},{"s":60.28,"e":64.67,"t":"Mulberry Garden, follow the path until you reach the front of the house."},{"s":65.56,"e":73.25,"t":"I suggest you spend a good hour wandering around this lovely building. A guide takes visitor groups round every two hours."},{"s":74.3,"e":91.81,"t":"If you would like to purchase any of George's books or other souvenirs, then leave the house by the side entrance where you will find our shop, which is situated between the house and the garage, which contains the magnificent old Rolls Royce car, which used to belong to George."},{"s":92.79,"e":97.95,"t":"I expect by this time you may also be in need of a rest and some refreshment."},{"s":98.58,"e":104.29,"t":"most visitors are. So why don't you visit the tea room on the far side of the garage?"},{"s":106.17,"e":110.62,"t":"If you have time, there is a lovely walk down towards the river Dudwell."},{"s":111.26,"e":113.92,"t":"For me, this is the best part of the estate."},{"s":114.74,"e":118.81,"t":"This isn't on the map, but it is all clearly signposted."},{"s":119.26,"e":122.85,"t":"You cross the field which spreads along the banks of the river."},{"s":123.61,"e":126.37,"t":"In spring this area is well worth a visit."},{"s":127.06,"e":135.52,"t":"Spend a minute or two watching the wall to pass by underneath as you cross the footbridge and then continue along the river walk through the woodland."},{"s":136.41,"e":145.95,"t":"On a hot summer's day the trees along this path provide welcome shade. Eventually you come to the water mill which used to provide the electricity for the house."},{"s":146.52,"e":150.24,"t":"only about four hours every evening in Georgia's time."},{"s":151.19,"e":166.56,"t":"And finally, for those of you who would like to see stunning views of the surrounding countryside and who are a little bit more energetic, when you return from the mill, take the first turning on your left and climb up to the viewpoint. You won't regret it."},{"s":167.35,"e":168.45,"t":"Enjoy your visit!"}]},{"n":5,"title":"swimming pool, car park, the rose garden…","img":"img/l4/m5.jpg","letters":"ABCDEF","dur":165.8,"items":[{"p":"swimming pool","a":"C","ps":11.74,"en":25.18,"si":2,"ev":"To the east… There's an indoor arena for gymnastics, a stadium for track and field and a swimming pool.","uz":"Sharqda… gimnastika uchun yopiq arena, yengil atletika stadioni va suzish havzasi bor.","why":"Sharqdagi Olimpiya majmuasi: arena va stadion belgilangan, qolgan bino — C.","hl":"swimming pool"},{"p":"car park","a":"E","ps":27.54,"en":40.99,"si":5,"ev":"You can see the train lines… There is also a car park, but it only holds a limited number of cars.","uz":"Temir yo'lni ko'rishingiz mumkin… Avtoturargoh ham bor, lekin u cheklangan miqdordagi mashinaga mo'ljallangan.","why":"Stansiya va stadion yonidagi alohida joy — E.","hl":"car park"},{"p":"the rose garden","a":"B","ps":51.45,"en":61.85,"si":8,"ev":"And around to the west, you can relax and sit on a bench to smell the flowers in the rose garden.","uz":"G'arbda esa skameykada o'tirib, atirgul bog'idagi gullar hididan bahramand bo'lishingiz mumkin.","why":"G'arb, skameykalar (Benches) — B.","hl":"the rose garden"},{"p":"lake","a":"D","ps":62.49,"en":75.52,"si":9,"ev":"There's a lake with a small island in the centre.","uz":"U yerda o'rtasida kichik oroli bor ko'l.","why":"Shimolda, orolli ko'l — D.","hl":"lake"},{"p":"café","a":"A","ps":62.49,"en":75.52,"si":9,"ev":"If you look through the trees, you can see the café, which has lovely views across the water.","uz":"Daraxtlar orasidan qarasangiz, suv manzarasi ajoyib ko'rinadigan kafeni ko'rasiz.","why":"Daraxtlar ortida, ko'l bo'yida — A.","hl":"café"}],"segs":[{"s":4.86,"e":5.5,"t":"Well..."},{"s":6.01,"e":10.75,"t":"Here we are at the top of the tower and we're going to look at the view from each direction."},{"s":11.74,"e":16.77,"t":"To the east, the large buildings about a kilometre away are on the Olympic site."},{"s":17.3,"e":25.18,"t":"There's an indoor arena for gymnastics, a stadium for track and field and a swimming pool for races and synchronised swimming."},{"s":25.69,"e":26.75,"t":"and also diving."},{"s":27.54,"e":36.41,"t":"If you look carefully down there, you can see the train lines. The Olympic site has its own station to encourage the use of public transport."},{"s":36.86,"e":40.99,"t":"There is also a car park, but it only holds a limited number of cars."},{"s":41.75,"e":50.65,"t":"The formal park has some specially created water features. If you look out here to the south, you can see a circular ornamental pond."},{"s":51.45,"e":61.85,"t":"And around to the west, you can relax and sit on a bench to smell the flowers in the rose garden. And finally up to the north, if you look in front of you now..."},{"s":62.49,"e":75.52,"t":"There's a lake with a small island in the centre. You can hire rowing boats at the boat shed, which you can't see from here. But if you look through the trees, you can see the cafe, which has lovely views across the water."},{"s":75.96,"e":76.64,"t":"Okay."},{"s":77.3,"e":78.56,"t":"Let's climb down now."}]},{"n":6,"title":"rare breeds section, the forest area, experimental crops area…","img":"img/l4/m6.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":219.0,"items":[{"p":"rare breeds section","a":"C","ps":42.9,"en":52.32,"si":8,"ev":"As you walk out of the main door into the park, there's a path you can follow. If you follow this route, you'll immediately come into the rare breed section.","uz":"Asosiy eshikdan parkka chiqqaningizda yo'lak bor. Shu yo'ldan borsangiz, darhol noyob zotlar bo'limiga kirasiz.","why":"\"You are here\" (G) dan yo'lak bo'ylab birinchi joy, yaylov yonida — C.","hl":"section"},{"p":"the forest area","a":"D","ps":65.21,"en":69.85,"si":12,"ev":"Then, further east, in the largest section of our park, is the forest area.","uz":"Keyin, yanada sharqda, parkimizning eng katta qismida o'rmon hududi.","why":"Yaylovdan sharqda, eng katta hudud — D.","hl":"the forest area"},{"p":"experimental crops area","a":"F","ps":70.97,"en":76.06,"si":13,"ev":"South of the grazing area and in fact just next to the reception block is our experimental crop area.","uz":"Yaylovning janubida, aniqrog'i qabul binosining yonginasida tajriba ekinlari maydoni.","why":"Qabul binosi (G) yonida, markaz — F.","hl":"area"},{"p":"the fish farms","a":"B","ps":77.62,"en":89.6,"si":14,"ev":"In the middle of the park, this circular area is our lake… these two small rectangular shapes here are the fish farms.","uz":"Parkning o'rtasidagi bu doira — ko'limiz… bu ikki kichik to'rtburchak — baliq fermalari.","why":"Ko'l ichidagi to'rtburchaklar (strelka) — B.","hl":"the fish farms"},{"p":"market garden area","a":"A","ps":97.21,"en":104.19,"si":18,"ev":"In the south-eastern corner beyond the marsh is our market garden area growing vegetables and flowers.","uz":"Botqoqlikdan narida, janubi-sharqiy burchakda sabzavot va gul yetishtiriladigan bog'.","why":"Botqoqlik (Marsh) ortida, janubi-sharq — A.","hl":"market garden area"}],"segs":[{"s":4.09,"e":6.33,"t":"Welcome to Greenvale Agricultural Park."},{"s":7.06,"e":11.52,"t":"As you know, we've only been open a week, so you're amongst our first visitors."},{"s":12.5,"e":18.37,"t":"We have lots of fascinating indoor and outdoor exhibits on our huge complex, spreading hundreds of hectares."},{"s":19.19,"e":23.36,"t":"Our remit is to give educational opportunities to the wider public"},{"s":23.9,"e":30.05,"t":"as well as to offer research sites for a wide variety of agriculturists and other scientists."},{"s":30.9,"e":33.47,"t":"Let's start by seeing what there is to do."},{"s":34.55,"e":38.05,"t":"As you can see here on our giant wall plan."},{"s":38.49,"e":41.5,"t":"We are now situated in the reception block, here."},{"s":42.9,"e":47.1,"t":"As you walk out of the main door into the park, there's a path you can follow."},{"s":48.02,"e":52.32,"t":"If you follow this route, you'll immediately come into the rare breed section."},{"s":52.79,"e":57.53,"t":"where we keep a wide variety of animals which I shall be telling you a little more about later."},{"s":58.81,"e":64.29,"t":"Next to this, moving east, is the large grazing area for the rare breeds."},{"s":65.21,"e":69.85,"t":"Then, further east, in the largest section of our park, is the forest area."},{"s":70.97,"e":76.06,"t":"south of the grazing area and in fact just next to the reception block is our experimental crop area."},{"s":77.62,"e":82.01,"t":"In the middle of the park, this circular area is our lake."},{"s":82.74,"e":86.4,"t":"these two small rectangular shapes here."},{"s":86.94,"e":89.6,"t":"are the fish farms where we rear fish for sale."},{"s":90.87,"e":96.13,"t":"To the east of those is the marsh area, which attracts a great many migrant birds."},{"s":97.21,"e":104.19,"t":"in the south eastern corner beyond the marsh is our market garden area growing vegetables and flowers"}]},{"n":7,"title":"trees, coloured road surface, traffic lights…","img":"img/l4/m7.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":219.8,"items":[{"p":"trees","a":"C","ps":12.66,"en":19.33,"si":2,"ev":"We'll plant mature pine trees to provide shelter and shade just to the right of the supermarket in Days Road.","uz":"Days yo'lidagi supermarketning o'ng tomoniga soya va pana berish uchun katta qarag'aylar ekamiz.","why":"Supermarketning o'ngi, Days Road — C.","hl":"trees"},{"p":"coloured road surface","a":"G","ps":31.8,"en":41.18,"si":5,"ev":"The roadway at the entrance to Thomas Street from Days Road will be painted red.","uz":"Days yo'lidan Thomas ko'chasiga kiraverishdagi yo'l qizilga bo'yaladi.","why":"Thomas Street kirishi — G.","hl":"road"},{"p":"traffic lights","a":"F","ps":60.82,"en":69.44,"si":9,"ev":"To install traffic lights halfway down Hill Street where it crosses Days Road.","uz":"Hill ko'chasining o'rtasida, u Days yo'li bilan kesishgan joyda svetofor o'rnatish.","why":"Hill Street va Days Road kesishmasi — F.","hl":"traffic lights"},{"p":"artwork","a":"A","ps":83.77,"en":90.27,"si":13,"ev":"An artist will incorporate that story into paintings on the wall of a building on the other side of Hill Street from the supermarket.","uz":"Rassom bu hikoyani supermarketga qarama-qarshi, Hill ko'chasining narigi tomonidagi bino devoridagi rasmlarga aylantiradi.","why":"Supermarket qarshisidagi bino — A.","hl":null},{"p":"children's playground","a":"E","ps":91.8,"en":100.93,"si":14,"ev":"A new children's playground, which will be at the other end of Hill Street, close to the intersection with Carberry Street.","uz":"Yangi bolalar maydonchasi Hill ko'chasining narigi uchida, Carberry ko'chasi bilan kesishma yaqinida bo'ladi.","why":"Hill Street va Carberry Street kesishmasi — E.","hl":"children's playground"}],"segs":[{"s":5.3,"e":8.99,"t":"also put together a map which you send out to all the residents in the area."},{"s":9.62,"e":11.81,"t":"and on the map we've marked the proposed changes."},{"s":12.66,"e":19.33,"t":"Firstly, we'll plant mature pine trees to provide shelter and shade just to the right of the supermarket in Days Road."},{"s":20.38,"e":26.27,"t":"In order to address the traffic problems, the pavements on the corner of Carbury and Thomas Street will be widened."},{"s":27.38,"e":30.78,"t":"This will help to reduce the speed of vehicles entering Thomas Street."},{"s":31.8,"e":41.18,"t":"We think it's very important to separate the local residential streets from the main road. So, the roadway at the entrance to Thomas Street from Day's Road will be painted red."},{"s":42.07,"e":45.95,"t":"This should market more clearly and act as a signal for traffic to slow down."},{"s":47.45,"e":52.35,"t":"One way of making sure that the pedestrians are safe is to increase signage at the intersections."},{"s":53.21,"e":60.29,"t":"A Keep Clear sign will be erected at the junction of Evelyn Street and Hill Street to enable traffic to exit at all times."},{"s":60.82,"e":69.44,"t":"Something we're planning to do to help control the flow of traffic in the area is to install traffic lights halfway down Hill Street where it crosses Days Road."},{"s":71.22,"e":76.16,"t":"we haven't only thought about the cars and traffic of course, there's also something for the children."},{"s":76.79,"e":80.41,"t":"We're going to get school children in the area to research a local story, the"},{"s":80.92,"e":83.07,"t":"life of a local sport hero perhaps."},{"s":83.77,"e":90.27,"t":"and an artist will incorporate that story into paintings on the wall of a building on the other side of Hill Street from the supermarket."},{"s":91.8,"e":100.93,"t":"Finally, we've agreed to build a new children's playground, which will be at the other end of Hill Street, close to the intersection with Carbury Street. Wonderful."},{"s":101.4,"e":103.77,"t":"Now, what's the next stage?"},{"s":104.22,"e":104.54,"t":"Well"},{"s":105.27,"e":106.01,"t":"Final plan"}]},{"n":8,"title":"bird hide, dog-walking area, flower garden…","img":"img/l4/m8.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":129.9,"items":[{"p":"bird hide","a":"A","ps":20.7,"en":27.68,"si":2,"ev":"There's a lake in the north-west of the park with a bird hide to the west of it at the end of a path.","uz":"Parkning shimoli-g'arbida ko'l bor, uning g'arbida, yo'lak oxirida qush kuzatish joyi.","why":"Ko'lning g'arbi, yo'lak oxiri — A.","hl":"bird hide"},{"p":"dog-walking area","a":"I","ps":33.69,"en":41.28,"si":4,"ev":"Fairly close to where refreshments are available, there's a dog-walking area in the southern part of the park, leading off from the path.","uz":"Yegulik sotiladigan joyga ancha yaqin, parkning janubiy qismida, yo'lakdan ajralib chiqadigan it sayr qildirish maydoni bor.","why":"Refreshments yonida, janubda — I.","hl":"dog-walking area"},{"p":"flower garden","a":"F","ps":42.07,"en":50.37,"si":5,"ev":"You can go to the Flower Garden. That's the circular area on the map, surrounded by paths.","uz":"Gulzorga borishingiz mumkin — xaritadagi yo'laklar bilan o'ralgan doira.","why":"Yo'laklar bilan o'ralgan doira — F.","hl":"Flower Garden"},{"p":"wooded area","a":"E","ps":51.32,"en":56.89,"si":6,"ev":"There's a wooded area in the western section of the park between two paths.","uz":"Parkning g'arbiy qismida, ikki yo'lak orasida o'rmonzor bor.","why":"G'arb, ikki yo'lak orasi — E.","hl":"wooded area"}],"segs":[{"s":2.71,"e":10.81,"t":"And finally, I'd like to tell you about our new wildlife area, Hinchingbrook Park, which will be opened to the public next month."},{"s":11.8,"e":20.06,"t":"This slide doesn't really indicate how big it is, but anyway, you can see the two gates into the park and the main paths."},{"s":20.7,"e":27.68,"t":"As you can see, there's a lake in the north-west of the park with a bird hide to the west of it at the end of a path."},{"s":28.22,"e":31.81,"t":"so it'll be a nice quiet place for watching the birds on the lake."},{"s":33.69,"e":41.28,"t":"fairly close to where refreshments are available, there's a dog walking area in the southern part of the park, leading off from the pass."},{"s":42.07,"e":50.37,"t":"And if you just want to sit and relax, you can go to the Flower Garden. That's the circular area on the map, surrounded by paths."},{"s":51.32,"e":56.89,"t":"And finally, there's a wooded area in the western section of the park between two paths."},{"s":57.37,"e":60.13,"t":"Okay, that's enough from me, so let's get on-"}]},{"n":9,"title":"scarecrow, maze, café…","img":"img/l4/m9.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":353.6,"items":[{"p":"scarecrow","a":"F","ps":22.81,"en":27.81,"si":4,"ev":"The scarecrow you can see in the car park in the corner beside the main path.","uz":"Qo'riqchi qo'g'irchoq avtoturargohda, asosiy yo'lak yonidagi burchakda.","why":"Car Park burchagi, asosiy yo'lak yonida — F.","hl":"scarecrow"},{"p":"maze","a":"G","ps":43.0,"en":53.12,"si":8,"ev":"If you look ahead of you, you'll see a maze, opposite the new barn beside the side path that branches off to the right.","uz":"Oldinga qarasangiz, labirintni ko'rasiz — yangi omborxona qarshisida, o'ngga ajraladigan yon yo'lak yonida.","why":"New Barn qarshisi, yon yo'lak boshida — G.","hl":"maze"},{"p":"café","a":"D","ps":71.0,"en":82.97,"si":13,"ev":"Go towards the bridge and turn right just before it. Walk along the side path and the café's on the first bend you come to.","uz":"Ko'prik tomon boring va unga yetmasdan o'ngga buriling. Yon yo'lak bo'ylab yuring — kafe birinchi burilishda.","why":"Ko'prikdan oldin o'ngga, birinchi burilish — D.","hl":"café"},{"p":"black barn","a":"H","ps":108.22,"en":117.31,"si":18,"ev":"If you take the side path to the right, here, just by the new barn, you'll come to the black barn, just where the path first bends.","uz":"Shu yerda, yangi omborxona yonida o'ngga yon yo'lakka kirsangiz, yo'l birinchi bukilgan joyda qora omborxonaga yetasiz.","why":"Yangi ombor yonidagi yo'lak, birinchi bukilish — H.","hl":"black barn"},{"p":"covered picnic area","a":"C","ps":131.74,"en":141.63,"si":21,"ev":"There's one near the farmyard, just after you cross the bridge. There's a covered picnic spot on the right.","uz":"Ferma hovlisi yaqinida, ko'prikdan o'tgan zahoti bittasi bor. O'ng tomonda yopiq piknik joyi.","why":"Ko'prikdan keyin o'ngda — C.","hl":"picnic"}],"segs":[{"s":4.92,"e":8.25,"t":"Now let me give you some idea of the layout of the farm."},{"s":9.24,"e":14.17,"t":"The building where you bought your tickets is the new barn immediately to your right."},{"s":14.74,"e":18.4,"t":"And we're now at the beginning of the main path to the farmland."},{"s":19.0,"e":21.79,"t":"And of course the car park is on your left."},{"s":22.81,"e":27.81,"t":"The scarecrow you can see in the car park in the corner beside the main path"},{"s":28.25,"e":32.41,"t":"is a traditional figure for keeping the birds away from crops."},{"s":33.27,"e":35.93,"t":"Our Scarecrow is a permanent sculpture."},{"s":36.66,"e":41.44,"t":"It's taller than a human being, so you can see it from quite a distance."},{"s":43.0,"e":45.89,"t":"If you look ahead of you, you'll see a maze."},{"s":46.68,"e":53.12,"t":"opposite the new barn beside the side path that branches off to the right, just over there."},{"s":54.33,"e":60.09,"t":"The maze is made out of hedges which are too tall for young children to see over them."},{"s":60.54,"e":63.58,"t":"but it's quite small so you can't get lost in it."},{"s":65.59,"e":70.14,"t":"Can you see the bridge crossing the fish pool further up the main path?"},{"s":71.0,"e":77.09,"t":"If you want to go to the cafe, go towards the bridge and turn right just before it."},{"s":77.91,"e":82.97,"t":"Walk along the side path and the cafes on the first bend you come to."},{"s":84.28,"e":89.44,"t":"The building was originally the schoolhouse and it's well over 100 years old."},{"s":91.26,"e":99.77,"t":"As you may know, we run skills workshops here, where you can learn traditional crafts like woodwork and basket making."},{"s":100.76,"e":106.94,"t":"You can see examples of the work and talk to someone about the courses in the black barn."},{"s":108.22,"e":117.31,"t":"If you take the side path to the right, here, just by the new barn, you'll come to the black barn, just where the path first bends."},{"s":118.58,"e":125.37,"t":"Now I mustn't forget to tell you about picnicking, as I can see some of you have brought your lunch with you."},{"s":126.26,"e":130.94,"t":"You can picnic in the field, though do clear up behind you, of course."},{"s":131.74,"e":138.65,"t":"Or if you'd prefer a covered picnic area, there's one near the farmyard, just after you cross the bridge."},{"s":139.22,"e":141.63,"t":"There's a covered picnic spot on the right."},{"s":142.97,"e":146.59,"t":"And the last thing to mention is Fiddy House itself."},{"s":147.51,"e":154.27,"t":"From here you can cross the bridge, then walk along the footpath through the field to the left of the farmyard."},{"s":155.1,"e":156.51,"t":"That goes to the house."},{"s":156.95,"e":159.29,"t":"and it'll give you a lovely view of it."},{"s":159.99,"e":166.85,"t":"It's certainly worth a few photographs, but as it's a private home, I'm afraid you can't go inside."},{"s":167.93,"e":172.35,"t":"Right, well if you're all ready, we'll set off on our tour of the farm."}]},{"n":10,"title":"box office, theatre manager's office, lighting box…","img":"img/l4/m10.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":219.4,"items":[{"p":"box office","a":"G","ps":26.14,"en":43.74,"si":5,"ev":"You're probably wondering why the box office isn't here… Although it's part of this building, it's next door, with a separate entrance from the road.","uz":"Kassa nega bu yerda emasligiga hayron bo'layotgandirsiz… U shu binoning qismi bo'lsa-da, yonida, yo'ldan alohida kirishi bor.","why":"Alohida kirishli (entrance) xona — G.","hl":"box office"},{"p":"theatre manager's office","a":"D","ps":45.14,"en":56.99,"si":8,"ev":"For the Theatre Manager's office, you go across the foyer and through the double doors, turn right, and it's the room at the end of the corridor, with the door on the left.","uz":"Teatr menejeri xonasi uchun foyedan o'tib, qo'sh eshikdan kirasiz, o'ngga burilasiz — yo'lak oxiridagi, eshigi chapda bo'lgan xona.","why":"Qo'sh eshik → o'ng → yo'lak oxiri — D.","hl":"Theatre Manager's office"},{"p":"lighting box","a":"B","ps":67.03,"en":78.53,"si":13,"ev":"When you're through the double doors, turn left, turn right at the water cooler, and right again at the end. It's the second room along that corridor.","uz":"Qo'sh eshikdan o'tgach chapga, suv sovutgichdan o'ngga va oxirida yana o'ngga buriling. O'sha yo'lakdagi ikkinchi xona.","why":"Orqa tomondagi yo'lak, ikkinchi xona — B.","hl":null},{"p":"artistic director's office","a":"F","ps":86.52,"en":95.93,"si":20,"ev":"The artistic director's office is through the double doors, turn right, and it's the first room you come to on the right-hand side.","uz":"Badiiy rahbar xonasi — qo'sh eshikdan o'ngga burilgandagi o'ng tomondagi birinchi xona.","why":"Qo'sh eshikdan o'ngga, birinchi xona — F.","hl":"artistic director's office"}],"segs":[{"s":4.18,"e":6.94,"t":"Now, a word about the layout of the building."},{"s":8.06,"e":13.47,"t":"The auditorium, stage and dressing rooms for the actors are all below ground level."},{"s":14.46,"e":18.97,"t":"Here on the ground floor, we have most of the rooms that the public doesn't see."},{"s":19.8,"e":21.53,"t":"The majority are internal."},{"s":21.98,"e":24.61,"t":"so they have windows in the roof to light them."},{"s":26.14,"e":33.92,"t":"Standing here in the foyer, you're probably wondering why the box office isn't here, where the public would expect to find it."},{"s":35.06,"e":37.85,"t":"Well, you might have noticed it on your way in."},{"s":38.52,"e":43.74,"t":"Although it's part of this building, it's next door, with a separate entrance from the road."},{"s":45.14,"e":50.91,"t":"For the Theatre Manager's office, you go across the foyer and through the double doors."},{"s":51.58,"e":52.38,"t":"turn right"},{"s":52.82,"e":56.99,"t":"And it's the room at the end of the corridor, with the door on the left."},{"s":59.06,"e":63.42,"t":"The lighting box is where the computerised stage lighting is operated."},{"s":64.02,"e":65.76,"t":"and it's at the back of the building."},{"s":67.03,"e":68.93,"t":"When you're through the double doors"},{"s":69.5,"e":70.27,"t":"left"},{"s":71.0,"e":72.8,"t":"turn right at the water cooler."},{"s":73.43,"e":75.17,"t":"and write again at the end."},{"s":76.28,"e":78.53,"t":"It's the second room along that corridor."},{"s":79.9,"e":82.81,"t":"The lighting box has a window into the auditorium."},{"s":83.29,"e":84.96,"t":"which, of course, is below us."},{"s":86.52,"e":90.3,"t":"The artistic director's office is through the double doors."},{"s":90.97,"e":91.74,"t":"turn right"},{"s":92.34,"e":95.93,"t":"and it's the first room you come to on the right-hand side."},{"s":97.3,"e":98.97,"t":"And finally, for the moment..."},{"s":99.58,"e":102.88,"t":"The room where I'll take you next. The relaxation room."},{"s":103.96,"e":105.89,"t":"So, if you'd like to come with me..."}]},{"n":11,"title":"restaurant, café, baby-changing facilities…","img":"img/l4/m11.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":226.1,"items":[{"p":"restaurant","a":"F","ps":35.61,"en":48.0,"si":4,"ev":"Go straight ahead to the far side of the sitting area. Then turn right into the corridor. You'll see the door of the restaurant facing you.","uz":"O'tirish joyining narigi tomoniga to'g'ri boring. Keyin o'ngga, yo'lakka buriling. Restoran eshigi ro'parangizda bo'ladi.","why":"Yo'lak oxirida ro'parada — F.","hl":"restaurant"},{"p":"café","a":"H","ps":55.9,"en":65.41,"si":8,"ev":"You'll need to go straight ahead, turn right into the corridor and the café is immediately on the right.","uz":"To'g'ri borib, o'ngga yo'lakka burilasiz — kafe darhol o'ng tomonda.","why":"Yo'lakdagi o'ngdagi birinchi xona — H.","hl":"café"},{"p":"baby-changing facilities","a":"C","ps":68.22,"en":80.41,"si":11,"ev":"There are baby-changing facilities downstairs, across the sitting area. Continue straight ahead along the corridor on the left, and you'll find the facilities on the left-hand side.","uz":"Pastda chaqaloq yo'rgaklash xonasi bor — o'tirish joyidan o'tib, chapdagi yo'lak bo'ylab to'g'ri boring, chap tomonda.","why":"Chapdagi yo'lak, chap tomon — C.","hl":"baby-changing facilities"},{"p":"cloakroom","a":"B","ps":82.33,"en":93.57,"si":15,"ev":"The cloakroom… is on the left-hand side of the sitting area. It's through the last door before you come to the corridor.","uz":"Kiyim ilgich xonasi o'tirish joyining chap tomonida — yo'lakka yetmasdan oxirgi eshik.","why":"Chap tomondagi oxirgi eshik — B.","hl":"cloakroom"},{"p":"toilets","a":"G","ps":94.58,"en":101.12,"si":17,"ev":"In the basement, they're the first rooms on the left when you get down there.","uz":"Yerto'lada ular pastga tushganda chapdagi birinchi xonalar.","why":"Zinadan tushganda chapdagi birinchi — G.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.31,"e":10.81,"t":"Okay, that was something about the collections and now here's some more practical information in case you need it."},{"s":11.77,"e":17.89,"t":"Most of the museum facilities are downstairs in the basement. So you go down the stairs here."},{"s":18.49,"e":28.45,"t":"When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you'll find yourself in a sitting area with comfortable chairs and sofas where you can have a rest before continuing your exploration of the museum."},{"s":29.75,"e":34.88,"t":"We have a very good restaurant which serves excellent food all day in a relaxing atmosphere."},{"s":35.61,"e":42.05,"t":"To reach it, when you get to the bottom of the stairs, go straight ahead to the far side of the sitting area."},{"s":42.71,"e":44.73,"t":"Then turn right into the corridor."},{"s":45.62,"e":48.0,"t":"you'll see the door of the restaurant facing you."},{"s":49.46,"e":55.33,"t":"If you just want a snack or if you'd like to eat somewhere with facilities for children, we also have a cafe."},{"s":55.9,"e":59.81,"t":"When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you'll need to go straight ahead."},{"s":60.41,"e":65.41,"t":"turn right into the corridor and the cafe is immediately on the right."},{"s":66.68,"e":67.77,"t":"and talking about children."},{"s":68.22,"e":70.91,"t":"There are baby-changing facilities downstairs."},{"s":71.51,"e":72.67,"t":"across the sitting area."},{"s":73.27,"e":76.48,"t":"Continue straight ahead along the corridor on the left."},{"s":76.98,"e":80.41,"t":"and you and your baby will find the facilities on the left-hand side."},{"s":82.33,"e":89.28,"t":"The cloak room, where you should leave coats, umbrellas, and any large bags, is on the left-hand side of the sitting area."},{"s":90.26,"e":93.57,"t":"It's through the last door before you come to the corridor."},{"s":94.58,"e":101.12,"t":"There are toilets on every floor, but in the basement, they're the first rooms on the left when you get down there."},{"s":101.94,"e":102.37,"t":"OK."},{"s":102.97,"e":108.22,"t":"Now, if you've got anything to leave in the cloakroom, please do that now and then we'll start our tour."}]},{"n":12,"title":"The Reynolds House, The Thumb, The Museum…","img":"img/l4/m12.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":223.3,"items":[{"p":"The Reynolds House","a":"H","ps":16.89,"en":27.42,"si":3,"ev":"The Reynolds House… It's on the north side of Crawley Road, next to the footpath that leads to the public gardens.","uz":"Reynolds uyi… Crawley yo'lining shimoliy tomonida, jamoat bog'iga olib boradigan yo'lak yonida.","why":"Crawley Road shimoli, bog' yo'lagi yonida — H.","hl":"The Reynolds House"},{"p":"The Thumb","a":"C","ps":32.15,"en":40.48,"si":6,"ev":"The Thumb… You'll see it on Hill Road, across the road from the bank.","uz":"\"Bosh barmoq\" haykali… Uni Hill yo'lida, bankning ro'parasida ko'rasiz.","why":"Bank qarshisi, Hill Road — C. (A — bank yonida, tuzoq)","hl":"The Thumb"},{"p":"The Museum","a":"F","ps":45.82,"en":55.55,"si":9,"ev":"It's on the east side of the Sheepmarket on City Road… immediately facing the junction with Hill Road.","uz":"U Sheepmarketning sharqiy tomonida, City yo'lida… Hill yo'li bilan kesishmaning roppa-rosa qarshisida.","why":"City Road sharqi, Hill Road chorrahasi qarshisi — F.","hl":"the"},{"p":"The Contemporary Art Gallery","a":"G","ps":56.98,"en":66.56,"si":11,"ev":"The Contemporary Art Gallery is on a little road that leads off Station Square… The road ends at the gallery.","uz":"Zamonaviy san'at galereyasi Station maydonidan chiqadigan kichik yo'lda… Yo'l galereyada tugaydi.","why":"Station Square'dan chiqqan berk ko'cha — G.","hl":"The Contemporary Art Gallery"},{"p":"Nucleus","a":"B","ps":93.24,"en":103.87,"si":19,"ev":"East along Hill Road until you get to a small winding road turning off. Go up there and it's on your right.","uz":"Hill yo'li bo'ylab sharqqa, ajraladigan kichik egri yo'lgacha boring. U yerga ko'tarilsangiz, o'ng tomonda.","why":"Egri yo'l, o'ng tomon — B. (E — Warner Gallery, City Road yonida)","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.73,"e":8.83,"t":"The sheep market is one of the main centres for art and history in the whole of the country."},{"s":9.53,"e":12.29,"t":"If you look at our map, you'll see some of the main attractions there"},{"s":13.14,"e":16.09,"t":"Most visitors start from Crawley Road at the bottom of the map."},{"s":16.89,"e":21.18,"t":"The Reynolds House is one of the oldest houses in the city and is open to the public."},{"s":21.91,"e":27.42,"t":"It's on the north side of Crawley Road, next to the footpath that leads to the public gardens."},{"s":28.54,"e":31.61,"t":"The area is particularly interesting for its unusual sculptures."},{"s":32.15,"e":36.35,"t":"The thumb is just what its name suggests, but it's about 10 metres high."},{"s":37.05,"e":40.48,"t":"You'll see it on Hill Road, across the road from the bank."},{"s":41.62,"e":45.25,"t":"The museum's got a particularly fine collection of New Zealand landscapes."},{"s":45.82,"e":48.93,"t":"It's on the east side of the sheep market on City Road."},{"s":49.94,"e":55.55,"t":"It's on the other side of the road from the public gardens, immediately facing the junction with Hill Road."},{"s":56.98,"e":62.46,"t":"The Contemporary Art Gallery is on a little road that leads off Station Square, not far from the public gardens."},{"s":63.7,"e":66.56,"t":"The road ends at the gallery. It doesn't go anywhere else."},{"s":67.13,"e":69.5,"t":"That's open every day except Mondays."},{"s":71.03,"e":74.27,"t":"Warner Gallery specialises in 19th century art."},{"s":74.78,"e":81.05,"t":"It's on City Road, near the junction with Crawley Road, on the same side of the road as the public gardens."},{"s":81.53,"e":85.09,"t":"It's open on weekdays from 9 to 5 and entry is free."},{"s":86.52,"e":90.11,"t":"Finally, if you're interested in purchasing high quality artwork"},{"s":90.74,"e":92.48,"t":"The place to go is Nucleus."},{"s":93.24,"e":101.09,"t":"You need to go from Crawley Road, up through Station Square and east along Hill Road until you get to a small winding road turning off."},{"s":101.98,"e":103.87,"t":"Go up there and it's on your right."},{"s":104.63,"e":107.1,"t":"If you get to City Road, you've gone too far."}]},{"n":13,"title":"new traffic lights, pedestrian crossing, parking allowed…","img":"img/l4/m13.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":298.8,"items":[{"p":"new traffic lights","a":"E","ps":15.7,"en":30.56,"si":1,"ev":"We already have a set of traffic lights in the High Street at the junction with Station Road. But we're planning to have another set at the other end at the School Road junction.","uz":"High Street va Station Road kesishmasida svetofor bor. Lekin boshqa uchida, School Road kesishmasida yana bitta qo'ymoqchimiz.","why":"A — mavjud svetofor (tuzoq). Yangi — School Road chorrahasi, E.","hl":"lights"},{"p":"pedestrian crossing","a":"D","ps":45.27,"en":51.17,"si":5,"ev":"So we decided to locate it on the High Street crossing the road in front of the supermarket.","uz":"Shuning uchun uni High Streetda, supermarket oldida qilishga qaror qildik.","why":"High Street'dagi supermarket oldi — D. School Road — rad etilgan.","hl":"crossing"},{"p":"parking allowed","a":"B","ps":59.83,"en":71.93,"si":8,"ev":"At present parking isn't allowed on the High Street outside the library but we are going to change that and allow parking there.","uz":"Hozir High Streetda kutubxona oldida to'xtash mumkin emas, lekin buni o'zgartirib, ruxsat beramiz.","why":"Kutubxona (Library) oldi — B.","hl":"allowed"},{"p":"new disabled parking spaces","a":"C","ps":90.2,"en":105.82,"si":11,"ev":"We've got two new disabled parking spaces on the side road up towards the bank.","uz":"Bank tomon ko'tariladigan yon ko'chada nogironlar uchun ikkita yangi to'xtash joyi bo'ladi.","why":"Bank tomondagi yon ko'cha — C.","hl":"new disabled parking spaces"},{"p":"widened pavement","a":"H","ps":111.16,"en":122.08,"si":13,"ev":"We also plan to widen the pavement on School Road… on the bend just before you get to the school, on the same side of the road.","uz":"School Roaddagi piyodalar yo'lagini ham kengaytirmoqchimiz… maktabga yetmasdan, burilishda, maktab bilan bir tomonda.","why":"Maktabdan oldingi burilish — H.","hl":"pavement"}],"segs":[{"s":5.3,"e":14.94,"t":"Okay, so this slide shows a map of the central area of Granford with the High Street in the middle and School Road on the right."},{"s":15.7,"e":21.79,"t":"Now we already have a set of traffic lights in the high street at the junction with Station Road."},{"s":22.3,"e":30.56,"t":"But we're planning to have another set at the other end at the school road junction to regulate the flow of traffic along the high street."},{"s":31.64,"e":35.55,"t":"We've decided we definitely need a pedestrian crossing."},{"s":36.41,"e":44.7,"t":"We considered putting this on School Road just outside the school, but in the end we decided that could lead to a lot of traffic congestion."},{"s":45.27,"e":51.17,"t":"So we decided to locate it on the high street crossing the road in front of the supermarket."},{"s":51.61,"e":54.49,"t":"That's a very busy area so it should help things there."},{"s":55.61,"e":58.65,"t":"We are proposing some changes to parking."},{"s":59.83,"e":71.93,"t":"present parking isn't allowed on the High Street outside the library but we are going to change that and allow parking there but not at the other end of the High Street near School Road."},{"s":72.86,"e":80.89,"t":"There'll be a new 'No Parking' sign on School Road just by the entrance to the school forbidding parking for 25 metres."},{"s":81.78,"e":88.64,"t":"This should improve visibility for drivers and pedestrians, especially on the bend just to the north of the school."},{"s":90.2,"e":105.82,"t":"As far as disabled drivers are concerned, at present they have parking outside the supermarket, but lorries also use those spaces, so we've got two new disabled parking spaces on the side road up towards the bank."},{"s":106.42,"e":109.89,"t":"It's not ideal, but probably better than the present arrangement."},{"s":111.16,"e":114.94,"t":"We also plan to widen the pavement on School Road."},{"s":115.74,"e":122.08,"t":"We think we can manage to get an extra half metre on the bend just before you get to the school, on the same side of the road."},{"s":123.06,"e":133.34,"t":"Finally, we've introduced new restrictions on loading and unloading for the supermarket, so lorries will only be allowed to stop there before 8am."},{"s":134.1,"e":136.41,"t":"That's the supermarket on School Road."},{"s":137.14,"e":141.21,"t":"we kept to the existing arrangements with the high street supermarket."},{"s":142.17,"e":144.45,"t":"Okay, so that's about it."}]},{"n":14,"title":"starting point for walking the walls, bow and arrow displays, hunting birds display…","img":"img/l4/m14.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":246.5,"items":[{"p":"starting point for walking the walls","a":"H","ps":26.52,"en":38.72,"si":2,"ev":"The starting point is quite near the main entrance. Walk straight down the path until you get to the south gate and it's just there.","uz":"Boshlanish nuqtasi asosiy kirishga ancha yaqin. Yo'lak bo'ylab janubiy darvozagacha to'g'ri yuring — aynan o'sha yerda.","why":"Janubiy darvoza oldi — H. North Gate — tuzoq.","hl":"The"},{"p":"bow and arrow displays","a":"D","ps":50.97,"en":61.37,"si":6,"ev":"Take the first left after the main entrance and follow the path past the bridge. Then you'll see it in front of you at the end.","uz":"Asosiy kirishdan keyin birinchi chapga burilib, ko'prikdan o'tadigan yo'lak bo'ylab boring. Oxirida ro'parangizda ko'rasiz.","why":"Birinchi chap yo'lak, oxiri — D.","hl":"and"},{"p":"hunting birds display","a":"F","ps":70.04,"en":81.18,"si":9,"ev":"Turn right before you get there instead of going through it, you'll see it on your right, past the first tower.","uz":"Janubiy darvozaga yetmasdan o'ngga buriling — birinchi minoradan o'tgach, o'ng tomonda ko'rasiz.","why":"Darvozadan oldin o'ngga, minoradan keyin — F.","hl":null},{"p":"traditional dancing","a":"A","ps":88.47,"en":95.07,"si":12,"ev":"That's right at the other side of the castle from the entrance and over the bridge.","uz":"Bu qal'aning kirishga qarama-qarshi tomonida, ko'prikning narigi tarafida.","why":"Qal'aning narigi tomoni, daryo orti — A.","hl":null},{"p":"shop","a":"E","ps":98.81,"en":112.45,"si":14,"ev":"It's actually inside one of the towers… just take the first left after the main entrance, go down the path and take the first right.","uz":"U aslida minoralardan birining ichida… asosiy kirishdan keyin birinchi chapga, yo'lak bo'ylab borib, birinchi o'ngga buriling.","why":"Minora ichida, chapdan keyin o'ng — E.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.7,"e":15.29,"t":"Now, if you can take a look at your plans, you'll see Branly Castle has four towers joined together by a high wall with a river on two sides."},{"s":16.09,"e":25.31,"t":"Don't miss seeing the Great Hall. That's near the river in the main tower, the biggest one which was extended and redesigned in the 18th century."},{"s":26.52,"e":38.72,"t":"If you want to get a good view of the whole castle, you can walk around the walls. The starting point is quite near the main entrance. Walk straight down the path until you get to the south gate and it's just there."},{"s":39.22,"e":40.77,"t":"Don't go on to the North Gate."},{"s":41.3,"e":42.59,"t":"There's no way up from there"},{"s":44.02,"e":50.24,"t":"There will shortly be a show in which you can see archers displaying their skill with a bow and arrow."},{"s":50.97,"e":58.21,"t":"The quickest way to get there is to take the first left after the main entrance and follow the path past the bridge."},{"s":59.1,"e":61.37,"t":"Then you'll see it in front of you at the end."},{"s":62.65,"e":69.34,"t":"If you like animals, there's also a display of hunting birds, falcons and eagles and so on."},{"s":70.04,"e":73.95,"t":"If you go from the main entrance in the direction of the south gate,"},{"s":74.39,"e":81.18,"t":"But term right before you get there instead of going through it, you'll see it on your right, past the first tower."},{"s":82.65,"e":88.0,"t":"At 3pm there's a short performance of traditional dancing on the outdoor stage."},{"s":88.47,"e":95.07,"t":"That's right at the other side of the castle from the entrance and over the bridge. It's about 10 minutes walk or so."},{"s":96.12,"e":97.89,"t":"And finally, the shop."},{"s":98.81,"e":104.03,"t":"It's actually inside one of the towers, but the way in is from the outside."},{"s":104.47,"e":112.45,"t":"just take the first left after the main entrance, go down the path and take the first right. It's got some lovely gifts and souvenirs."},{"s":113.21,"e":115.55,"t":"Right, so we're just arriving."}]},{"n":15,"title":"statue of Diane Gosforth, wooden sculptures, playground…","img":"img/l4/m15.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":244.2,"items":[{"p":"statue of Diane Gosforth","a":"E","ps":25.59,"en":38.21,"si":6,"ev":"The statue of Diane Gosforth has been moved. It used to be close to the south gate, but it's now immediately to the north of the lily pond, almost in the centre of the park.","uz":"Diana Gosfort haykali ko'chirildi. Avval janubiy darvoza yaqinida edi, endi esa nilufar hovuzining roppa-rosa shimolida, deyarli park markazida.","why":"Hovuzning shimoli — E. Janubiy darvoza (H) — eski joyi, tuzoq.","hl":"statue of Diane Gosforth"},{"p":"wooden sculptures","a":"C","ps":42.58,"en":50.59,"si":11,"ev":"A new area of wooden sculptures, which are on the riverbank where the path from the east gate makes a sharp bend.","uz":"Yog'och haykallar uchun yangi joy — sharqiy darvozadan kelgan yo'lak keskin burilgan daryo bo'yida.","why":"Daryo bo'yi, sharqiy yo'lak burilishi — C.","hl":"wooden sculptures"},{"p":"playground","a":"B","ps":56.92,"en":65.09,"si":13,"ev":"The playground has been enlarged and improved, and that's between the river and the path that leads from the pond to the river.","uz":"O'yin maydonchasi kengaytirildi, u daryo bilan hovuzdan daryoga olib boradigan yo'lak orasida.","why":"Daryo va markaziy yo'lak orasi — B.","hl":"playground"},{"p":"tennis courts","a":"G","ps":83.8,"en":97.37,"si":19,"ev":"There have been tennis courts in the park for many years… They're still in the south-west corner of the park, where there's a right-angle bend in the path.","uz":"Parkda ko'p yillardan beri tennis kortlari bor… Ular hamon parkning janubi-g'arbiy burchagida, yo'lak to'g'ri burchak hosil qilgan joyda.","why":"Janubi-g'arbiy burchak — G.","hl":"tennis courts"},{"p":"fitness area","a":"D","ps":98.65,"en":107.84,"si":24,"ev":"The new fitness area. This is right next to the lily pond on the same side as the west gate.","uz":"Yangi fitnes maydoni — nilufar hovuzining yonginasida, g'arbiy darvoza tomonida.","why":"Hovuzning g'arbi — D.","hl":"fitness area"}],"segs":[{"s":4.79,"e":5.15,"t":"Okay."},{"s":5.62,"e":11.74,"t":"Let me tell you about some of the changes that have been made and some things that have been retained."},{"s":12.57,"e":14.17,"t":"If you look at this map..."},{"s":14.65,"e":16.86,"t":"You'll see the familiar outline of the park."},{"s":17.5,"e":20.41,"t":"with the river forming the northern boundary."},{"s":21.05,"e":24.64,"t":"and a gate in each of the other three walls."},{"s":25.59,"e":28.67,"t":"The statue of Diane Gosforth has been moved."},{"s":29.53,"e":31.81,"t":"It used to be close to the south gate."},{"s":32.57,"e":35.9,"t":"but it's now immediately to the north of the lily pond."},{"s":36.57,"e":38.21,"t":"almost in the centre of the park."},{"s":38.74,"e":40.67,"t":"which makes it much more visible."},{"s":42.58,"e":50.59,"t":"There's a new area of wooden sculptures, which are on the riverbank where the path from the east gate makes a sharp bend."},{"s":52.34,"e":55.77,"t":"There are two areas that are particularly intended for children."},{"s":56.92,"e":59.58,"t":"playground has been enlarged and improved."},{"s":60.09,"e":65.09,"t":"and that's between the river and the path that leads from the pond to the river."},{"s":67.26,"e":73.57,"t":"Then there's a new maze, a circular series of paths separated by low hedges."},{"s":74.39,"e":76.25,"t":"near the West Gate."},{"s":77.21,"e":79.39,"t":"go north from there towards the river"},{"s":79.9,"e":82.08,"t":"and then turn left to reach it."},{"s":83.8,"e":86.78,"t":"There have been tennis courts in the park for many years."},{"s":87.26,"e":88.73,"t":"And they've been doubled."},{"s":89.24,"e":90.75,"t":"from 4 to 8."},{"s":91.83,"e":94.24,"t":"They're still in the southwest corner of the park."},{"s":94.9,"e":97.37,"t":"where there's a right angle bend in the path."},{"s":98.65,"e":102.49,"t":"Something else I'd like to mention is the new fitness area."},{"s":103.26,"e":107.84,"t":"This is right next to the lily pond on the same side as the west gate."},{"s":109.14,"e":109.53,"t":"now"},{"s":110.14,"e":111.77,"t":"As your all gardeners"},{"s":112.31,"e":116.06,"t":"I'm sure you'll like to hear about the plants that have been chosen for the plants."}]},{"n":16,"title":"café, toilets, formal gardens…","img":"img/l4/m16.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":296.3,"items":[{"p":"café","a":"D","ps":36.54,"en":47.2,"si":6,"ev":"The café… is still in the same place, looking out over the lake and next to the old museum.","uz":"Kafe… hamon o'sha joyda — ko'lga qaragan va eski muzey yonida.","why":"Old museum yonida — D.","hl":"café"},{"p":"toilets","a":"C","ps":48.66,"en":61.37,"si":9,"ev":"We're hoping to change the location of the toilets… as they're a bit out of the way at present, near the adventure playground, in the corner of your map.","uz":"Hojatxonalar joyini o'zgartirmoqchimiz… hozir ular biroz chekkada — sarguzasht maydonchasi yonida, xaritaning burchagida.","why":"Adventure playground yonida, burchak — C.","hl":"toilets"},{"p":"formal gardens","a":"G","ps":69.56,"en":83.49,"si":13,"ev":"They used to be behind the old museum. But we've now used the space near the south gate, between the park boundary and the path that goes past the lake.","uz":"Ular avval eski muzey ortida edi. Endi janubiy darvoza yaqinidagi, park chegarasi bilan ko'l yonidan o'tadigan yo'lak orasidagi joyni ishlatdik.","why":"Janubiy darvoza yaqini — G. Muzey ortidagi joy — eski, tuzoq.","hl":null},{"p":"outdoor gym","a":"H","ps":85.05,"en":99.65,"si":15,"ev":"We have a new outdoor gym… It's by the glass houses just to the right of the path from the south gate.","uz":"Yangi ochiq havodagi sport maydoni bor… u janubiy darvozadan kelgan yo'lakning o'ng tomonida, issiqxonalar yonida.","why":"Glass houses yonida — H.","hl":"outdoor gym"},{"p":"wild flowers","a":"E","ps":128.5,"en":144.54,"si":23,"ev":"A new area for wild flowers… It's on a bend in the path that goes round the east side of the lake, just south of the adventure playground.","uz":"Yovvoyi gullar uchun yangi joy… ko'lning sharqidan aylanib o'tadigan yo'lakning burilishida, sarguzasht maydonchasining janubida.","why":"Ko'l sharqidagi burilish — E.","hl":"wild flowers"}],"segs":[{"s":5.43,"e":9.92,"t":"As chair of the Town Council Subcommittee on Park Facilities"},{"s":10.55,"e":17.15,"t":"I'd like to bring you up to date on some of the changes that have been made recently to the Croft Valley Park."},{"s":18.17,"e":21.92,"t":"So if you could just take a look at the map I handed out."},{"s":22.55,"e":24.54,"t":"Let's begin with a general overview."},{"s":25.69,"e":29.82,"t":"So, the basic arrangement of the park hasn't changed."},{"s":30.39,"e":35.49,"t":"It still has two gates, north and south, and a lake in the middle."},{"s":36.54,"e":40.67,"t":"The cafe continues to serve an assortment of drinks and snacks."},{"s":41.18,"e":43.04,"t":"and is still in the same place."},{"s":43.51,"e":47.2,"t":"looking out over the lake and next to the old museum."},{"s":48.66,"e":51.93,"t":"We're hoping to change the location of the toilets."},{"s":52.54,"e":54.85,"t":"bring them nearer to the centre of the park."},{"s":55.42,"e":61.37,"t":"as they're a bit out of the way at present, near the adventure playground, in the corner of your map."},{"s":62.94,"e":68.8,"t":"The formal gardens have been replanted and should be at their best in a month or two."},{"s":69.56,"e":72.51,"t":"They used to be behind the old museum."},{"s":73.18,"e":83.49,"t":"But we've now used the space near the south gate, between the park boundary and the path that goes past the lake towards the old museum."},{"s":85.05,"e":89.37,"t":"We have a new outdoor gym for adults and children."},{"s":89.91,"e":92.29,"t":"which is already proving very popular."},{"s":93.3,"e":99.65,"t":"It's by the glass houses just to the right of the path from the south gate."},{"s":100.38,"e":104.16,"t":"You have to look for it as it's a bit hidden in the trees."},{"s":105.98,"e":110.94,"t":"One very successful introduction has been our skateboard ramp."},{"s":111.7,"e":115.77,"t":"It's in constant use during the evenings and holidays."},{"s":116.76,"e":119.04,"t":"It's near the old museum."},{"s":119.93,"e":126.75,"t":"the end of a little path that leads off from the main path between the lake and the museum."},{"s":128.5,"e":135.36,"t":"We've also introduced a new area for wild flowers to attract bees and butterflies."},{"s":136.34,"e":141.57,"t":"It's on a bend in the path that goes round the east side of the lake"},{"s":142.01,"e":144.54,"t":"just south of the adventure playground."}]},{"n":17,"title":"coffee room, warehouse, staff canteen…","img":"img/l4/m17.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":291.3,"items":[{"p":"coffee room","a":"H","ps":18.39,"en":27.23,"si":2,"ev":"There's a corridor running left from here and if you go along that, the door facing you at the end is the entrance to the coffee room.","uz":"Bu yerdan chapga yo'lak ketadi — uning oxirida ro'parangizdagi eshik qahva xonasining kirishi.","why":"Qabulxonadan chap yo'lak oxiri — H.","hl":"coffee room"},{"p":"warehouse","a":"C","ps":41.88,"en":56.54,"si":6,"ev":"Next to it is the warehouse… crossing to the far side of the courtyard and then the door is on your right.","uz":"Uning yonida ombor… hovlining narigi tomoniga o'tsangiz, eshik o'ng tomonda.","why":"Zavod yonidagi, hovli ortida — C.","hl":"warehouse"},{"p":"staff canteen","a":"G","ps":57.59,"en":63.58,"si":8,"ev":"Somewhere you'll be keen to find is the staff canteen. This is right next to reception.","uz":"Topishni xohlaydigan joyingiz — xodimlar oshxonasi. U qabulxonaning yonginasida.","why":"Reception yonida — G.","hl":"staff canteen"},{"p":"meeting room","a":"B","ps":85.3,"en":100.77,"si":11,"ev":"Walking along the corridor to the left of the courtyard and continuing along it to the end. The meeting room is the last one on the right.","uz":"Hovlining chap tomonidagi yo'lak bo'ylab oxirigacha boring. Majlislar xonasi o'ngdagi oxirgi xona.","why":"Chap yo'lak, o'ngdagi oxirgi — B.","hl":"meeting room"},{"p":"boardroom","a":"A","ps":119.99,"en":136.09,"si":15,"ev":"The boardroom… looks out onto the trees. Go along the corridor past the courtyard right to the end. The boardroom is on the left next to the factory.","uz":"Boshqaruv zali… daraxtlarga qaraydi. Hovlidan o'tib, yo'lak oxirigacha boring. Boshqaruv zali chapda, zavod yonida.","why":"Zavod yonida, chap, daraxtlar tomonda — A.","hl":"boardroom"}],"segs":[{"s":5.08,"e":10.33,"t":"Okay, now I'll briefly help you to orientate yourselves around the site."},{"s":10.87,"e":17.76,"t":"As you can see, we're in the reception area, which we try to make attractive and welcoming to visitors."},{"s":18.39,"e":27.23,"t":"There's a corridor running left from here and if you go along that, the door facing you at the end is the entrance to the coffee room."},{"s":27.8,"e":32.38,"t":"This looks out onto the main road on one side and some trees on the other."},{"s":32.89,"e":35.61,"t":"and that'll be where you meet each morning."},{"s":36.98,"e":41.41,"t":"The factory is the very big room on the far side of the site."},{"s":41.88,"e":49.02,"t":"Next to it is the warehouse which can be accessed by lorries going up the road to the turning area at the end."},{"s":49.75,"e":56.54,"t":"You can get to the warehouse by crossing to the far side of the courtyard and then the door is on your right."},{"s":57.59,"e":63.58,"t":"Somewhere you'll be keen to find is the Staff Canteen. This is right next to reception."},{"s":64.12,"e":80.13,"t":"I can confidently say that the food's very good, but the view isn't. The windows on one side look onto a corridor and courtyard, which aren't very attractive at all, and on the other onto the access road, which isn't much better."},{"s":81.53,"e":84.73,"t":"You'll be using the meeting room quite often."},{"s":85.3,"e":92.96,"t":"and you'll find it by walking along the corridor to the left of the courtyard and continuing along it to the end."},{"s":93.72,"e":100.77,"t":"The meeting room is the last one on the right and I'm afraid there's no natural daylight in the room."},{"s":101.98,"e":105.12,"t":"Then you'll need to know where some of the offices are."},{"s":105.66,"e":118.88,"t":"The Human Resources department is at the front of this building. So you head to the left along the corridor from reception and it's the second room you come to. It looks out onto the main road."},{"s":119.99,"e":128.16,"t":"And finally the board room where you'll be meeting sometimes that has quite a pleasant view as it looks out onto the trees."},{"s":128.6,"e":132.48,"t":"Go along the corridor past the courtyard right to the end."},{"s":132.98,"e":136.09,"t":"The boardroom is on the left next to the factory."},{"s":137.21,"e":140.35,"t":"Okay now, are there any questions before we move on?"}]},{"n":18,"title":"new car park, new cricket pitch, children's playground…","img":"img/l4/m18.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":255.0,"items":[{"p":"new car park","a":"C","ps":32.38,"en":46.59,"si":4,"ev":"We're suggesting a new car park on the opposite side of the community hall right next to it.","uz":"Jamoat zalining qarama-qarshi tomonida, uning yonginasida yangi avtoturargoh taklif qilyapmiz.","why":"Hozir mashinalar zal va daraxtlar orasida (G) — xavfli. Yangi — zalning narigi tomoni, C.","hl":"new car park"},{"p":"new cricket pitch","a":"F","ps":51.32,"en":65.05,"si":6,"ev":"Additional space to the east of the recreation ground, beyond the trees… into this new area beyond the line of trees.","uz":"Dam olish maydonining sharqida, daraxtlar ortida qo'shimcha joy… daraxtlar qatoridan naridagi yangi hududga.","why":"Daraxtlar sharqi — F.","hl":"new"},{"p":"children's playground","a":"A","ps":71.16,"en":78.75,"si":9,"ev":"A children's playground which will be accessible by a footpath from the community hall and will be alongside the river.","uz":"Bolalar maydonchasi jamoat zalidan yo'lak orqali boriladi va daryo bo'yida bo'ladi.","why":"Daryo bo'yi, yo'lak oxiri — A.","hl":"children's playground"},{"p":"pavilion","a":"E","ps":99.9,"en":109.53,"si":13,"ev":"The pavilion… will stay where it is now, to the left of the line of trees and near to the river.","uz":"Pavilon hozirgi joyida qoladi — daraxtlar qatorining chap tomonida, daryoga yaqin.","why":"Daraxtlar chapi, daryo yonida — E.","hl":"pavilion"},{"p":"notice board","a":"H","ps":113.69,"en":123.29,"si":16,"ev":"A new notice board… directly on people's right as they go from the road into the recreation ground.","uz":"Yangi e'lonlar taxtasi… yo'ldan maydonga kirganda darhol o'ng tomonda.","why":"Kirishning o'ngi — H.","hl":"notice board"}],"segs":[{"s":4.98,"e":10.49,"t":"So next on the agenda is proposals for improvements to the recreation ground."},{"s":11.16,"e":12.29,"t":"Councillor Thornton again."},{"s":13.27,"e":22.97,"t":"Well, since we managed to extend the recreation ground, we've spent some time talking to local people about how it could be made a more attractive and useful space."},{"s":23.58,"e":31.49,"t":"If you have a look at the map up on the screen, you can see the river up in the north and the community hall near the entrance from the road."},{"s":32.38,"e":46.59,"t":"present cars can park between the community hall and that line of trees to the east but this is quite dangerous for pedestrians so we're suggesting a new car park on the opposite side of the community hall right next to it."},{"s":47.86,"e":50.62,"t":"also have a new location for the cricket pitch."},{"s":51.32,"e":56.77,"t":"As we've now purchased additional space to the east of the recreation ground, beyond the trees,"},{"s":57.24,"e":65.05,"t":"We plan to move it away from its current location, which is rather near the road, into this new area beyond the line of trees."},{"s":65.75,"e":70.08,"t":"This means there's less danger of stray balls hitting cars or pedestrians."},{"s":71.16,"e":78.75,"t":"We've got plans for a children's playground which will be accessible by a footpath from the community hall and will be alongside the river."},{"s":79.38,"e":84.86,"t":"We'd originally thought of having it close to the road but we think this will be a more attractive location."},{"s":86.42,"e":91.1,"t":"The skateboard ramp is very popular with both younger and older children."},{"s":91.67,"e":98.72,"t":"We had considered moving this up towards the river but in the end we decided to have it in the south-east corner near the road."},{"s":99.9,"e":104.61,"t":"The pavilion is very well used at present by both football players and cricketers."},{"s":105.08,"e":109.53,"t":"It will stay where it is now, to the left of the line of trees and near to the river."},{"s":110.04,"e":112.61,"t":"for both the football and cricket pitches."},{"s":113.69,"e":123.29,"t":"And finally, we'll be getting a new notice board for local information and that will be directly on people's right as they go from the road into the recreation ground."}]},{"n":19,"title":"car park 3, changing rooms, first-aid centre…","img":"img/l4/m19.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":322.8,"items":[{"p":"car park 3","a":"E","ps":31.74,"en":46.3,"si":3,"ev":"See the large square-shaped area on the map? Car Park 3 is the top half of that square, just below the trees.","uz":"Xaritadagi katta kvadrat maydonni ko'ryapsizmi? 3-avtoturargoh — shu kvadratning yuqori yarmi, daraxtlar ostida.","why":"Kvadratning yuqori yarmi — E.","hl":"Car Park 3"},{"p":"changing rooms","a":"G","ps":61.75,"en":74.08,"si":9,"ev":"Immediately take the road that goes off left and aim for the building that looks a bit like a cross.","uz":"Darhol chapga ketadigan yo'lga buriling va xochga o'xshash bino tomon boring.","why":"Xoch shaklidagi bino — G. Yugurish yo'lagi yoni — eski joyi.","hl":null},{"p":"first-aid centre","a":"A","ps":77.08,"en":105.28,"si":11,"ev":"Keep straight on, so you're walking between the main field and the oval running track… the first-aid centre is just above those two locations and right below that little bridge.","uz":"To'g'ri yuring — asosiy maydon va oval yugurish yo'lagi orasidan… birinchi yordam markazi shu ikkisining tepasida, kichik ko'prikning ostida.","why":"Ko'prik ostida — A.","hl":"first-aid centre"},{"p":"café","a":"B","ps":106.9,"en":131.29,"si":13,"ev":"It's in that long narrow building near the northern end of Eastgate Road… you want the room with a view of the river, not of Eastgate Road.","uz":"U Eastgate yo'lining shimoliy uchidagi uzun tor binoda… sizga Eastgate yo'liga emas, daryoga qaragan xona kerak.","why":"Bino ikkiga bo'lingan: daryo tomoni — B, yo'l tomoni — C (tuzoq).","hl":null},{"p":"lifejackets","a":"F","ps":137.94,"en":150.21,"si":17,"ev":"The life jackets are kept in a small building near the boathouse… not far from Southgate Road.","uz":"Qutqaruv jiletlari qayiqxona yonidagi kichik binoda saqlanadi… Southgate yo'lidan uzoq emas.","why":"Boathouse yonidagi kichik bino — F.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.95,"e":8.7,"t":"Okay, let's have a look at a map of the athletic center."},{"s":9.21,"e":18.65,"t":"You can see South Gate Road along the bottom of the map going horizontally and there's East Gate Road on the right hand side going from the bottom up to the top of the map."},{"s":19.19,"e":31.29,"t":"And there's the main entrance, also there at the bottom of the map on Southgate Road. So, first of all, you'll need to know where to send other parents to park their cars. That'll be Car Park 3."},{"s":31.74,"e":38.97,"t":"Actually, there are several car parks at the centre on both sides of the main entrance. See the large square shaped area on the map?"},{"s":39.83,"e":46.3,"t":"Park 3 is the top half of that square, just below the trees. So please send parents over there."},{"s":46.9,"e":50.56,"t":"Now, the changing rooms. You'll need to know where to find them."},{"s":51.06,"e":53.28,"t":"I remember they used to be up near the running track."},{"s":53.72,"e":57.25,"t":"You can see the running track is that large oval area on the map."},{"s":57.72,"e":61.25,"t":"but the changing rooms are much more conveniently located now."},{"s":61.75,"e":74.08,"t":"All you have to do is come in through the main entrance, immediately take the road that goes off left and aim for the building that looks a bit like a cross. That's where the kids will be getting change for this year's Sports Day."},{"s":74.9,"e":76.57,"t":"Right, the first aid centre."},{"s":77.08,"e":97.47,"t":"Hopefully we won't be taking too many children there, but you do need to know where it is. So, if you're starting from the main entrance, the quickest route is to walk around the hall on the right-hand side. There's no path, so you'll be walking on the grass. Keep straight on, so you're walking between the main field and the oval running track."},{"s":98.01,"e":105.28,"t":"And then you can see on the map there that the first aid center is just above those two locations and right below that little bridge."},{"s":106.9,"e":117.21,"t":"The cafe is a bit of a walk from the main entrance. It's in that long narrow building, the one that's near the northern end of East Gate Road, and sort of above the oval running track."},{"s":117.91,"e":122.59,"t":"If you're walking from the hall, you'll probably want to cut through that line of trees to get up there."},{"s":123.19,"e":131.29,"t":"Anyway, you can see that that building is divided into two, and you want the room with a view of the river, not of Eastgate Road."},{"s":132.31,"e":137.5,"t":"Finally, when the kids go kayaking on the river, they'll all have to be wearing life jackets."},{"s":137.94,"e":141.6,"t":"The life jackets are kept in a small building near the boathouse."},{"s":142.1,"e":150.21,"t":"There's no actual road to the life jacket shed, but it's just a short walk from the boathouse. You can see it there, not far from Southgate Road."},{"s":150.65,"e":155.65,"t":"So make sure no one gets into a kayak without first getting themselves a life jacket."},{"s":156.28,"e":157.34,"t":"So the other thing"}]},{"n":20,"title":"men's locker room, café, women's locker room…","img":"img/l4/m20.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":518.3,"items":[{"p":"men's locker room","a":"D","ps":66.42,"en":73.05,"si":8,"ev":"After the crèche on the same side of the corridor is the male locker room with showers, spa and sauna.","uz":"Bolalar xonasidan keyin, yo'lakning o'sha tomonida dush, spa va saunali erkaklar kiyinish xonasi.","why":"Creche'dan keyingi xona — D.","hl":"room"},{"p":"café","a":"F","ps":73.78,"en":90.75,"si":9,"ev":"Opposite that on your left there's a staircase leading to the mezzanine floor… you'll also find a coffee shop and snack bar.","uz":"Uning qarshisida, chap tomonda antresolga olib chiqadigan zina… u yerda qahvaxona va gazakxona ham bor.","why":"Zina (stairs to mezzanine) tomondagi xona — F.","hl":null},{"p":"women's locker room","a":"G","ps":98.33,"en":116.8,"si":12,"ev":"The women's locker room… It's separated from the men's locker room by an office.","uz":"Ayollar kiyinish xonasi… erkaklar xonasidan bitta ofis bilan ajratilgan.","why":"D dan keyin ofis (H), keyin — G.","hl":"women's locker room"},{"p":"conference room","a":"B","ps":146.49,"en":153.15,"si":18,"ev":"Past the main hall on the same side, there is a conference room.","uz":"Asosiy zaldan o'tib, o'sha tomonda konferensiya xonasi bor.","why":"Main Hall'dan keyin — B.","hl":"conference room"},{"p":"pool shop","a":"A","ps":203.38,"en":217.98,"si":24,"ev":"Let's go through the turnstile ahead of us… in the Aquatic Centre. Turn left past the pool shop.","uz":"Oldimizdagi turniketdan o'tamiz… Akva-markazga. Chapga burilib, basseyn do'koni yonidan o'tamiz.","why":"Turniketdan keyin chapda — A. (C — turniket yonidagi boshqa xona)","hl":"pool shop"}],"segs":[{"s":4.6,"e":8.48,"t":"It's so nice to see so many people here on our open day."},{"s":9.08,"e":13.73,"t":"I hope you'll be impressed by what you see and that you'll all decide to join up."},{"s":14.49,"e":19.07,"t":"We have tried to cover all aspects of sport and fitness here at the centre."},{"s":19.64,"e":20.03,"t":"Well."},{"s":20.47,"e":21.85,"t":"Let's start, shall we?"},{"s":22.36,"e":47.48,"t":"As we're standing here at reception looking down the long corridor, you'll notice the car park on your left where most of you have parked asks you to reverse into the parking spaces for safety reasons. Also, this morning a couple of keen potential members rode their bikes right in through the door instead of leaving their bikes outside there on your right where the secure bike stands are."},{"s":48.63,"e":53.82,"t":"Um, you may be wondering why there are so many mothers arriving with little children."},{"s":54.42,"e":65.98,"t":"As we proceed, you'll see that this first room on your right is a creche where you can leave your little ones for up to two hours and they'll be expertly supervised while you work out."},{"s":66.42,"e":73.05,"t":"After the creche on the same side of the corridor is the male locker room with showers, spa and sauna."},{"s":73.78,"e":78.56,"t":"opposite that on your left there's a staircase leading to the mezzanine floor"},{"s":79.42,"e":90.75,"t":"You'll not only get a great view out over the playing fields, but you'll also find a coffee shop and snack bar selling a range of wholesome food and drinks, protein shakes, fruit smoothies, that kind of thing."},{"s":91.45,"e":97.12,"t":"We won't go up the stairs at this point. I'll give you some time later when you can explore at your leisure."},{"s":98.33,"e":109.21,"t":"Most of you in the group are women, so next let me point out the women's locker room, which has the same facilities as the men's, you know, things like showers, spa and sauna."},{"s":110.01,"e":116.8,"t":"It's separated from the men's locker room by an office, which the staff mainly use for administrative purposes."},{"s":117.53,"e":127.39,"t":"As we move on, on the same side of the corridor as the stairs, you'll see the entrance to the main hall, where they hold yoga classes, aerobics and so on."},{"s":128.15,"e":133.6,"t":"On the wall here there is a timetable of all group classes and it is updated regularly."},{"s":134.3,"e":139.1,"t":"Now, opposite the hall is the gymnasium itself. Go ahead, have a look."},{"s":139.67,"e":145.25,"t":"impressive isn't it very spacious light and airy with all the most modern equipment"},{"s":146.49,"e":153.15,"t":"As we continue down the corridor past the main hall on the same side, there is a conference room."},{"s":153.85,"e":162.72,"t":"This is mainly used when the centre is hosting a big sports event of some kind. It gives the officials a quiet place to gather and have meetings and so on."},{"s":163.7,"e":168.19,"t":"You'll have seen the 400-meter athletic strike on your way in beside the car park."},{"s":168.63,"e":171.58,"t":"We have some pretty big athletics conventions here."},{"s":172.06,"e":197.12,"t":"Well, after a strenuous workout, I bet there's nothing you'd like more than a swim in the aquatic complex. But first, these rooms on our right are all part of the sports medicine clinic where you have access to a doctor, physiotherapist, massage therapist, podiatrist, and even a sports psychologist if you need one. Of course, you'll need to make appointments, but if you have"},{"s":197.21,"e":202.33,"t":"Any questions? Just pop in and see the clinic receptionist and she'll help you out."},{"s":203.38,"e":206.4,"t":"Okay, let's go through the turnstile ahead of us."},{"s":207.42,"e":208.61,"t":"And here we are."},{"s":209.37,"e":210.69,"t":"in the Aquatic Centre."},{"s":211.86,"e":212.8,"t":"Turn left."},{"s":213.24,"e":217.98,"t":"past the pool shop where you can buy or hire goggles, swim caps and such like"},{"s":218.62,"e":221.34,"t":"And we're outside. Poolside."},{"s":221.94,"e":222.85,"t":"Beautiful, isn't it"},{"s":223.7,"e":238.3,"t":"especially on a day like today. Go on, dip your toes in the water and if that's not warm enough for you then I'll take you to the indoor pool which is less than half the size but heated to 32 degrees."},{"s":239.19,"e":243.45,"t":"Let's go back past the pool shop and through the double doors to the indoor pool."},{"s":244.79,"e":245.21,"t":"Well."},{"s":245.88,"e":247.81,"t":"That's all I have time to show you."},{"s":248.25,"e":255.07,"t":"Let's go back to the reception area and if you like we can run through some details about opening hours, membership and so on."}]},{"n":21,"title":"science museum, national history museum, car park…","img":"img/l4/m21.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":774.9,"items":[{"p":"science museum","a":"B","ps":76.73,"en":82.05,"si":7,"ev":"First off is my favourite, the Science Museum, which is on the corner of St George Road.","uz":"Birinchisi — mening sevimli joyim, Saint George yo'li burchagidagi Fan muzeyi.","why":"St George Road burchagi — B.","hl":"Science Museum"},{"p":"national history museum","a":"A","ps":93.43,"en":103.81,"si":10,"ev":"Just west of the Science Museum is the National History Museum.","uz":"Fan muzeyining g'arbida Milliy tarix muzeyi joylashgan.","why":"B ning g'arbi — A.","hl":"National History Museum"},{"p":"car park","a":"E","ps":110.78,"en":117.73,"si":12,"ev":"Parking… is available on the intersection of Queen Street and South King Street in the car park.","uz":"Avtoturargoh Queen Street va South King Street kesishmasida.","why":"Queen St va South King St orasi — E. (F — ko'cha kesishmasi belgisi, tuzoq)","hl":"car park"},{"p":"shopping mall","a":"C","ps":122.01,"en":134.27,"si":14,"ev":"The shopping mall… You can get there from the tube or the entrance on Timber Road, just south of Cornwell Road.","uz":"Savdo markazi… unga metrodan yoki Cornwell yo'lining janubidagi Timber Road kirishidan borish mumkin.","why":"Underground va Timber Road yonida — C.","hl":"shopping mall"},{"p":"primary school","a":"D","ps":135.03,"en":141.15,"si":16,"ev":"The primary school across the street from the shopping mall.","uz":"Savdo markazining ko'chaning narigi tomonidagi boshlang'ich maktab.","why":"C ning qarshisi, Timber Road ostida — D.","hl":"primary school"}],"segs":[{"s":4.98,"e":5.85,"t":"Section 2."},{"s":7.03,"e":12.22,"t":"You will hear a talk about the main points of interest and the improvements made in the area."},{"s":13.21,"e":17.92,"t":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15."},{"s":47.86,"e":52.06,"t":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15."},{"s":55.29,"e":57.92,"t":"Thank you all for coming to our community meeting."},{"s":58.39,"e":65.18,"t":"As you know, we're excited to unveil our improvement plan as we look forward to the influx of tourists in the summer months."},{"s":65.69,"e":75.84,"t":"I'll start with a quick overview of the main points of interest in the area for anyone who may not quite know his or her way around yet, and then I'll get to the improvements made."},{"s":76.73,"e":82.05,"t":"First off is my favourite, the Science Museum, which is on the corner of St George Road."},{"s":82.62,"e":86.75,"t":"If you have not visited yet, I encourage you to go before the busy season."},{"s":87.32,"e":92.35,"t":"It is absolutely spectacular. There is even a flight simulator you can try out."},{"s":93.43,"e":103.81,"t":"Just west of the Science Museum is the National History Museum. It's a site not to be missed as well, with each floor devoted to a different era in our nation's history."},{"s":104.28,"e":109.73,"t":"There are special exhibits for children with interactive games and fun history lessons too."},{"s":110.78,"e":117.73,"t":"If you're looking for parking, it is available on the intersection of Queen Street and South King Street in the car park."},{"s":118.49,"e":121.28,"t":"Standard hourly and daily rates do apply."},{"s":122.01,"e":127.77,"t":"The best place for souvenirs is the shopping mall, though it gets extremely busy during peak times."},{"s":128.38,"e":134.27,"t":"You can get there from the tube or the entrance on Timber Road, just south of Cornwell Road."},{"s":135.03,"e":141.15,"t":"This area has students everywhere, usually from the primary school across the street from the shopping mall."},{"s":141.59,"e":146.27,"t":"Classes often take field trips and engage in guided tours through the area."},{"s":146.74,"e":152.77,"t":"So that's the overview of the main sites, and hopefully by now I've given you a general idea of the area."},{"s":155.77,"e":161.41,"t":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20."},{"s":181.4,"e":184.57,"t":"Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20."},{"s":188.31,"e":196.57,"t":"Now I'm going to outline the improvements we have made in our efforts to make the experience even better for each and every one of our visitors."},{"s":197.85,"e":205.28,"t":"You probably noticed when you first drove into the car park this morning that there is now additional signage to help avoid confusion."},{"s":206.01,"e":214.24,"t":"The directions were not entirely clear at first, so we have increased the number of one-way signs indicating the correct direction of traffic flow."},{"s":214.9,"e":222.65,"t":"Not far from there, in line with our mission of giving back to the community, we constructed a brand new playground for the primary school."},{"s":223.38,"e":232.73,"t":"It is really something to be excited for. The equipment is state of the art and includes swings, a small climbing wall and even an obstacle course."},{"s":233.82,"e":237.05,"t":"Now we'll head north and take a look at the Science Museum."},{"s":237.91,"e":253.92,"t":"In response to our feedback from past visitors to the museum, there is now free information available outlining not only upcoming IMAX showings, but also natural wonders like meteor showers, eclipses and other cool natural events."},{"s":255.42,"e":260.48,"t":"The Science Museum isn't the only museum improving the experience of its visitors."},{"s":261.3,"e":281.85,"t":"The National History Museum has added an entire new wing to its facility to accommodate the large crowds of people gathering to see the Civil War exhibit, Inventions Timeline exhibit and other wonderful sections of the museum. The increase in space will definitely give a more calm, comfortable experience for visitors."},{"s":283.06,"e":288.54,"t":"And finally, remember when there was actually a line at the mall entrance from the tube station?"},{"s":289.08,"e":295.1,"t":"It was terrible trying to get anywhere from the tube because foot traffic got so backed up sometimes."},{"s":295.96,"e":302.78,"t":"We have addressed that by adding another entry point into the mall from the other end of the platform to disperse the crowd."},{"s":304.18,"e":306.78,"t":"So those are the major improvements we have made."},{"s":307.45,"e":320.0,"t":"clearly having too many people that want to visit and enjoy what our community has to offer the public is a good problem to have, and I am confident that we have made the changes necessary to accommodate the growing interest in the area.\""},{"s":320.73,"e":326.24,"t":"As always, we welcome any questions, comments or concerns about the new improvement plan."},{"s":327.13,"e":336.19,"t":"In a few minutes I will open up the floor for questions, but you can also contact me or any other board member by email or through the city website."},{"s":336.89,"e":344.06,"t":"Thank you for coming, and I now encourage you to stay for the Questions and Answers panel occurring between now and 10.30."},{"s":347.03,"e":348.99,"t":"That is the end of section 2."},{"s":349.72,"e":352.61,"t":"You now have half a minute to check your answers."},{"s":382.78,"e":384.22,"t":"Turn to section 3."}]},{"n":22,"title":"Brown Hall, Blake Residence, Queens Building…","img":"img/l4/m22.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":235.3,"items":[{"p":"Brown Hall","a":"B","ps":12.98,"en":23.01,"si":1,"ev":"At the first junction, you'll find that Brown Hall is on the corner opposite the theatre.","uz":"Birinchi chorrahada Brown Hall teatr qarshisidagi burchakda.","why":"Teatr qarshisi — B.","hl":"Brown Hall"},{"p":"Blake Residence","a":"A","ps":31.0,"en":46.05,"si":3,"ev":"The same applies to Blake Residence, which is directly facing the junction to the university entrance.","uz":"Blake Residence ham shunday — u universitet kirishiga olib boradigan chorrahaning roppa-rosa qarshisida.","why":"Kirish chorrahasi qarshisi — A.","hl":"Blake Residence"},{"p":"Queens Building","a":"C","ps":46.74,"en":60.41,"si":4,"ev":"You'll see the library on the corner, and Queens Building is just past that as you head north.","uz":"Burchakda kutubxonani ko'rasiz, shimolga yurganda Queens Building undan sal narida.","why":"Kutubxonadan shimolda — C.","hl":"Queens Building"},{"p":"Parkway Flats","a":"E","ps":77.85,"en":87.01,"si":8,"ev":"The Parkway Flats are on the opposite corner to the library, facing the circle as you head towards the main buildings.","uz":"Parkway Flats kutubxonaning qarama-qarshi burchagida, asosiy binolarga borayotganda aylanaga qaragan.","why":"Kutubxona qarshisidagi burchak — E.","hl":"Parkway Flats"},{"p":"Temple Rise","a":"D","ps":100.34,"en":108.86,"si":10,"ev":"Temple Rise is inside the circle, next to the sports centre, but further from the main university buildings.","uz":"Temple Rise aylana ichida, sport markazi yonida, lekin asosiy binolardan uzoqroq.","why":"Aylana ichida, sport markazi yonida — D. (G — asosiy binolarga yaqin)","hl":"Temple Rise"}],"segs":[{"s":4.28,"e":12.51,"t":"Now, if I can just show on this wall map here where they all are, you might like to go and have a look round."},{"s":12.98,"e":23.01,"t":"If you come into the main university entrance at the first junction, you'll find that Brown Hall is on the corner opposite the theater."},{"s":23.74,"e":30.37,"t":"So you're nice and near the station here, though I think it can get a bit noisy with traffic."},{"s":31.0,"e":46.05,"t":"The same applies to Blake residence, which is directly facing the junction to the university entrance. These halls are often used by medical students and such like as they're out all day, so don't notice the noise."},{"s":46.74,"e":60.41,"t":"Anyway, if you then walk along campus road towards the main circle, you'll see the library on the corner, and Queen's Building is just past that as you head north."},{"s":61.18,"e":66.01,"t":"You will find that it is quieter here and you may get fewer visitors."},{"s":66.65,"e":74.62,"t":"By the way, the circle is quite a feature of the campus, as it's set into the hills and has a brand new sports center in the middle."},{"s":75.13,"e":76.89,"t":"It's worth going to look around it."},{"s":77.85,"e":87.01,"t":"Now, the parkway flats are on the opposite corner to the library, facing the circle as you head towards the main buildings."},{"s":87.96,"e":99.23,"t":"The main buildings are only about a five minute walk from here and places in these halls go quickly so my advice is to reserve your place as soon as possible."},{"s":100.34,"e":108.86,"t":"Then Temple Rise is inside the circle, next to the sports center, but further from the main university buildings."},{"s":109.66,"e":112.06,"t":"Now, if you'd like to go off and physically"}]},{"n":23,"title":"pizza, electric vehicle charging station, town hall…","img":"img/l4/m23.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":292.3,"items":[{"p":"pizza","a":"B","ps":47.26,"en":55.29,"si":8,"ev":"There are three stalls in the plaza near the water feature. The one in the middle is a pizzeria.","uz":"Maydonda favvora yaqinida uchta do'kon bor. O'rtadagisi — pitsatsexona.","why":"A, B, C ning o'rtasi — B.","hl":null},{"p":"electric vehicle charging station","a":"E","ps":67.7,"en":78.91,"si":12,"ev":"When you take a right from Pound Lane towards First Avenue, first you will see a sports shop. Past the sports shop is the charging station for electric vehicles before you get to the gas station.","uz":"Pound Lane'dan First Avenue tomon o'ngga burilganda avval sport do'koni. Undan keyin, yoqilg'i quyish shoxobchasiga yetmasdan elektromobil quvvatlash stansiyasi.","why":"D — sport do'koni (tuzoq), keyin — E.","hl":"station"},{"p":"town hall","a":"G","ps":79.93,"en":85.79,"si":14,"ev":"Our town hall is in the north-eastern section of the map. It is just behind the central library.","uz":"Shahar hokimiyati xaritaning shimoli-sharqida, markaziy kutubxonaning ortida.","why":"Central Library ortida — G.","hl":"town hall"},{"p":"parking","a":"F","ps":92.66,"en":106.88,"si":17,"ev":"Adjacent to it is a car park… take the side road that goes towards east from Pound Lane in front of the supermarket. Go straight ahead and the road ends at the parking garage.","uz":"Uning yonida avtoturargoh… supermarket qarshisida Pound Lane'dan sharqqa ketadigan yon ko'chaga kiring. To'g'ri yursangiz, yo'l avtoturargohda tugaydi.","why":"Yon ko'cha oxiri — F.","hl":"parking"},{"p":"diner","a":"H","ps":116.89,"en":121.69,"si":20,"ev":"When you move north along Pound Lane, the diner is a little beyond the supermarket.","uz":"Pound Lane bo'ylab shimolga yursangiz, oshxona supermarketdan sal narida.","why":"Supermarketdan shimolda — H.","hl":"diner"}],"segs":[{"s":6.23,"e":6.65,"t":"Hello."},{"s":7.58,"e":12.86,"t":"My name is Marcus Lintmaker and I am going to give a brief overview of the layout of our town center."},{"s":13.91,"e":16.19,"t":"I see all of you have a copy of the map with you"},{"s":17.11,"e":24.13,"t":"As you can see, the town center is spread on either side of Pound Lane, which goes from north to south, here in the center of the map."},{"s":25.21,"e":31.2,"t":"First Avenue, which you can see at the southern side of the map, heads off east towards the financial district."},{"s":32.25,"e":35.2,"t":"Let me first tell you about the water feature in the town center."},{"s":36.15,"e":40.67,"t":"It is located inside a plaza, which is very popular among the residents of the town."},{"s":41.66,"e":46.37,"t":"It gets really crowded during lunchtime and the evenings as people come here to hang out."},{"s":47.26,"e":50.17,"t":"There are three stalls in the plaza near the water feature."},{"s":51.16,"e":55.29,"t":"The one in the middle is a pizzeria, and its pizzas are famous all over town."},{"s":56.31,"e":59.49,"t":"On First Avenue, there is the town's oldest gas station."},{"s":60.44,"e":66.81,"t":"Recently, they have installed an electric vehicle charging station as many residents in the town now drive Teslas."},{"s":67.7,"e":72.35,"t":"When you take a right from Pound Lane towards First Avenue, first you will see a sports shop."},{"s":73.62,"e":78.91,"t":"past the sports shop is the charging station for electric vehicles before you get to the gas station."},{"s":79.93,"e":82.94,"t":"Our town hall is in the northeastern section of the map."},{"s":83.93,"e":85.79,"t":"It is just behind the central library."},{"s":86.78,"e":91.68,"t":"The town council and several other public offices are located inside the town hall."},{"s":92.66,"e":96.35,"t":"adjacent to it is a car park and it is the only one in the town center."},{"s":97.34,"e":106.88,"t":"To reach it, you have to take the side road that goes towards east from Pound Lane in front of the supermarket. Go straight ahead and the road ends at the parking garage."},{"s":107.77,"e":115.9,"t":"Last but not the least, there is a lovely little diner in the town center which has been serving town folks for over 150 years called Dick's Diner."},{"s":116.89,"e":121.69,"t":"When you move north along the Pound Lane, the diner is a little beyond the supermarket."},{"s":122.58,"e":126.14,"t":"The place gets really busy on Sundays for its special brunch menu."},{"s":127.16,"e":132.22,"t":"Well, now that you have a general idea of our town center, you can go ahead and explore it on your own."},{"s":133.21,"e":139.23,"t":"Remember if you get lost, do not hesitate to ask any of the locals for directions. They are happy to help any visitor."},{"s":140.18,"e":142.69,"t":"or you can call me and I will come to pick you up."}]},{"n":24,"title":"student centre, police station, Victoria Park…","img":"img/l4/m24.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":146.1,"items":[{"p":"student centre","a":"C","ps":16.54,"en":23.29,"si":1,"ev":"Here in the Student Centre, we're just across London Road from the college's main campus, right on the corner of the High Street.","uz":"Talabalar markazida turibmiz — kollejning asosiy kampusidan London Road'ning narigi tomonida, High Street burchagida.","why":"London Road va High Street burchagi, Main Campus qarshisi — C.","hl":"Student Centre"},{"p":"police station","a":"F","ps":27.35,"en":36.57,"si":3,"ev":"The police station, which is a block away from the college at the corner of Park Lane and Sheep Street.","uz":"Politsiya bo'limi — kollejdan bir kvartal narida, Park Lane va Sheep Street burchagida.","why":"Park Lane va Sheep Street burchagi — F.","hl":"police station"},{"p":"Victoria Park","a":"B","ps":37.46,"en":53.21,"si":4,"ev":"Victoria Park, which is half a block east of the police station. The park extends to the north, past London Road.","uz":"Viktoriya parki politsiya bo'limidan yarim kvartal sharqda. Park shimolga, London Road'dan ham o'tib cho'zilgan.","why":"Daryo bo'yidagi katta hudud — B.","hl":"Victoria Park"},{"p":"public library","a":"G","ps":41.88,"en":53.21,"si":5,"ev":"The public library, which is located on Park Lane between the police station and the park.","uz":"Ommaviy kutubxona Park Lane'da, politsiya bo'limi va park o'rtasida.","why":"F va park orasi — G.","hl":"public library"},{"p":"Park Hotel","a":"E","ps":54.46,"en":57.05,"si":6,"ev":"Just north of the public library is the Park Hotel.","uz":"Ommaviy kutubxonaning shimolida Park mehmonxonasi.","why":"G ning shimoli — E.","hl":"Park Hotel"}],"segs":[{"s":3.67,"e":15.87,"t":"I know many of you have travelled quite a long way to join us to continue your studies here in Shipsbury. So you'll want to get acquainted with our town and find your way around, as Shipsbury will be your home for the next few months."},{"s":16.54,"e":23.29,"t":"Here in the Student Centre, we're just across London Road from the College's main campus, right on the corner of the High Street."},{"s":23.86,"e":26.88,"t":"If you haven't done so already, you'll need to register with the police."},{"s":27.35,"e":36.57,"t":"Be sure to take your passports and your letter from the college with you and present yourself at the police station, which is a block away from the college at the corner of Park Lane and Sheep Street."},{"s":37.46,"e":41.41,"t":"Be sure to check out Victoria Park, which is half a block east of the police station."},{"s":41.88,"e":53.21,"t":"The park extends to the north, past London Road and as far as Church Lane. You're likely to spend quite a bit of time in the public library which is located on Park Lane between the police station and the park."},{"s":54.46,"e":57.05,"t":"Just north of the public library is the Park Hotel."},{"s":57.78,"e":64.77,"t":"This is the finest hotel for miles around and does a very tasty, very traditional English tea on Sunday afternoons."},{"s":65.27,"e":67.93,"t":"you'll need to book ahead and it's well worth the price."}]},{"n":25,"title":"information board, children's playground, dog zone…","img":"img/l4/m25.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":210.7,"items":[{"p":"information board","a":"F","ps":20.76,"en":27.65,"si":3,"ev":"It used to be next to the tennis courts, but you'll find it now immediately to your left when you enter at the south gate.","uz":"Avval tennis kortlari yonida edi, endi janubiy darvozadan kirganingizda darhol chap tomoningizda.","why":"Janubiy darvozadan kirgandagi chap — F. H — eski joyi (tuzoq).","hl":null},{"p":"children's playground","a":"B","ps":39.93,"en":46.88,"si":6,"ev":"If you enter by the west gate, keep walking past the path to your left and it's just after the one to your right.","uz":"G'arbiy darvozadan kirsangiz, chapdagi yo'lakdan o'tib yuring — u o'ngdagi yo'lakdan keyin.","why":"G'arbdan kirib, o'ngdagi yo'lakdan keyin — B.","hl":null},{"p":"dog zone","a":"C","ps":57.94,"en":63.87,"si":9,"ev":"This is a fenced-off area to the south-west of the football field, basically in the centre of the park.","uz":"Bu futbol maydonining janubi-g'arbidagi o'ralgan hudud, aslida park markazida.","why":"Football field janubi-g'arbi — C.","hl":null},{"p":"fitness area","a":"E","ps":74.78,"en":91.61,"si":12,"ev":"This used to be just inside the south gate, but you'll now find it between the pond and the west gate.","uz":"Avval janubiy darvoza ichkarisida edi, endi uni hovuz va g'arbiy darvoza orasida topasiz.","why":"Hovuz va g'arbiy darvoza orasi — E.","hl":null},{"p":"fountain","a":"A","ps":74.78,"en":97.79,"si":12,"ev":"The new fountain… From the west gate, walk along until you reach the first path and turn left there to reach it.","uz":"Yangi favvora… G'arbiy darvozadan birinchi yo'lakkacha yuring va chapga buriling.","why":"G'arbdan birinchi yo'lak, chap — A.","hl":"fountain"}],"segs":[{"s":5.02,"e":11.07,"t":"The slide we're looking at now shows Foster Park as it looks today, with the changes that have been made."},{"s":11.61,"e":16.0,"t":"You'll notice too that a lot of the original facilities are still here of course."},{"s":16.54,"e":20.19,"t":"We've kept all four gates, but we've moved the information board."},{"s":20.76,"e":27.65,"t":"It used to be next to the tennis courts, but you'll find it now immediately to your left when you enter at the south gate."},{"s":28.34,"e":36.06,"t":"Just like before, it has details about the park opening hours, local wildlife, and a little bit about the history of the area."},{"s":36.86,"e":39.49,"t":"A brand new edition is the Children's Playground."},{"s":39.93,"e":46.88,"t":"If you enter by the west gate, keep walking past the path to your left and it's just after the one to your right."},{"s":47.45,"e":52.03,"t":"Dogs are not permitted in that section, so children can play without any worries."},{"s":52.63,"e":57.47,"t":"For you dog owners, never fear. We have allocated an off-leash dog zone."},{"s":57.94,"e":63.87,"t":"This is an offenced off area to the southwest of the football field, basically in the center of the park."},{"s":64.57,"e":68.19,"t":"You'll also find plastic bags there to clean up after your pet."},{"s":68.86,"e":74.14,"t":"The tennis courts are in the same spot as always, but you'll notice that we've moved to the fitness area."},{"s":74.78,"e":91.61,"t":"This used to be just inside the south gate, but you'll now find it between the pond and the west gate. We think this is a much nicer spot to work out. One final thing I'd like to point out is the new fountain, a spectacular addition I'm sure you'll agree."},{"s":92.15,"e":97.79,"t":"From the west gate, walk along until you reach the first path and turn left there to reach it."},{"s":98.39,"e":102.49,"t":"As always, the park is open to the public 7 days a week and we are..."}]},{"n":26,"title":"gift shop, restaurant, aquarium…","img":"img/l4/m26.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":184.3,"items":[{"p":"gift shop","a":"F","ps":21.5,"en":33.92,"si":4,"ev":"If you take the right-hand path you'll see the lake on your right and exactly opposite the lake on your left is the gift shop.","uz":"O'ng yo'lakdan borsangiz, ko'l o'ng tomonda, ko'lning roppa-rosa qarshisida, chapda sovg'alar do'koni.","why":"Ko'l qarshisi, chap — F.","hl":"gift shop"},{"p":"restaurant","a":"E","ps":40.7,"en":50.33,"si":6,"ev":"If you walk on past the lake, on your right, you'll also see the penguins. Go past the penguins and you'll come to the restaurant, also on your right.","uz":"Ko'ldan o'tib yursangiz, o'ngda pingvinlarni ko'rasiz. Pingvinlardan o'tsangiz, yana o'ngda restoran.","why":"Pingvinlardan keyin o'ngda — E.","hl":"restaurant"},{"p":"aquarium","a":"D","ps":50.94,"en":57.37,"si":8,"ev":"Don't go too far or you'll come to the aquarium. The aquarium is on your right at the crossroad.","uz":"Juda uzoq ketmang, aks holda akvariumga yetasiz. Akvarium chorrahada, o'ng tomonda.","why":"Chorrahadagi o'ng — D.","hl":"aquarium"},{"p":"lion enclosure","a":"C","ps":57.88,"en":62.24,"si":10,"ev":"And just over the crossroad, also on your right, is the lion enclosure.","uz":"Chorrahadan sal o'tib, yana o'ngda sherlar qo'rasi.","why":"Chorrahadan keyingi o'ng — C.","hl":"lion enclosure"},{"p":"picnic area","a":"A","ps":68.12,"en":77.02,"si":12,"ev":"You need to turn left at the crossroad and walk along a few metres. At the end of the path, you'll find the picnic area on your left.","uz":"Chorrahada chapga burilib, bir necha metr yuring. Yo'l oxirida, chapda piknik joyi.","why":"Chorrahadan chapga, yo'l oxiri — A.","hl":"picnic area"}],"segs":[{"s":5.11,"e":5.95,"t":"28."},{"s":6.39,"e":8.25,"t":"Unit 5. Listening."},{"s":8.7,"e":9.89,"t":"Exercise 5."},{"s":13.98,"e":20.77,"t":"Now, I'll just give you a few directions before you leave, especially for those of you who are feeling a bit hungry."},{"s":21.5,"e":33.92,"t":"When you leave the main building you come to an area where the path divides. If you take the right hand path you'll see the lake on your right and exactly opposite the lake on your left is the gift shop."},{"s":34.84,"e":39.84,"t":"Apart from selling gifts, it sells snacks, sandwiches and light drinks."},{"s":40.7,"e":45.18,"t":"If you walk on past the lake, on your right, you'll also see the penguins."},{"s":45.82,"e":50.33,"t":"Go past the penguins and you'll come to the restaurant, also on your right."},{"s":50.94,"e":53.63,"t":"Don't go too far or you'll come to the aquarium."},{"s":54.71,"e":57.37,"t":"Aquarium is on your right at the crossroad."},{"s":57.88,"e":62.24,"t":"And just over the crossroad, also on your right, is the Lion enclosure."},{"s":62.94,"e":67.49,"t":"If you're thinking of having a picnic, the best place to go is the picnic area."},{"s":68.12,"e":72.93,"t":"And for this, you need to turn left at the crossroad and walk along a few metres."},{"s":73.43,"e":77.02,"t":"At the end of the path, you'll find the picnic area on your left."},{"s":77.91,"e":85.73,"t":"Now, if you have any questions, I'd be happy to answer them and once again, I really hope you enjoy your visit. Thank you!"}]},{"n":27,"title":"workshops, swimming pool, theatre…","img":"img/l4/m27.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":332.6,"items":[{"p":"workshops","a":"C","ps":19.48,"en":28.48,"si":4,"ev":"On the other side of the entrance, there will be some workshops for local businesses.","uz":"Kirishning narigi tomonida mahalliy biznes uchun ustaxonalar bo'ladi.","why":"Kirishning o'ng tomoni (chapda — 15 block of flats) — C.","hl":"workshops"},{"p":"swimming pool","a":"D","ps":63.13,"en":70.24,"si":13,"ev":"Just here beside the pitches on the same side of the path will be an outdoor swimming pool.","uz":"Mana shu yerda, maydonlar yonida, yo'lakning o'sha tomonida ochiq basseyn bo'ladi.","why":"Sports Area yonida — D.","hl":"swimming pool"},{"p":"theatre","a":"B","ps":89.18,"en":107.45,"si":18,"ev":"Just here, below the walled garden, there will be a grassy amphitheatre with a permanent covered stage… We hope that local schools and colleges will use this theatre.","uz":"Mana shu yerda, devorli bog' ostida, doimiy yopiq sahnali o'tloq amfiteatr bo'ladi… Mahalliy maktab va kollejlar bu teatrdan foydalanadi deb umid qilamiz.","why":"Walled garden ostida — B.","hl":"theatre"},{"p":"play area","a":"F","ps":112.54,"en":118.3,"si":21,"ev":"You can see that above the block of flats there will be a play area for children.","uz":"Ko'p qavatli uylarning tepasida bolalar o'yin maydoni bo'ladi.","why":"Block of flats tepasi — F.","hl":"play area"},{"p":"café","a":"A","ps":142.9,"en":148.89,"si":26,"ev":"In the bottom right-hand corner of the park will be a café, opening on to Pear Street.","uz":"Parkning pastki o'ng burchagida Pear Street'ga ochiladigan kafe bo'ladi.","why":"Pastki o'ng burchak — A.","hl":"café"}],"segs":[{"s":4.82,"e":7.36,"t":"If we start here at the bottom..."},{"s":7.8,"e":12.45,"t":"You can see Parkside Street, where the main entrance to the park is."},{"s":13.46,"e":15.33,"t":"On the left of the entrance"},{"s":15.83,"e":18.69,"t":"in the bottom left-hand corner of the plan."},{"s":19.48,"e":22.53,"t":"there will be a block of 40 studio flats."},{"s":23.35,"e":28.48,"t":"On the other side of the entrance, there will be some workshops for local businesses."},{"s":29.75,"e":32.86,"t":"There will also be another entrance here."},{"s":33.3,"e":36.96,"t":"on the top right, which leads into Pear Street."},{"s":37.69,"e":39.84,"t":"Here, in the center of the park..."},{"s":40.38,"e":41.92,"t":"We will have an ornamental lake."},{"s":42.74,"e":48.73,"t":"radiating north, south, east and west to the different areas of the park."},{"s":49.78,"e":54.49,"t":"in the top right-hand corner just by the Pear Street entrance."},{"s":55.1,"e":62.24,"t":"There will be a large sports area with two football pitches and four tennis and volleyball courts."},{"s":63.13,"e":67.81,"t":"just here beside the pitches on the same side of the path."},{"s":68.31,"e":70.24,"t":"will be an outdoor swimming pool."},{"s":71.54,"e":74.3,"t":"Now, in the top left hand corner..."},{"s":74.9,"e":84.22,"t":"A walled flower garden is planned with a rockery and a water feature with walkways, seats and lots of shady areas for the summer."},{"s":85.62,"e":88.64,"t":"To this, a sculpture garden is also planned."},{"s":89.18,"e":100.86,"t":"Now let's see. Just here, below the walled garden, there will be a grassy amphitheatre with a permanent covered stage for open-air concerts."},{"s":101.5,"e":107.45,"t":"We hope that local schools and colleges will use this theatre to showcase student work."},{"s":109.11,"e":111.93,"t":"In the bottom left-hand corner of the plan..."},{"s":112.54,"e":118.3,"t":"You can see that above the block of flats there will be a play area for children."},{"s":118.78,"e":123.36,"t":"and directly to the right of this, just near the main entrance,"},{"s":123.8,"e":125.57,"t":"there will be a wild area."},{"s":126.42,"e":139.97,"t":"More trees will be planted here and in the middle will be built an educational centre for use by local schools to encourage children to take care of the wildlife and look after the trees and plants."},{"s":141.08,"e":142.27,"t":"And finally..."},{"s":142.9,"e":146.62,"t":"in the bottom right hand corner of the park will be a cafe."},{"s":147.38,"e":148.89,"t":"opening on to Pears Street."},{"s":150.26,"e":151.71,"t":"And now for questions."},{"s":152.82,"e":158.24,"t":"If anyone would like to ask anything, I and my colleagues are only too happy to oblige."},{"s":159.42,"e":161.85,"t":"Yes, the lady in the front row. If I could have--"}]},{"n":28,"title":"New Zealand birds, African village, picnic area…","img":"img/l4/m28.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":365.7,"items":[{"p":"New Zealand birds","a":"B","ps":41.11,"en":53.95,"si":5,"ev":"The walk passes the adventure playground and the otters in the first enclosure, and then arrives at the New Zealand birds area in the next enclosure.","uz":"Sayr sarguzasht maydonchasi va birinchi qo'radagi suvsarlar yonidan o'tib, keyingi qo'radagi Yangi Zelandiya qushlari hududiga yetadi.","why":"Adventure playground'dan keyingi qo'ra — B (NZ belgisi yonida).","hl":"New Zealand birds"},{"p":"African village","a":"G","ps":70.71,"en":79.26,"si":10,"ev":"Just turn to your right from the main entrance, walk past the first bus stop, and it's just before the African wild dogs' enclosure.","uz":"Asosiy kirishdan o'ngga buriling, birinchi avtobus bekatidan o'ting — Afrika yovvoyi itlari qo'rasidan sal oldin.","why":"O'ngga, birinchi bekatdan keyin — G.","hl":"African"},{"p":"picnic area","a":"E","ps":100.25,"en":106.24,"si":15,"ev":"Have lunch in the picnic area on the far eastern side of the park… you might catch sight of the ostriches on one side of you or buffalo on the other.","uz":"Parkning eng sharqiy chetidagi piknik joyida tushlik qiling… bir tomonda tuyaqushlarni, boshqa tomonda buyvollarni ko'rishingiz mumkin.","why":"Tuyaqushlar va buyvollar orasi, sharq — E.","hl":"picnic area"},{"p":"afternoon walkabout meeting place","a":"C","ps":116.47,"en":140.7,"si":17,"ev":"The African Lion Habitat, which is on the west side of the park… You'll see two bus stops, keep walking, and the meeting place is about half a kilometre after the second one.","uz":"Afrika sherlari makoni parkning g'arbida… Ikkita avtobus bekatini ko'rasiz, yurishda davom eting — uchrashuv joyi ikkinchisidan yarim kilometr keyin.","why":"Lion habitat'dan keyin, ikkinchi bekatdan so'ng — C. Zebra — o'tib ketgansiz (D).","hl":"place"},{"p":"Jomo's Cage","a":"H","ps":153.46,"en":165.95,"si":22,"ev":"The first one is at Jomo's Café, which is directly opposite where we're standing. Go straight ahead and it's just in front of the giraffes.","uz":"Birinchisi Jomo kafesida — biz turgan joyning roppa-rosa qarshisida. To'g'ri boring, u jirafalar oldida.","why":"Kirish qarshisi, jirafalar oldi — H.","hl":"Jomo's"}],"segs":[{"s":5.72,"e":8.19,"t":"So here's a plan of the park."},{"s":8.66,"e":14.49,"t":"As you can see, we're here at the main entrance and there's an information centre to your right."},{"s":15.0,"e":22.75,"t":"Now it's quite easy to get around the park. We have daily guided walkabout tours which let you get up close to the animals."},{"s":23.19,"e":30.14,"t":"Or if you prefer to be at a distance, you can take the safari bus and drive around with a wildlife expert."},{"s":31.03,"e":40.29,"t":"If you decide to take the Walkabout Tour, it leaves at 10.45, that's in just under an hour, from the meerkats enclosure next to us."},{"s":41.11,"e":53.95,"t":"From there, the walk passes the adventure playground and the otters in the first enclosure, and then arrives at the New Zealand birds area in the next enclosure just in time to see them being fed."},{"s":54.71,"e":59.87,"t":"Then you go on to the Reptile House and the Tigers and the rest of the animals."},{"s":60.82,"e":63.97,"t":"Alternatively, you can wait until the afternoon walk."},{"s":64.95,"e":67.23,"t":"plenty of other things to see in the morning."},{"s":67.67,"e":70.17,"t":"One of these is the African village."},{"s":70.71,"e":79.26,"t":"Just turn to your right from the main entrance, walk past the first bus stop, and it's just before the African wild dogs' enclosure."},{"s":80.22,"e":83.01,"t":"It's a wonderful, colorful experience."},{"s":84.15,"e":88.06,"t":"You can also go to the shop and buy your souvenirs there."},{"s":88.86,"e":93.21,"t":"Beautiful soft toys giraffe and zebra for children"},{"s":93.66,"e":99.23,"t":"and a whole range of t-shirts, hats and skincare products with an African theme."},{"s":100.25,"e":106.24,"t":"After that, why not have lunch in the picnic area on the far eastern side of the park?"},{"s":106.87,"e":114.94,"t":"I'd recommend this because while you're eating, you might catch sight of the ostriches on one side of you or buffalo on the other."},{"s":116.47,"e":127.42,"t":"Before the afternoon walkabout tour, you'll need to find your own way to the African Lion Habitat, which is on the west side of the park, just past the Conservation Centre."},{"s":128.38,"e":132.54,"t":"When you join the tour, you actually go past the lion habitat."},{"s":133.21,"e":140.7,"t":"You'll see two bus stops, keep walking, and the meeting place is about half a kilometre after the second one."},{"s":141.4,"e":144.54,"t":"If you've gone past the zebra, you've gone too far."},{"s":145.72,"e":152.54,"t":"For those of you who would prefer to travel on the safari bus, this runs from 10.30 to 4pm."},{"s":153.46,"e":161.63,"t":"There are stations throughout the park, but the first one is at Jomo's Cafe, which is directly opposite where we're standing."},{"s":162.17,"e":165.95,"t":"go straight ahead and it's just in front of the giraffes."},{"s":166.65,"e":172.54,"t":"There are various feeding times for the animals and the bus stops in time for all of these."},{"s":173.43,"e":176.83,"t":"So, let me just give you some safety guidelines."}]},{"n":29,"title":"administration office, café, student common room…","img":"img/l4/m29.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHIJK","dur":224.7,"items":[{"p":"administration office","a":"D","ps":24.09,"en":39.42,"si":3,"ev":"The Administration Office. To get there from the main hall, leave the hall by the door opposite reception, turn left and just follow the corridor to the end. The administration office is on your right.","uz":"Ma'muriyat xonasi. Asosiy zaldan qabulxona qarshisidagi eshikdan chiqing, chapga burilib, yo'lak oxirigacha boring. Ma'muriyat o'ng tomonda.","why":"Asosiy zal A; yo'lak oxiri, o'ngda — D. Sports Hall — undan narida.","hl":"Administration Office"},{"p":"café","a":"E","ps":52.66,"en":63.33,"si":9,"ev":"Walk along the corridor between the main hall and reception and turn right. The café is through the first door on your left.","uz":"Asosiy zal va qabulxona orasidagi yo'lak bo'ylab yurib, o'ngga buriling. Kafe chapdagi birinchi eshikda.","why":"Yo'lakdan o'ngga, chapdagi birinchi — E.","hl":"café"},{"p":"student common room","a":"K","ps":64.25,"en":68.83,"si":11,"ev":"Directly opposite the café on the same corridor is the Student Common Room.","uz":"O'sha yo'lakda kafening roppa-rosa qarshisida talabalar dam olish xonasi.","why":"E qarshisi — K.","hl":"Student Common Room"},{"p":"lockers","a":"C","ps":81.78,"en":85.85,"si":14,"ev":"These are next to the sports hall, opposite the administration office.","uz":"Ular sport zali yonida, ma'muriyat xonasi qarshisida.","why":"D qarshisi, Sports Hall yonida — C.","hl":null},{"p":"library","a":"B","ps":94.58,"en":106.72,"si":18,"ev":"Leave the main hall by the door… by the bicycle parking area, and walk to the end of the corridor. The library is through the door straight ahead of you.","uz":"Asosiy zaldan velosiped turargohi yonidagi eshik orqali chiqib, yo'lak oxirigacha boring. Kutubxona ro'parangizdagi eshik ortida.","why":"Yo'lak oxiridagi ro'para eshik — B.","hl":"library"}],"segs":[{"s":5.4,"e":11.97,"t":"OK, now we've got some students here from Bardwell College who have joined us for today's events."},{"s":12.54,"e":14.75,"t":"Hello to you all and welcome."},{"s":15.9,"e":23.36,"t":"Now, before our day begins, you'll need to get a guest badge, which you'll have to wear while you're on the college premises."},{"s":24.09,"e":26.65,"t":"You can get these from the Administration Office."},{"s":27.48,"e":32.06,"t":"To get there from the main hall, leave the hall by the door opposite reception."},{"s":32.57,"e":35.74,"t":"turn left and just follow the corridor to the end."},{"s":36.79,"e":39.42,"t":"The administration office is on your right."},{"s":40.12,"e":43.61,"t":"Don't go any further or you'll be in the sports hall."},{"s":44.79,"e":51.74,"t":"If you show your guest badge in the cafe, by the way, you'll get a 20% discount on drinks and sandwiches."},{"s":52.66,"e":59.52,"t":"To get there from the main hall, walk along the corridor between the main hall and reception and turn right."},{"s":60.31,"e":63.33,"t":"The cafe is through the first door on your left."},{"s":64.25,"e":68.83,"t":"Directly opposite the cafe on the same corridor is the Student Common Room."},{"s":69.37,"e":73.41,"t":"where you can go to relax and perhaps meet some of our own students."},{"s":74.94,"e":81.02,"t":"If you have any valuables that you don't want to carry around with you, I suggest you put these in a locker."},{"s":81.78,"e":83.74,"t":"These are next to the sports hall."},{"s":84.18,"e":85.85,"t":"opposite the administration office"},{"s":86.39,"e":91.45,"t":"You can get a key for a locker when you get your guest badge from the administration office."},{"s":92.22,"e":94.14,"t":"And if you want to use our library..."},{"s":94.58,"e":103.04,"t":"Leave the main hall by the door opposite the one you came in, that's the door by the bicycle parking area, and walk to the end of the corridor."},{"s":103.83,"e":106.72,"t":"The library is through the door straight ahead of you."}]},{"n":30,"title":"exhibition centre, coffee shop, art gallery…","img":"img/l4/m30.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":307.5,"items":[{"p":"exhibition centre","a":"D","ps":60.09,"en":71.33,"si":15,"ev":"Beyond the square, on Main Avenue, on your right, there are several restaurants. Opposite these on your left is an exhibition centre.","uz":"Maydondan narida, Main Avenue'da o'ng tomonda bir nechta restoran bor. Ularning qarshisida, chapda ko'rgazma markazi.","why":"Main Avenue, chap tomon (fontanga yaqin) — D. Kinoteatr — eski, tuzoq.","hl":"exhibition centre"},{"p":"coffee shop","a":"A","ps":87.58,"en":100.35,"si":23,"ev":"I suggest that we go to the one at the end of Main Avenue… It's right at the end, after you pass the art gallery on the right.","uz":"Main Avenue oxiridagi qahvaxonaga boraylik… U eng oxirida, o'ngdagi san'at galereyasidan o'tgach.","why":"Main Avenue oxiri — A. Fontan yonidagi va shimoldagi qahvaxonalar — tuzoq.","hl":null},{"p":"art gallery","a":"C","ps":95.7,"en":100.35,"si":25,"ev":"It's right at the end, after you pass the art gallery on the right.","uz":"U eng oxirida, o'ngdagi san'at galereyasidan o'tgach.","why":"Main Avenue, o'ng tomon, oxiridan oldin — C.","hl":"art gallery"},{"p":"shopping centre","a":"B","ps":106.97,"en":117.63,"si":29,"ev":"To get into the arena we just need to go through the shopping centre, which will be on our right once we go back down Main Avenue.","uz":"Arenaga kirish uchun savdo markazi orqali o'tish kerak — Main Avenue bo'ylab qaytganimizda u o'ng tomonda bo'ladi.","why":"Qaytishda o'ngda — B.","hl":"shopping centre"},{"p":"arena","a":"E","ps":118.84,"en":125.76,"si":31,"ev":"There's no other way to get there, as the arena is the other side of it.","uz":"Boshqa yo'l yo'q, chunki arena uning narigi tomonida.","why":"Savdo markazi ortida — E.","hl":"arena"}],"segs":[{"s":5.46,"e":6.43,"t":"Hi Jane"},{"s":6.94,"e":7.87,"t":"This is Tanya"},{"s":8.73,"e":12.38,"t":"I'm calling to make arrangements for the concert on Saturday."},{"s":13.5,"e":16.57,"t":"I can't believe you've never been to the arena before."},{"s":17.37,"e":19.45,"t":"I often go at the weekend."},{"s":20.82,"e":23.39,"t":"There isn't just the Arena concert venue."},{"s":23.9,"e":26.91,"t":"There are also lots of other things to do."},{"s":27.48,"e":31.17,"t":"Shopping Restaurants Exhibitions"},{"s":31.96,"e":34.62,"t":"I'm giving Melissa and Sarah a lift."},{"s":35.32,"e":39.26,"t":"So, shall we all meet up for a coffee before the concert?"},{"s":40.25,"e":41.63,"t":"give you directions."},{"s":42.81,"e":43.36,"t":"Okay."},{"s":43.8,"e":44.89,"t":"Listen carefully."},{"s":45.91,"e":52.32,"t":"As you walk through the main entrance, you come to a square with a big fountain in the middle."},{"s":53.02,"e":58.85,"t":"This is where people usually arrange to meet up and sometimes they have live music here."},{"s":60.09,"e":64.22,"t":"beyond the square, on Main Avenue, on your right."},{"s":64.66,"e":66.3,"t":"There are several restaurants."},{"s":67.26,"e":71.33,"t":"opposite these on your left is an exhibition centre."},{"s":71.96,"e":77.09,"t":"There used to be a cinema here, but they moved it when they finished building the arena."},{"s":78.23,"e":78.69,"t":"So,"},{"s":79.16,"e":81.31,"t":"There are several coffee shops to choose from."},{"s":81.98,"e":83.71,"t":"one near the fountain"},{"s":84.18,"e":86.81,"t":"and one in the north end of the building."},{"s":87.58,"e":91.77,"t":"I suggest that we go to the one at the end of Main Avenue."},{"s":92.22,"e":95.07,"t":"because it'll probably be less busy than the others."},{"s":95.7,"e":100.35,"t":"It's right at the end, after you pass the art gallery on the right."},{"s":101.53,"e":102.05,"t":"So"},{"s":102.49,"e":104.67,"t":"Shall we all meet there at 7 o'clock?"},{"s":105.91,"e":106.49,"t":"when"},{"s":106.97,"e":113.15,"t":"After we've had a coffee, to get into the arena we just need to go through the shopping centre."},{"s":113.59,"e":117.63,"t":"which will be on our right once we go back down Main Avenue."},{"s":118.84,"e":125.76,"t":"It can be a bit tempting, but there's no other way to get there, as the arena is the other side of it."},{"s":126.52,"e":130.59,"t":"Oh, and there are toilets beside the entrance if you need them."},{"s":131.42,"e":138.59,"t":"And then, after the concert, they open the door opposite and you can go straight out into the car park."},{"s":139.06,"e":140.8,"t":"which is very convenient."},{"s":142.14,"e":144.38,"t":"Let me know if you can make it for 7."},{"s":144.92,"e":147.81,"t":"I'm looking forward to seeing you. It's been a while."}]},{"n":31,"title":"ticket on sale here, barbecue area, tree tops challenge…","img":"img/l4/m31.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":439.5,"items":[{"p":"ticket on sale here","a":"B","ps":73.62,"en":85.79,"si":12,"ev":"The gift shop will be where tickets are on sale and therefore needs to be near the entrance… and the building on the left will be the gift shop.","uz":"Chiptalar sovg'alar do'konida sotiladi, shuning uchun u kirishga yaqin bo'lishi kerak… chapdagi bino — sovg'alar do'koni.","why":"Kirishdagi chapdagi bino — B.","hl":"here"},{"p":"barbecue area","a":"C","ps":96.18,"en":105.73,"si":17,"ev":"In the bottom right-hand corner of the picnic field, we're planning to have a barbecue area.","uz":"Piknik maydonining pastki o'ng burchagida barbekyu joyi rejalashtirilgan.","why":"Kafe ortidagi maydonning pastki o'ng burchagi — C.","hl":"barbecue area"},{"p":"tree tops challenge","a":"D","ps":113.43,"en":133.34,"si":20,"ev":"To the west of the gift shop is where the Tree Tops Challenge will take place. There's a path here winding through the forest.","uz":"Sovg'alar do'konining g'arbida \"Daraxt tepasi sinovi\" bo'ladi. Bu yerda o'rmon orasidan egri yo'lak o'tadi.","why":"G'arbdagi egri yo'lak — D.","hl":"Tree Tops Challenge"},{"p":"indoor play area","a":"F","ps":159.16,"en":167.17,"si":26,"ev":"The indoor play area only for the very young will be on the east side of the farm, near the café and just inside the picnic area.","uz":"Faqat kichkintoylar uchun yopiq o'yin joyi fermaning sharqida, kafe yonida, piknik maydoni ichkarisida.","why":"Kafe yaqini — F.","hl":"indoor play area"},{"p":"goats","a":"E","ps":192.73,"en":200.29,"si":31,"ev":"The sheep will be in this first area on the right here, directly opposite the pigs, and the goats will go at the very end there.","uz":"Qo'ylar o'ngdagi birinchi joyda, cho'chqalar qarshisida, echkilar esa eng oxirida.","why":"Yo'lak oxiri — E. G va H — qo'y va cho'chqalar.","hl":"goats"}],"segs":[{"s":5.53,"e":6.24,"t":"Good morning."},{"s":6.74,"e":15.58,"t":"I'd like to thank the Council for agreeing to this meeting and for welcoming us here today to explain to you our plans for Pinewood Centre."},{"s":16.34,"e":23.26,"t":"Our aim is to make Pinewoods a place where people of all ages can come and enjoy their free time."},{"s":24.12,"e":37.02,"t":"The centre will feature our Tree Tops Challenge only for the brave and fearless. For the less brave and for families with children, there will be adventure playgrounds indoor and outdoor."},{"s":37.5,"e":43.07,"t":"and a feeding area for farm animals and we will also offer cycle trails through the woods."},{"s":44.25,"e":47.1,"t":"I'll give you an overview of Pinewood's first."},{"s":47.54,"e":51.13,"t":"and then tell you more about each area in more detail."},{"s":52.09,"e":56.16,"t":"This first slide shows the overall layout of the centre."},{"s":56.6,"e":59.33,"t":"and where all the activities will be situated."},{"s":60.12,"e":61.63,"t":"As you can see from the map"},{"s":62.1,"e":65.6,"t":"The entrance to this attraction will be on the south side."},{"s":66.49,"e":72.93,"t":"As visitors enter from the car park, they will walk along this path leading them to the cafe and gift shop."},{"s":73.62,"e":78.91,"t":"The gift shop will be where tickets are on sale and therefore needs to be near the entrance."},{"s":79.8,"e":82.65,"t":"So this building here on the right will be the cafe."},{"s":83.19,"e":85.79,"t":"and the building on the left will be the gift shop."},{"s":86.62,"e":90.72,"t":"There will also be a picnic field behind the cafe for the warmer months."},{"s":91.42,"e":95.04,"t":"It's the area just to the right of the cafe as you look at the map."},{"s":96.18,"e":105.73,"t":"And in the bottom right hand corner of the picnic field, we're planning to have a barbecue area, where people can hire a barbecue and bring their own food to cook."},{"s":106.17,"e":107.71,"t":"It'll be great for parties.\""},{"s":108.6,"e":112.22,"t":"In summer we planned to have bands performing here in the evenings."},{"s":113.43,"e":117.79,"t":"To the west of the gift shop is where the 'Tree Tops Challenge' will take place."},{"s":118.42,"e":133.34,"t":"There's a path here winding through the forest and up in the trees there will be all sorts of high level adventure apparatus. Rope swings, awesome rope bridges and tunnels and zip wires where you can fly way above the forest floor."},{"s":134.2,"e":139.2,"t":"This adventure experience will only be open to those aged 15 and over."},{"s":140.41,"e":144.06,"t":"Beyond the treetops challenge, there will be an adventure playground."},{"s":144.76,"e":151.23,"t":"To get to it, you go along this path from the entrance until you reach the crossroads. Then you turn left."},{"s":152.06,"e":158.01,"t":"The young children's playground will have a fence around it, making it safer and keeping them away from the lake."},{"s":159.16,"e":167.17,"t":"The indoor play area only for the very young will be on the east side of the farm, near the cafe and just inside the picnic area."},{"s":168.25,"e":175.26,"t":"And finally, let's turn our attention back to this area here, where the paths meet and form a crossroads."},{"s":176.15,"e":183.13,"t":"This path leading to the east end of the farm will take our visitors to the area which houses the farm animals."},{"s":183.64,"e":187.49,"t":"Children will be able to watch the animals being fed and cared for."},{"s":188.25,"e":192.16,"t":"and in some instances they will be able to feed the animals themselves."},{"s":192.73,"e":200.29,"t":"The sheep will be in this first area on the right here, directly opposite the pigs, and the goats will go at the very end there."},{"s":201.08,"e":203.39,"t":"We haven't quite decided on the other areas yet."},{"s":204.76,"e":214.05,"t":"So those are our plans. We hope they will be approved and we look forward to welcoming you back in the not too distant future to see the final result."}]},{"n":32,"title":"sports field, recycling centre, tree house…","img":"img/l4/m32.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":243.6,"items":[{"p":"sports field","a":"D","ps":21.46,"en":33.95,"si":2,"ev":"To our left we have our sports field.","uz":"Chap tomonimizda sport maydonimiz.","why":"Kirishdan chapda — D.","hl":"sports field"},{"p":"recycling centre","a":"C","ps":21.46,"en":38.17,"si":2,"ev":"To our right we have the car park… The far end of the car park is our recycling centre.","uz":"O'ngimizda avtoturargoh… Avtoturargohning narigi chetida qayta ishlash markazi.","why":"Car park chekkasi — C.","hl":"recycling centre"},{"p":"tree house","a":"E","ps":45.72,"en":63.26,"si":5,"ev":"We do have the tree house in the middle of that area.","uz":"O'sha hududning o'rtasida daraxt uyi bor.","why":"Play area o'rtasi — E.","hl":"tree house"},{"p":"pond","a":"A","ps":69.59,"en":75.45,"si":7,"ev":"The vegetable patch is in the bottom corner and beyond it, hidden in the trees, we have a pond.","uz":"Sabzavot bog'i pastki burchakda, undan narida daraxtlar orasida yashiringan hovuz bor.","why":"Daraxtlar orasida — A.","hl":"pond"},{"p":"storyteller's chair","a":"F","ps":90.71,"en":100.8,"si":10,"ev":"In the middle of the garden we have what we call the Storyteller's Chair.","uz":"Bog'ning o'rtasida \"Ertakchi kursisi\" deb ataladigan joy bor.","why":"Secret garden o'rtasi — F. Wind turbine (B) — yuqori chap.","hl":"Storyteller's Chair"}],"segs":[{"s":4.73,"e":10.05,"t":"Now I'd just like to tell you some of the things to look out for as you go round the school site."},{"s":10.81,"e":20.64,"t":"present, we're standing just at the front entrance to the school facing north and as you can see the ground slopes up quite steeply behind the school."},{"s":21.46,"e":33.95,"t":"To our right we have the car park, okay? And to our left we have our sports field. This is just for training and informal games. We use the village football field for our under 11 matches."},{"s":35.0,"e":38.17,"t":"The far end of the car park is our recycling centre."},{"s":38.68,"e":44.73,"t":"This is for things like paper, glass and so on, and everyone is very welcome to make use of it."},{"s":45.72,"e":63.26,"t":"Immediately behind the school to the north, we have the play area. Unfortunately, we had to remove the play equipment, the climbing frame, and so on, because it didn't conform to safety regulations. But we do have the tree house in the middle of that area. That's very popular."},{"s":64.25,"e":69.02,"t":"Then, at the top end of the play area, you'll find the entrance to the secret garden."},{"s":69.59,"e":75.45,"t":"The vegetable patch is in the bottom corner and beyond it, hidden in the trees, we have a pond."},{"s":76.22,"e":85.34,"t":"The children love this because it attracts all sorts of wildlife, frogs, fish and lots of birds. I should just mention the trees."},{"s":85.85,"e":90.08,"t":"There are over 30 different species, all planted by the children."},{"s":90.71,"e":100.8,"t":"In the middle of the garden we have what we call the Storytellers Chair and this is where the children come with their teachers and sit on the grass to listen to stories."},{"s":101.69,"e":116.45,"t":"And finally, at the top end of the secret garden, to the left, is our wind turbine. And as you go round the classrooms, you'll find lots of work done by the children, explaining all about how it works and how proud they are of it."},{"s":117.24,"e":117.92,"t":"Right, now."}]},{"n":33,"title":"year 6 classroom, hall, extra hours facility…","img":"img/l4/m33.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":483.9,"items":[{"p":"year 6 classroom","a":"B","ps":51.9,"en":75.93,"si":11,"ev":"The new classrooms will be to the right of the entrance… So this one on the left of the two rooms will be the new Year 6 classroom.","uz":"Yangi sinfxonalar kirishning o'ng tomonida… Ikki xonaning chapdagisi — yangi 6-sinf xonasi.","why":"Ikki yangi xonaning chapi — B.","hl":"Year 6 classroom"},{"p":"hall","a":"D","ps":48.02,"en":62.85,"si":10,"ev":"I'll explain why the hall is marked on later.","uz":"Zal nega belgilanganini keyin tushuntiraman.","why":"Xaritada katta bino, asosiy bino yonida — D. Zal ikki tomondan kiriladi.","hl":"hall"},{"p":"extra hours facility","a":"C","ps":136.44,"en":151.71,"si":23,"ev":"The other new classroom, that's the one with the playground entrance here… its principal use will be for the pre-school and after-school clubs.","uz":"Ikkinchi yangi sinfxona — o'yin maydonchasidan kirishi bor xona… u asosan maktabgacha va darsdan keyingi to'garaklar uchun.","why":"Ikki xonaning o'ngi — C.","hl":null},{"p":"nursery","a":"G","ps":169.14,"en":180.99,"si":31,"ev":"The whole area on the other side of the main school building will be totally unaffected. The nursery will continue operating as it does now.","uz":"Asosiy bino ortidagi butun hudud o'zgarmaydi. Bog'cha avvalgidek ishlaydi.","why":"Asosiy binoning narigi tomoni (Farley Road) — G.","hl":"nursery"},{"p":"children's toilets","a":"F","ps":181.88,"en":216.35,"si":33,"ev":"Smaller constructions… down here on the other side of the top playground… The children's toilets will also be modernised.","uz":"Kichikroq qurilishlar… yuqori maydonchaning narigi tomonida… Bolalar hojatxonasi ham yangilanadi.","why":"Yuqori maydonchaning pastki tomoni, Wilson Street yonida — F. (E — velosiped turargohi)","hl":"children's toilets"}],"segs":[{"s":5.59,"e":8.35,"t":"Wait, can everyone see the plan now?"},{"s":9.11,"e":9.63,"t":"Good."},{"s":10.39,"e":16.83,"t":"Let's start at the Balfour Road entrance since that's where most of you come and go from."},{"s":17.62,"e":23.01,"t":"The Farley Road entrance and lower playground won't be affected at all."},{"s":23.8,"e":24.25,"t":"No."},{"s":24.79,"e":27.2,"t":"As you come into the top playground..."},{"s":27.64,"e":30.88,"t":"The two new classrooms will be on the right."},{"s":31.48,"e":36.09,"t":"There'll be a new gate and the steps down will be rebuilt."},{"s":36.86,"e":39.81,"t":"There'll be a ramp for disabled visitors too."},{"s":41.24,"e":46.94,"t":"On the plan here, only the parts of the building affected by the plans are shown."},{"s":48.02,"e":51.1,"t":"I'll explain why the hall is marked on later."},{"s":51.9,"e":62.85,"t":"So, as I said, the new classrooms will be to the right of the entrance and, as you can see, will take up very little of the playground space."},{"s":63.8,"e":69.15,"t":"We feel the year six children need their own area away from the younger children."},{"s":69.78,"e":75.93,"t":"So this one on the left of the two rooms will be the New Year 6 classroom."},{"s":76.95,"e":80.96,"t":"As you can see, there's no direct entrance from the playground."},{"s":81.94,"e":89.31,"t":"The plan is to include a small entrance area here from the playground for coats and boots and so on."},{"s":90.49,"e":93.66,"t":"Entrance to the classroom will be from that area."},{"s":94.78,"e":104.03,"t":"There will also be an additional entrance to the hall from this cloakroom so children will be able to get to the hall from two different directions."},{"s":104.73,"e":109.15,"t":"inside the main building and from the new entrance area."},{"s":109.85,"e":111.1,"t":"I hope that's clear."},{"s":112.15,"e":117.44,"t":"Now, as you all know, the hall doubles up as the cafeteria at lunchtime."},{"s":118.26,"e":125.18,"t":"One of the rumours I heard was that we're planning to dispense with the cafeteria and open up a snack bar."},{"s":126.01,"e":134.75,"t":"I can categorically state that replacing healthy school meals with a snack bar is not remotely in our thoughts."},{"s":136.44,"e":137.63,"t":"other new classroom"},{"s":138.26,"e":141.21,"t":"That's the one with the playground entrance here."},{"s":141.72,"e":144.64,"t":"is going to be an exciting new venture for us."},{"s":145.3,"e":151.71,"t":"That's because its principal use will be for the pre-school and after-school clubs."},{"s":152.47,"e":156.64,"t":"More and more parents want that facility outside school hours."},{"s":157.08,"e":160.8,"t":"And we need a dedicated space to run these activities."},{"s":161.72,"e":164.89,"t":"I think there were also worries about the nursery school."},{"s":165.37,"e":168.48,"t":"Though I'm not really sure why to be honest with you."},{"s":169.14,"e":176.86,"t":"I can tell you now that the whole area on the other side of the main school building will be totally unaffected."},{"s":177.53,"e":180.99,"t":"The nursery will continue operating as it does now."},{"s":181.88,"e":184.7,"t":"There will be a couple of smaller constructions"},{"s":185.14,"e":191.13,"t":"modernisation work really, down here on the other side of the top playground."},{"s":192.18,"e":195.45,"t":"Cycling into school is getting more and more popular."},{"s":195.9,"e":201.53,"t":"So we're replacing the old bike sheds with a brand new bicycle bay."},{"s":202.33,"e":204.41,"t":"There'll be space for 60 bikes."},{"s":205.4,"e":208.22,"t":"The children's toilets will also be modernised."},{"s":208.7,"e":216.35,"t":"and the children will be able to enter them from inside the school building rather than from the playground as they do now."},{"s":217.24,"e":222.24,"t":"There'll be brand new staff toilets in that part of the building too, I'm pleased to say."},{"s":223.35,"e":223.87,"t":"So"},{"s":224.47,"e":227.93,"t":"I hope that's at least started to allay a few fears."},{"s":228.5,"e":235.84,"t":"Take a few minutes to look at the plan, but I'll get out of the way. Then I'll answer a few questions if you have any."},{"s":236.44,"e":237.63,"t":"Does that make sense to you?"}]},{"n":34,"title":"luggage lockers, The Coffee House, cash machines…","img":"img/l4/m34.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHIJKL","dur":413.2,"items":[{"p":"luggage lockers","a":"E","ps":48.44,"en":64.45,"si":7,"ev":"When you come out of the baggage claim area you'll see a big clock… Turn right into Lobby East and you'll come to a sign to the car park on your left. There are some lockers just after that passageway.","uz":"Bagaj zonasidan chiqqaningizda katta soatni ko'rasiz… O'ngga, Lobby East'ga buriling — chapda avtoturargoh belgisini ko'rasiz. Shkafchalar o'sha yo'lakdan keyin.","why":"Car park yo'lagidan keyin — E.","hl":"lockers"},{"p":"The Coffee House","a":"I","ps":72.22,"en":95.1,"si":12,"ev":"If you go from the clock into Lobby West… The first two on the left are both cafés… I prefer the Coffee House… It's the first one you come to.","uz":"Soatdan Lobby West'ga borsangiz… chapdagi dastlabki ikkitasi kafe… men Coffee House'ni afzal ko'raman… u birinchisi.","why":"Ikki kafe: soatga yaqinroq birinchisi — I (H — mashhurroq ikkinchisi).","hl":"the Coffee House"},{"p":"cash machines","a":"J","ps":110.58,"en":133.79,"si":19,"ev":"There are several cash machines close together… from the clock into Lobby East, they're immediately to the right before the hotel.","uz":"Bir-biriga yaqin bir nechta bankomat bor… soatdan Lobby East'ga borganda, mehmonxonadan oldin darhol o'ngda.","why":"Hotel'dan oldin o'ngda — J.","hl":"cash machines"},{"p":"art gallery","a":"F","ps":113.94,"en":137.25,"si":20,"ev":"The exhibition space… It's at the end of Lobby West. You can see the entrance facing you as you walk along.","uz":"Ko'rgazma joyi… Lobby West oxirida. Yurganingizda kirishi ro'parangizda bo'ladi.","why":"Lobby West oxiri — F.","hl":null},{"p":"quiet lounge","a":"C","ps":182.1,"en":192.73,"si":32,"ev":"There's a quiet lounge… It's beside the main exit in Lobby East.","uz":"Sokin zal bor… u Lobby East'dagi asosiy chiqish yonida.","why":"Exit yonidagi Lobby East tomoni — C.","hl":"quiet lounge"}],"segs":[{"s":6.26,"e":17.31,"t":"Hello, Jean, it's Tom. Hello, Tom. Nice to hear from you. I'm looking forward to your visit. Me too. In fact, that's what I'm calling about."},{"s":18.07,"e":22.4,"t":"I booked my flight, so I can give you my arrival time now. Good."},{"s":23.35,"e":27.71,"t":"I'm due to land at 1520 on June 7th."},{"s":28.25,"e":32.35,"t":"but I expect you'll be at work, so don't worry about meeting me."},{"s":33.05,"e":40.19,"t":"Well, I can get to the airport a couple of hours later. So if you don't mind waiting, it won't be for very long."},{"s":40.66,"e":42.05,"t":"Okay, that's fine"},{"s":42.55,"e":47.49,"t":"You won't want to carry your suitcase around, so you might like to put it in a locker."},{"s":48.44,"e":54.14,"t":"When you come out of the baggage claim area you'll see a big clock just ahead of you."},{"s":54.78,"e":60.89,"t":"Turn right into lobby east and you'll come to assign to the car park on your left."},{"s":61.66,"e":64.45,"t":"There are some lockers just after that passageway."},{"s":65.08,"e":65.44,"t":"Good."},{"s":66.2,"e":71.17,"t":"I don't suppose there's much to do at the airport, but a cup of coffee would be nice."},{"s":72.22,"e":75.68,"t":"Well if you go from the clock into lobby west"},{"s":76.28,"e":79.26,"t":"You'll see various shops and things on both sides."},{"s":79.96,"e":95.1,"t":"The first two on the left are both cafes. The second one is more popular, but I prefer the coffee house. The staff are much friendlier and they serve better coffee. It's the first one you come to. Okay, I've made a note of that."},{"s":95.61,"e":98.33,"t":"Oh, but you'll need some local currency."},{"s":98.84,"e":100.7,"t":"Will you be bringing any with you?"},{"s":101.24,"e":106.21,"t":"I thought I'd draw some out when I arrive. I presume I can get some money at the airport."},{"s":109.4,"e":110.11,"t":"Yes."},{"s":110.58,"e":112.96,"t":"There are several cash machines closed together."},{"s":113.94,"e":133.79,"t":"Imagine you're going from the clock into Lobby East and they're immediately to the right before the hotel. Oh, right. You might like to go to the exhibition space. It's only small, but there are usually some interesting paintings by local artists. It's at the end of Lobby West."},{"s":134.33,"e":137.25,"t":"You can see the entrance facing you as you walk along."},{"s":137.78,"e":139.45,"t":"That sounds as though it's worth a visit."},{"s":140.12,"e":147.1,"t":"I'd also like to buy some CDs. Do you know if there's a store in the terminal? Yes, there were a couple."},{"s":147.7,"e":158.85,"t":"There's one more or less opposite the exit from the baggage claim on the corner of Lobby West. Oh, do they stock classical CDs? Oh, no. I don't think they do."},{"s":159.77,"e":161.31,"t":"There's another store that does."},{"s":162.07,"e":163.1,"t":"from the clock."},{"s":163.54,"e":168.48,"t":"Go along Lobby East, then turn right just after the hotel."},{"s":168.95,"e":175.65,"t":"you'll see the store. It's opposite the side of the hotel. It's very small, but there's a reasonable selection."},{"s":176.12,"e":176.77,"t":"That's great"},{"s":177.3,"e":179.68,"t":"I'm sure I can fill in the time before you arrive."},{"s":180.34,"e":181.21,"t":"Where should we meet?"},{"s":182.1,"e":188.96,"t":"There's a quiet lounge. No mobile phones allowed. Would that be OK with you? Perfect."},{"s":189.4,"e":192.73,"t":"It's beside the main exit in Lobby East."},{"s":193.5,"e":200.35,"t":"I'll see you in there about 5.30 on the 7th. Great! Look forward to seeing you, Jean. Bye! Bye, Tom."}]},{"n":35,"title":"pressure sphere, camera, hatch…","img":"img/l4/m35.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":305.8,"items":[{"p":"pressure sphere","a":"G","ps":68.09,"en":73.5,"si":10,"ev":"This is in the pressure sphere, which is located under the sail at the front of the vessel.","uz":"Bu bosim sferasida — kemaning old qismida, yelkan ostida.","why":"Katta doira — G.","hl":"pressure sphere"},{"p":"camera","a":"F","ps":92.44,"en":103.13,"si":15,"ev":"Video and still cameras mounted on the exterior at the front.","uz":"Video va foto kameralar old tomonda tashqarida o'rnatilgan.","why":"Old tomondagi kichik qurilma — F.","hl":"camera"},{"p":"hatch","a":"B","ps":116.25,"en":122.27,"si":18,"ev":"Immediately under the sail is the hatch.","uz":"Yelkanning roppa-rosa ostida lyuk.","why":"Yelkan osti — B.","hl":"hatch"},{"p":"current meter","a":"E","ps":125.98,"en":130.27,"si":20,"ev":"On top of the sail, there's a current meter to measure the movement of the ocean.","uz":"Yelkan ustida okean harakatini o'lchaydigan oqim o'lchagich.","why":"Yelkan ustidagi — E.","hl":"current meter"},{"p":"rotation thruster","a":"A","ps":131.77,"en":148.83,"si":21,"ev":"A final thruster right at the back of the vessel turns the submersible round.","uz":"Kemaning eng orqasidagi oxirgi dvigatel suv osti kemasini aylantiradi.","why":"Orqa (rear) — A.","hl":"thruster"}],"segs":[{"s":5.02,"e":11.17,"t":"Nowadays we have submersibles that can withstand the immense water pressure far below the surface."},{"s":12.09,"e":16.51,"t":"One of these deep submergence vehicles, as they're called, is Alvin."},{"s":17.02,"e":19.84,"t":"which has been in use since 1964."},{"s":21.18,"e":28.19,"t":"Typical dive lasts 8 hours and descends to 4,500 meters below sea level."},{"s":29.5,"e":35.81,"t":"Alvin is used for various scientific purposes, including, in 1985-86,"},{"s":36.28,"e":42.24,"t":"surveying the wreck of the Titanic, the ocean liner that sank in the Atlantic in 1912."},{"s":43.74,"e":49.53,"t":"The first thing you notice about Alvin is its bright red sail displaying the name of the vessel."},{"s":50.65,"e":56.09,"t":"The sail is on top of the vehicle, at the front, and helps to maintain stability."},{"s":57.14,"e":62.72,"t":"Alvin is about 7 metres long and just over 3.5 metres high."},{"s":63.48,"e":66.94,"t":"but only a small portion of that space is available for people."},{"s":68.09,"e":73.5,"t":"This is in the pressure sphere, which is located under the sail at the front of the vessel."},{"s":74.62,"e":79.01,"t":"With a diameter of about 2 metres, there's room for three people."},{"s":79.54,"e":81.28,"t":"But it's a tight squeeze."},{"s":82.2,"e":85.44,"t":"Usually, there's a pilot and two scientists."},{"s":86.26,"e":91.2,"t":"From here, they can look out in various directions through four viewing ports."},{"s":92.44,"e":103.13,"t":"Alvin carries a large number of instruments, including video and still cameras mounted on the exterior at the front, along with lights for illuminating the ocean."},{"s":103.58,"e":106.75,"t":"as of course sunlight doesn't penetrate this far down."},{"s":108.15,"e":115.01,"t":"Usually there's a stowage basket mounted on a frame at the front, used to hold tools and scientific equipment."},{"s":116.25,"e":122.27,"t":"Immediately under the sail is the hatch, which has a diameter of only 50 centimeters."},{"s":123.03,"e":124.77,"t":"This is the way into the vessel."},{"s":125.98,"e":130.27,"t":"top of the sail, there's a current meter to measure the movement of the ocean."},{"s":131.77,"e":137.5,"t":"The propulsion is provided by six electric thrusters, which make Alvin very maneuverable."},{"s":138.36,"e":141.31,"t":"Three of them are for forward and reverse movement."},{"s":141.91,"e":148.83,"t":"for vertical motion, and a final thruster right at the back of the vessel turns the submersible round."}]},{"n":36,"title":"school, prison, coaching inn…","img":"img/l4/m36.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":177.8,"items":[{"p":"school","a":"C","ps":22.81,"en":38.33,"si":4,"ev":"If you cross the river, turn left into South Street and continue along the road until just after it curves round. The school was on the left.","uz":"Daryodan o'tib, South Street'ga chapga buriling va yo'l burilgandan sal keyingacha yuring. Maktab chap tomonda edi.","why":"South Street burilishidan keyin, chapda — C. (E — burilishdan oldin)","hl":"school"},{"p":"prison","a":"B","ps":40.22,"en":50.08,"si":7,"ev":"One of the windows still exists with bars across it as part of a shop. It's on the bend in the High Street where it meets the Market Square.","uz":"Panjarali derazalardan biri hamon do'kon qismi sifatida saqlangan. U High Street Market Square bilan uchrashadigan burilishda.","why":"High Street burilishi, Market Square yonida — B.","hl":null},{"p":"coaching inn","a":"F","ps":50.62,"en":81.76,"si":9,"ev":"The George, an old coaching inn… The entrance was in South Street. And the building occupied the corner of the High Street.","uz":"\"George\" — eski karvonsaroy… Kirishi South Street'da edi, bino esa High Street burchagini egallagan.","why":"South Street va High Street burchagi — F.","hl":"coaching inn"},{"p":"warehouses","a":"G","ps":61.34,"en":81.76,"si":11,"ev":"They were quite close to the High Street on the opposite side from South Street… so they're close to the river.","uz":"Ular High Street'ga yaqin, South Street'ning qarama-qarshi tomonida edi… shuning uchun daryoga yaqin.","why":"High Street'ning narigi tomoni, daryo yonida — G.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.28,"e":10.01,"t":"Now, we need to know what buildings were here 70 or 80 years ago, don't we? Yes."},{"s":10.52,"e":15.74,"t":"So many old buildings were knocked down in the 1950s and 60s to make room for new ones."},{"s":16.18,"e":17.6,"t":"It's such a shame."},{"s":18.46,"e":22.11,"t":"Now, there was a 19th century school somewhere, wasn't there?"},{"s":22.81,"e":23.87,"t":"If you cross the river"},{"s":24.44,"e":38.33,"t":"Turn left into South Street and continue along the road until just after it curves round. The school was on the left. Oh, I know where you mean. Then there's the old prison. You know where that was, don't you?"},{"s":38.87,"e":39.39,"t":"No"},{"s":40.22,"e":45.15,"t":"One of the windows still exists with bars across it as part of a shop."},{"s":45.69,"e":50.08,"t":"It's on the bend in the high street where it meets the market square. OK."},{"s":50.62,"e":58.14,"t":"Then there's the George, an old coaching him where coaches used to stop in the days before railways existed. Where was that?"},{"s":58.71,"e":60.89,"t":"The entrance was in South Street."},{"s":61.34,"e":81.76,"t":"And the building occupied the corner of the High Street? Aha. And someone mentioned some warehouses that I'd never heard of. Warehouses? Yes. They were quite close to the High Street on the opposite side from South Street. They were used by merchants transporting goods by boat, so they're close to the river. Well, I never knew that."}]},{"n":37,"title":"tourist information, car park, museum…","img":"img/l4/m37.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":281.1,"items":[{"p":"tourist information","a":"F","ps":42.58,"en":49.05,"si":8,"ev":"At the moment we are at the entrance and immediately to our left is the tourist information office.","uz":"Hozir kirishdamiz, darhol chap tomonimizda turistik axborot markazi.","why":"Kirish chapi — F.","hl":"tourist information"},{"p":"car park","a":"G","ps":55.61,"en":60.8,"si":11,"ev":"Behind the tourist office is the car park where the coach dropped you off.","uz":"Axborot markazi ortida avtobus sizni tushirgan avtoturargoh.","why":"F ortida — G.","hl":"car park"},{"p":"museum","a":"D","ps":101.85,"en":104.96,"si":20,"ev":"To the right of the Deer Park is the Castle Museum.","uz":"Kiyik parkining o'ng tomonida qal'a muzeyi.","why":"Deer Park'ning o'ngi (pasti) — D. Restoran — C, uning ortida.","hl":"Museum"},{"p":"picnic area","a":"B","ps":116.7,"en":128.93,"si":23,"ev":"You can choose to dine in the picnic area on the other side of the Deer Park… next to the kids' play area and homemade ice cream hut.","uz":"Kiyik parkining narigi tomonidagi piknik joyida ovqatlanishingiz mumkin… bolalar maydonchasi va muzqaymoq kulbasi yonida.","why":"Ice cream yonida — B.","hl":"picnic area"},{"p":"gift shop","a":"H","ps":129.88,"en":136.64,"si":25,"ev":"Pop into the gift shop by the exit.","uz":"Chiqish yonidagi sovg'alar do'koniga kiring.","why":"Exit yonida — H.","hl":"gift shop"}],"segs":[{"s":5.27,"e":9.41,"t":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15."},{"s":11.77,"e":13.57,"t":"Welcome to Best League Castle."},{"s":14.2,"e":16.8,"t":"It's nice to see so many of you here today."},{"s":17.72,"e":22.11,"t":"Before we go in, I'd like to tell you some information about the castle."},{"s":22.87,"e":27.81,"t":"things to see and do, and the facilities available to you in the grounds."},{"s":28.57,"e":32.0,"t":"We'll do our best to make this a truly memorable visit."},{"s":33.3,"e":38.62,"t":"Now, the castle grounds are quite big and we don't want you to get lost."},{"s":39.06,"e":41.5,"t":"So I'm going to give you an idea of the layout."},{"s":42.58,"e":49.05,"t":"At the moment we are at the entrance and immediately to our left is the tourist information office."},{"s":49.82,"e":52.64,"t":"Go here if you need any questions answered."},{"s":53.5,"e":54.72,"t":"they'll be happy to help."},{"s":55.61,"e":60.8,"t":"And of course, behind the tourist office is the car park where the coach dropped you off."},{"s":61.34,"e":65.44,"t":"and he'll also pick you up from the same spot at 5pm today."},{"s":66.26,"e":68.54,"t":"In front of us are the water gardens."},{"s":69.08,"e":74.01,"t":"If you stroll through, you get to the North Bridge, which is the entrance to Bessley Castle."},{"s":74.65,"e":77.6,"t":"Take your time and enjoy looking around the castle."},{"s":78.36,"e":81.5,"t":"There's a lot of history steeped in those walls."},{"s":82.07,"e":88.0,"t":"As you leave the castle via the south bridge, you'll be greeted with the sight of roaming deer."},{"s":88.82,"e":94.97,"t":"During the day, there will be scheduled feeding opportunities where visitors can get involved."},{"s":95.67,"e":101.05,"t":"However, we do request that you do not feed the deer outside these times."},{"s":101.85,"e":104.96,"t":"To the right of the Deer Park is the Castle Museum."},{"s":105.46,"e":108.64,"t":"And behind that is our award-winning restaurant."},{"s":109.37,"e":115.68,"t":"It's a relatively new addition to the castle grounds, but is fast gaining a reputation for its food."},{"s":116.7,"e":121.98,"t":"Alternatively, you can choose to dine in the picnic area on the other side of the Deer Park."},{"s":122.97,"e":128.93,"t":"perfect for the family as it's next to the kids play area and homemade ice cream hut."},{"s":129.88,"e":136.64,"t":"We hope that on your way out, you pop into the gift shop by the exit for something to remember us by."}]},{"n":38,"title":"Park Hotel, internet café, tourist information office…","img":"img/l4/m38.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":308.4,"items":[{"p":"Park Hotel","a":"E","ps":25.72,"en":34.81,"si":3,"ev":"Go straight down the High Street towards the railway bridge and after the bridge, if you go left, you'll soon see it on the right.","uz":"High Street bo'ylab temir yo'l ko'prigi tomon to'g'ri yuring, ko'prikdan keyin chapga burilsangiz, tezda o'ng tomonda ko'rasiz.","why":"Ko'prikdan keyin chapga, o'ngda — E.","hl":null},{"p":"internet café","a":"F","ps":53.56,"en":62.94,"si":7,"ev":"It's near the bus station on the corner towards the right of Curtis Lane and Cramer Street.","uz":"U avtobus bekati yaqinida, Curtis Lane va Cramer Street burchagining o'ng tomonida.","why":"Curtis Lane va Cramer Street orasi — F.","hl":null},{"p":"tourist information office","a":"A","ps":78.81,"en":93.66,"si":11,"ev":"It's up around the train station area… The office is directly facing the train station on the corner with Earl Street.","uz":"U temir yo'l bekati atrofida… Ofis bekatning roppa-rosa qarshisida, Earl Street burchagida.","why":"Station Place, Earl St burchagi — A.","hl":"office"},{"p":"Royal House restaurant","a":"D","ps":123.1,"en":137.15,"si":20,"ev":"If you pass the corner with Cromwell Road, then the next junction is a crossroads with Duke Street… You'll be able to see its rather grand entrance over on the left corner.","uz":"Cromwell Road burchagidan o'tsangiz, keyingi chorraha Duke Street bilan… Uning hashamatli kirishini chap burchakda ko'rasiz.","why":"Duke Street chorrahasi, chap burchak — D.","hl":null}],"segs":[{"s":4.18,"e":11.81,"t":"I thought it could be useful to try and get your bearings now before we actually arrive, so I'll give you a few pointers on your maps."},{"s":12.54,"e":19.97,"t":"Okay, first things first. The Park Hotel, because I assume you'll want to deposit your luggage before anything else."},{"s":20.63,"e":24.8,"t":"We'll be driving into the town from the west and stopping at the bus station."},{"s":25.72,"e":34.81,"t":"To get to the hotel, just go straight down the high street towards the railway bridge and after the bridge, if you go left, you'll soon see it on the right."},{"s":35.45,"e":40.48,"t":"As I say, it's a nice place. You can check in, see your rooms, relax a little."},{"s":41.21,"e":43.74,"t":"There are a couple of interesting little shops nearby."},{"s":44.34,"e":52.7,"t":"There aren't any internet facilities at the hotel, I'm afraid, so if you want to send any emails, you'll need to get yourselves to the internet cafe."},{"s":53.56,"e":62.94,"t":"In fact, if you want to do that first, it's easy because it's near the bus station on the corner towards the right of Curtis Lane and Cramer Street."},{"s":63.74,"e":69.66,"t":"So once you've done that, if you do that, then I suppose you'll be ready to do a bit of exploring."},{"s":70.55,"e":74.56,"t":"You've got your basic maps, but you may want to get more information."},{"s":75.13,"e":77.95,"t":"and the Tourist Information Office is the place to do that."},{"s":78.81,"e":80.89,"t":"It's up around the train station area."},{"s":81.69,"e":88.35,"t":"From the bus station, you could go up any of the streets to the left. Cadogan Road, Earl Street or Duke Street."},{"s":88.98,"e":93.66,"t":"The office is directly facing the train station on the corner with Earl Street."},{"s":94.46,"e":100.06,"t":"They've got all sorts of brochures and leaflets about local attractions and tickets for sale."},{"s":100.5,"e":103.84,"t":"They even sell some locally produced jams and chocolates."},{"s":105.14,"e":111.13,"t":"And a last pointer at this stage is our venue for dinner tonight, the Royal House Restaurant."},{"s":111.9,"e":114.81,"t":"This is conveniently located in the very centre of town."},{"s":115.54,"e":118.81,"t":"In fact, you'll no doubt pass it as you're walking around beforehand."},{"s":119.77,"e":122.49,"t":"in relation to the bus station, it's not far."},{"s":123.1,"e":127.36,"t":"going down the high street, if you pass the corner with Cromwell Road,"},{"s":127.8,"e":137.15,"t":"Then the next junction is a crossroads with Duke Street and Runton Road, and it's there. You'll be able to see its rather grand entrance over on the left corner."},{"s":137.98,"e":143.61,"t":"And the food and the service there are both excellent, so it promises to be an enjoyable evening."},{"s":144.82,"e":147.13,"t":"Well, we're just coming into the town now, so-"}]},{"n":39,"title":"conference centre, information desk, bookshop…","img":"img/l4/m39.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":354.0,"items":[{"p":"conference centre","a":"C","ps":39.86,"en":43.93,"si":6,"ev":"On the other side of the piazza from the statue is the conference centre.","uz":"Maydonning haykalga qarama-qarshi tomonida konferensiya markazi.","why":"Statue qarshisi, Piazza o'ngida — C.","hl":"conference centre"},{"p":"information desk","a":"A","ps":52.34,"en":70.65,"si":9,"ev":"We're standing opposite the staircase down to the basement where you'll find the cloakroom. And to the left of that, we have the information desk.","uz":"Biz kiyim ilgich xonasiga tushadigan zinaning qarshisida turibmiz. Uning chap tomonida axborot stoli.","why":"Zina (to cloakroom) chapida — A.","hl":"information desk"},{"p":"bookshop","a":"E","ps":71.64,"en":79.45,"si":10,"ev":"On this lower ground floor, we also have a bookshop. That's the area over to the left of the main entrance.","uz":"Bu pastki qavatda kitob do'koni ham bor — asosiy kirishning chap tomonidagi joy.","why":"Kirishning chapi — E.","hl":"bookshop"},{"p":"King's Library","a":"F","ps":91.93,"en":106.05,"si":14,"ev":"In the middle of the upper ground floor, you can see a kind of glass-sided tower… This is called the King's Library.","uz":"Yuqori qavat o'rtasida shisha devorli minoraga o'xshash narsani ko'rasiz… Bu Qirol kutubxonasi.","why":"Yuqori qavat o'rtasi — F.","hl":"King's Library"},{"p":"stamp display","a":"D","ps":120.09,"en":137.89,"si":21,"ev":"The library's Treasures Gallery on the left… we'll also take a look at the stamp display situated behind it on the way to the café.","uz":"Chapdagi \"Xazinalar galereyasi\"… uning ortida, kafega boradigan yo'lda markalar ko'rgazmasi.","why":"Treasures Gallery ortida — D.","hl":"stamp display"}],"segs":[{"s":5.14,"e":13.05,"t":"Right, well, here we are, standing at the meeting point on the lower ground floor, just to the right of the main entrance."},{"s":14.01,"e":21.47,"t":"I've given you all a plan of the building so that we can orientate ourselves and get an idea of where we'll be going."},{"s":22.39,"e":22.75,"t":"Now."},{"s":23.22,"e":29.57,"t":"Outside the main entrance, you'll see the wide piazza with the stunning sculpture of Newton."},{"s":30.42,"e":35.65,"t":"The sculptor was Pau Lottsee, but it's based on the famous image by William Blake."},{"s":36.25,"e":38.46,"t":"and it's definitely worth a closer look."},{"s":39.86,"e":43.93,"t":"On the other side of the piazza from the statue is the conference centre."},{"s":44.41,"e":47.49,"t":"which is used for all kinds of international conventions."},{"s":48.12,"e":51.07,"t":"We'll take a quick look inside at the end of our tour."},{"s":52.34,"e":70.65,"t":"Looking ahead of us now, you'll see that we're standing opposite the staircase down to the basement where you'll find the cloak room. And to the left of that, we have the information desk where you can find out about any current exhibitions, the times of the tours and anything you need to know if you don't have a tour guide."},{"s":71.64,"e":75.87,"t":"As you can see on this lower ground floor, we also have a bookshop."},{"s":76.6,"e":79.45,"t":"That's the area over to the left of the main entrance."},{"s":80.18,"e":83.29,"t":"You'll be free to browse there when we get back to the ground floor."},{"s":85.27,"e":91.33,"t":"Opposite the main entrance on this floor, we have the open stairs leading up to the upper ground floor."},{"s":91.93,"e":94.91,"t":"and at the top of them, in the middle of the upper ground floor,"},{"s":95.38,"e":98.21,"t":"you can see a kind of glass-sided tower."},{"s":98.65,"e":102.81,"t":"that rises all the way up through the ceiling and up to the first floor."},{"s":103.8,"e":106.05,"t":"This is called the King's Library."},{"s":106.84,"e":109.25,"t":"It's really the heart of the building."},{"s":109.88,"e":115.9,"t":"It was built to house the collection that was presented to the nation in 1823 by the King."},{"s":116.86,"e":119.13,"t":"You can see it from every floor above ground."},{"s":120.09,"e":124.25,"t":"When we go up there, you'll find the library's Treasures Gallery on the left."},{"s":125.05,"e":126.88,"t":"Can you find it on your plan?"},{"s":128.06,"e":129.57,"t":"That's the exciting one."},{"s":130.07,"e":137.89,"t":"So we'll be visiting that first, but we'll also take a look at the stamp display situated behind it on the way to the cafe."},{"s":138.39,"e":139.9,"t":"A lot of people miss that."},{"s":141.5,"e":151.65,"t":"The cafeteria runs along the back of the floor and in the right hand corner you'll find the lifts and toilets. Always good to locate then."},{"s":152.7,"e":157.5,"t":"The other main area on that floor is the public access catalogue section."},{"s":158.1,"e":160.93,"t":"and I'll show you how that operates when we get up there."},{"s":163.99,"e":165.69,"t":"That is the end of section two."},{"s":166.52,"e":168.73,"t":"You now have half a minute to check your answers."}]},{"n":40,"title":"Whitfield family house, Old Oxford School, school of navigation","img":"img/l4/m40.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":287.7,"items":[{"p":"Whitfield family house","a":"I","ps":34.33,"en":58.11,"si":6,"ev":"Head up Main Street until you get to Pagun Avenue, go down there and turn right at the end. Go straight on and just on the corner with Oxford Street, you'll see a two-storey house. This is the Whitfield family house.","uz":"Main Street bo'ylab Pagun Avenue'gacha boring, u bo'ylab yurib, oxirida o'ngga buriling. To'g'ri yursangiz, Oxford Street burchagida ikki qavatli uyni ko'rasiz — Uitfildlar oilasi uyi.","why":"Pagun Ave'dan keyin, Oxford Street burchagi — I.","hl":"Whitfield family house"},{"p":"Old Oxford School","a":"B","ps":69.46,"en":81.44,"si":13,"ev":"If you carry on along Oxford Street, then turn left at the end, you'll come to North Street. And about halfway down there is what's known as Old Oxford School.","uz":"Oxford Street bo'ylab davom etib, oxirida chapga burilsangiz, North Street'ga chiqasiz. Uning taxminan o'rtasida Eski Oksford maktabi.","why":"North Street o'rtasi — B.","hl":"Old Oxford School"},{"p":"school of navigation","a":"E","ps":103.67,"en":122.43,"si":21,"ev":"Turn the corner onto Adams Street… you go around a couple of sharp bends, and on the second of these, you can see the School of Navigation.","uz":"Adams Street'ga buriling… bir-ikki keskin burilishdan o'tasiz, ikkinchisida dengizchilik maktabini ko'rasiz.","why":"Ikkinchi burilish — E. (D — birinchi burilish yoni, tuzoq)","hl":"School of Navigation"}],"segs":[{"s":5.75,"e":9.73,"t":"Now listen and answer questions 18 to 20."},{"s":12.54,"e":18.14,"t":"Now many of the buildings that Manjiro Nakahama knew in Fairhaven are still standing today."},{"s":18.84,"e":25.44,"t":"And so if you'd just like to hand around some copies of this map, I'll suggest the best route to follow to see them."},{"s":26.55,"e":27.04,"t":"Okay."},{"s":27.51,"e":31.33,"t":"So if you look at the bottom of the map, you can see the Millicent Library."},{"s":31.83,"e":33.25,"t":"And that's where we are now."},{"s":34.33,"e":44.83,"t":"Now to follow the John Manjiro Trail, you go out of here along Sender Street and then head up Main Street until you get to Pilgrim Avenue."},{"s":45.78,"e":48.09,"t":"go down there and turn right at the end."},{"s":48.79,"e":54.88,"t":"go straight on and just on the corner with Oxford Street, you'll see a two-story house."},{"s":55.64,"e":58.11,"t":"This is the Whitfield family house."},{"s":58.55,"e":62.27,"t":"And this is where Manjiro first stayed when he came to Fairhaven."},{"s":63.26,"e":67.42,"t":"It's still a private residence, so please respect the owner's privacy."},{"s":68.44,"e":68.89,"t":"Okay."},{"s":69.46,"e":72.22,"t":"Now if you carry on along Oxford Street"},{"s":72.79,"e":76.29,"t":"Then turn left at the end, you'll come to North Street."},{"s":76.86,"e":81.44,"t":"And about halfway down there is what's known as Old Oxford School."},{"s":82.49,"e":86.37,"t":"This was the very same school that Manjiro attended when he lived here."},{"s":87.35,"e":91.93,"t":"It was considered to be the best school in town because of the quality of the building."},{"s":92.7,"e":94.65,"t":"and usually it was built of stone."},{"s":95.38,"e":96.99,"t":"and the quality of the teaching."},{"s":98.17,"e":102.56,"t":"Nowadays it's usually closed, except on special occasions."},{"s":103.67,"e":108.7,"t":"Go on to the end of North Street and turn the corner onto Adams Street."},{"s":109.82,"e":122.43,"t":"If you follow the road down back towards the library, you go around a couple of sharp bends, and on the second of these, you can see the School of Navigation, which Manjiro also attended."},{"s":123.54,"e":125.12,"t":"And if you follow the road on..."},{"s":125.56,"e":128.09,"t":"You'll soon find yourself back here at the library."},{"s":128.66,"e":131.9,"t":"And I'd suggest you spend some time looking around that too."},{"s":132.38,"e":133.57,"t":"If you have any time left."},{"s":135.83,"e":136.22,"t":"now."},{"s":136.7,"e":138.59,"t":"Does anyone have any questions?"}]},{"n":41,"title":"waste container, slurry, water inlet…","img":"img/l4/m41.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":253.9,"items":[{"p":"waste container","a":"C","ps":47.8,"en":56.54,"si":9,"ev":"The smaller container on the left is where you put the waste you've collected.","uz":"Chapdagi kichik idish — yig'ilgan chiqindilarni soladigan joy.","why":"Chapdagi kichik idish — C.","hl":"container"},{"p":"slurry","a":"G","ps":59.16,"en":62.11,"si":11,"ev":"And that's slurry on the base of the larger tank.","uz":"Katta idishning tubidagisi — bo'tana (slurry).","why":"Katta idish tubi — G.","hl":"slurry"},{"p":"water inlet","a":"A","ps":69.75,"en":80.61,"si":14,"ev":"So is that pipe at the bottom where the water comes in? Yes, it is.","uz":"Pastdagi quvur suv kiradigan joymi? Ha.","why":"Pastki quvur — A.","hl":"water"},{"p":"gas","a":"E","ps":69.75,"en":80.61,"si":14,"ev":"As the slurry mixture digests, it produces gas and that rises to the top of the dome.","uz":"Bo'tana parchalanganda gaz hosil bo'ladi va u gumbaz tepasiga ko'tariladi.","why":"Gumbaz ichi, yuqori — E. (D — chiqish quvuri)","hl":"gas"},{"p":"overflow tank","a":"F","ps":81.24,"en":96.73,"si":15,"ev":"That's the overflow tank, that container on the right.","uz":"Bu — o'ngdagi idish, toshib chiqish idishi.","why":"O'ngdagi idish — F.","hl":"overflow tank"}],"segs":[{"s":4.92,"e":5.44,"t":"Weave."},{"s":6.26,"e":7.29,"t":"Come in and sit down."},{"s":8.38,"e":8.99,"t":"How's it"},{"s":9.43,"e":13.98,"t":"Fine thanks. I'm looking forward to my teaching practice next week. Good."},{"s":14.62,"e":25.18,"t":"Now you've got two classes haven't you? Year 3 and year 6. Have you done your lesson plans? Well, I've decided to take the topic of renewable energy."},{"s":25.62,"e":33.21,"t":"I haven't done a lesson plan for year 6 yet, but I thought I'd base their lesson on an example of very simple technology."},{"s":33.75,"e":36.41,"t":"So I've brought this diagram to show you"},{"s":36.86,"e":39.1,"t":"I got it from the internet. Let's see."},{"s":40.47,"e":47.2,"t":"So this is equipment for producing fuel from organic waste? Yes."},{"s":47.8,"e":56.54,"t":"The smaller container on the left is where you put the waste you've collected. Right, and from there it's piped into the larger tank."},{"s":57.82,"e":58.65,"t":"That's right."},{"s":59.16,"e":62.11,"t":"And that's slurry on the base of the larger tank."},{"s":62.55,"e":65.89,"t":"Right. And what exactly is slurry?"},{"s":66.36,"e":69.28,"t":"It's a mixture of organic waste and water."},{"s":69.75,"e":80.61,"t":"So is that pipe at the bottom where the water comes in? Yes, it is. As the slurry mixture digests, it produces gas and that rises to the top of the dome."},{"s":81.24,"e":94.59,"t":"Then when it's needed it can be piped off for use as fuel in homes or factories. It's very simple. I suppose there's some kind of safety valve to prevent pressure build up. That's the overflow tank."},{"s":95.13,"e":96.73,"t":"that container on the right"},{"s":97.24,"e":109.28,"t":"As the slurry expands, some of it flows into that, and then once some of the gas has been piped off, the slurry level goes down again, and the overflow tank empties again. I see."},{"s":110.2,"e":116.89,"t":"Well, I think that's suitably simple for the age level it's for. I look forward to seeing the whole lesson plan. Thanks."},{"s":117.34,"e":122.17,"t":"And can I show you my ideas for the year 3 lesson? Of course. Let's look."}]},{"n":43,"title":"sign-in office, gallery 1, key box…","img":"img/l4/m43.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":253.0,"items":[{"p":"sign-in office","a":"C","ps":16.02,"en":31.81,"si":3,"ev":"You'll see the main staircase straight ahead. To the right of this is the statue of the horse, and just behind that is a door… That's the sign-in office.","uz":"Ro'parangizda asosiy zinani ko'rasiz. Uning o'ng tomonida ot haykali, uning ortida eshik bor… Bu — ro'yxatdan o'tish xonasi.","why":"Statue ortidagi eshik — C.","hl":"sign-in office"},{"p":"gallery 1","a":"B","ps":40.38,"en":52.32,"si":10,"ev":"In the central courtyard area close to the entrance, there's a large chest where visitors put donations… The door just behind that leads to Gallery 1.","uz":"Kirishga yaqin markaziy hovlida tashrif buyuruvchilar xayriya soladigan katta sandiq bor… uning ortidagi eshik 1-galereyaga olib boradi.","why":"Donations ortidagi eshik — B.","hl":"Gallery 1"},{"p":"key box","a":"H","ps":63.7,"en":72.99,"si":15,"ev":"The key box is quite hard to find… behind reception, and it's between the large gallery and the bookshop.","uz":"Kalitlar qutisini topish ancha qiyin… qabulxona ortida, katta galereya va kitob do'koni orasida.","why":"Gallery 2 va Book shop orasi — H.","hl":"key box"},{"p":"kitchen area","a":"D","ps":84.89,"en":97.05,"si":19,"ev":"We tend to have our sandwiches in the kitchen area. Go round the reception desk and you'll see a small circular cabinet. The door to the kitchen area is just behind that.","uz":"Odatda sendvichlarimizni oshxonada yeymiz. Qabul stolini aylanib o'tsangiz, kichik dumaloq shkafni ko'rasiz. Oshxona eshigi uning ortida.","why":"Dumaloq shkaf (E) ortida — D.","hl":"kitchen area"},{"p":"staff noticeboard","a":"G","ps":108.79,"en":117.73,"si":24,"ev":"Look on our staff noticeboard. This is in the corner of the play area… on the wall of Gallery 3.","uz":"Xodimlar e'lonlar taxtasiga qarang. U o'yin maydoni burchagida… 3-galereya devorida.","why":"Play area burchagi, Gallery 3 devori — G.","hl":"staff noticeboard"}],"segs":[{"s":4.82,"e":10.14,"t":"Now, before I finish today, I wanted to help you find your way around the museum."},{"s":10.97,"e":12.7,"t":"When you start next Monday..."},{"s":13.14,"e":15.36,"t":"The first thing you'll need to do is sign in."},{"s":16.02,"e":20.48,"t":"come through the main entrance and you'll see the main staircase straight ahead."},{"s":21.24,"e":24.57,"t":"To the right of this is the statue of the horse."},{"s":25.27,"e":27.71,"t":"and just behind that is a door."},{"s":28.54,"e":29.5,"t":"go through that?"},{"s":30.42,"e":31.81,"t":"That's the sign in office."},{"s":32.44,"e":36.86,"t":"Now, on the first day, you'll be working in Gallery 1."},{"s":37.72,"e":39.45,"t":"You'll find this as follows."},{"s":40.38,"e":43.65,"t":"in the central courtyard area close to the entrance"},{"s":44.22,"e":48.25,"t":"There's a large chest where visitors put donations for the museum."},{"s":49.02,"e":52.32,"t":"The door just behind that leads to Gallery 1."},{"s":53.59,"e":57.34,"t":"The workshop you'll be taking part in starts at 11."},{"s":57.91,"e":62.69,"t":"But if you want to go in earlier, you can get the key and let yourself in."},{"s":63.7,"e":66.56,"t":"box is quite hard to find."},{"s":67.67,"e":69.05,"t":"behind reception"},{"s":69.72,"e":72.99,"t":"and it's between the large gallery and the bookshop."},{"s":74.36,"e":83.87,"t":"I haven't mentioned breaks, lunch etc. Unfortunately our cafe's closed at the moment so your best bet is to bring a packed lunch."},{"s":84.89,"e":87.81,"t":"We tend to have our sandwiches in the kitchen area."},{"s":88.44,"e":93.21,"t":"Go round the reception desk and you'll see a small circular cabinet."},{"s":94.17,"e":97.05,"t":"The door to the kitchen area is just behind that."},{"s":98.87,"e":103.17,"t":"Every day, we put up notices about what's happening in the museum."},{"s":103.8,"e":108.35,"t":"Your supervisor will brief you, but if you want to check up on details,"},{"s":108.79,"e":110.72,"t":"Look on our staff notice board."},{"s":111.42,"e":113.98,"t":"This is in the corner of the play area."},{"s":114.81,"e":115.13,"t":"that"},{"s":115.8,"e":117.73,"t":"on the wall of gallery three."},{"s":118.94,"e":121.53,"t":"If you have any questions, I'd be happy to have--"}]},{"n":44,"title":"craft fair, fringe stage, band entrance…","img":"img/l4/m44.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":292.9,"items":[{"p":"craft fair","a":"D","ps":37.98,"en":48.57,"si":4,"ev":"It's also the entrance for those taking part in the craft fair. We've set the stalls just inside the gate on the left in a circle.","uz":"Bu hunarmandlar yarmarkasi qatnashchilari uchun ham kirish. Rastalarni darvozadan kiraverishda chapda, aylana shaklida joylashtirdik.","why":"Darvozadan chapdagi aylana — D.","hl":"craft fair"},{"p":"fringe stage","a":"F","ps":49.34,"en":72.09,"si":6,"ev":"You'll come to some steps up to the football stadium. On the left of the steps is the Fringe Stage.","uz":"Futbol stadioniga chiqadigan zinapoyaga yetasiz. Zinaning chap tomonida Fringe sahnasi.","why":"Zinaning chapi — F. (C — o'ngda, axborot nuqtasi)","hl":"Fringe Stage"},{"p":"band entrance","a":"B","ps":97.21,"en":107.29,"si":10,"ev":"The entrance for the rock bands is on the far side.","uz":"Rok guruhlari kirishi narigi tomonda.","why":"Stadionning narigi tomoni — B.","hl":"entrance"},{"p":"art exhibition","a":"A","ps":115.96,"en":142.27,"si":12,"ev":"A third gate for exhibitors opening onto a side path. A little way down the path before you get to the trees is the building where the art exhibition's being housed.","uz":"Ko'rgazmachilar uchun yon yo'lakka ochiladigan uchinchi darvoza. Yo'lak bo'ylab daraxtlarga yetmasdan san'at ko'rgazmasi binosi.","why":"Daraxtlardan oldin — A.","hl":"art exhibition"},{"p":"lock-up garages","a":"G","ps":123.1,"en":142.27,"si":13,"ev":"One more building marked on your plan, quite near the main gate. It's divided into lock-up garages.","uz":"Rejada asosiy darvozaga ancha yaqin yana bir bino bor — u qulflanadigan garajlarga bo'lingan.","why":"Darvoza yaqinidagi bo'lingan bino — G.","hl":"lock-up garages"}],"segs":[{"s":5.66,"e":19.23,"t":"Good evening everyone. I'm glad you could all make this planning meeting for what promises to be the biggest and most colourful free rock festival ever held in the South East. So whether you're a performer, a craft exhibitor or an artist..."},{"s":19.67,"e":21.63,"t":"We all extend a big welcome to you."},{"s":22.39,"e":33.21,"t":"Could we turn first to the plan so I can familiarise you with the layout of the site, which as you know is an old football stadium. We're really lucky to have so much space this year."},{"s":33.88,"e":37.41,"t":"You can see the main gate at the bottom of the plan. Have you found it?"},{"s":37.98,"e":44.19,"t":"That's where most visitors will enter. It's also the entrance for those taking part in the craft fair."},{"s":44.82,"e":48.57,"t":"We've set the stalls just inside the gate on the left in a circle."},{"s":49.34,"e":56.7,"t":"If you walk straight ahead from the gate along the path without turning right, you'll come to some steps up to the football stadium."},{"s":57.37,"e":72.09,"t":"On the left of the steps is the Fringe Stage. This is for alternative artists. They include folk singers, poets and other acts which are more suited to a smaller stage. And they should also enter by the main gate."},{"s":72.82,"e":91.33,"t":"On the opposite side of the steps is a restaurant and adjoining that is the main festival information point. Here you can get extra programs and up to the minute information about events and you can discuss any last minute problems although we hope everything will be running smoothly when the festival opens."},{"s":92.06,"e":96.73,"t":"Right, coming back to the plan, you go up the stairs to the stadium..."},{"s":97.21,"e":107.29,"t":"The entrance for the rock bands is on the far side and on your right is the main stage, which will have powerful illumination and amplification throughout the weekend."},{"s":107.93,"e":115.42,"t":"There will probably be TV vehicles adjacent. That's in this area only for recording purposes."},{"s":115.96,"e":122.65,"t":"If you look at the outside of the plan you can see a third gate for exhibitors opening onto a side path."},{"s":123.1,"e":142.27,"t":"A little way down the path before you get to the trees is the building where the art exhibition's being housed. Then finally, there's just one more building marked on your plan, quite near the main gate. It's divided into lock-up garages, so I hope you now feel quite familiar with the main festival area."}]},{"n":45,"title":"old bakery, doctor's surgery, cooper's cottage…","img":"img/l4/m45.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":241.4,"items":[{"p":"old bakery","a":"C","ps":23.9,"en":35.9,"si":3,"ev":"Walk up Stafford Street and then turn into Rigby Road… the Old Bakery is right next to the canal.","uz":"Stafford Street bo'ylab yurib, Rigby Road'ga buriling… Eski novvoyxona kanalning yonginasida.","why":"Rigby Road oxiri, kanal yonida — C.","hl":"Old Bakery"},{"p":"doctor's surgery","a":"F","ps":47.48,"en":56.32,"si":7,"ev":"Walk up Stafford Street until you reach the dock. You see the café. Walk past that and the doctor's surgery is just there.","uz":"Stafford Street bo'ylab dokkacha yuring. Kafeni ko'rasiz. Undan o'tsangiz, shifokor qabulxonasi o'sha yerda.","why":"Kafedan keyin — F.","hl":"doctor's surgery"},{"p":"cooper's cottage","a":"A","ps":65.4,"en":81.02,"si":12,"ev":"Take the first turning on the left. The road curves round… as it climbs Jack's Hill… Cooper's cottage is right on the summit of Jack's Hill.","uz":"Birinchi chapga buriling. Yo'l aylanib Jack's Hill'ga ko'tariladi… Kuper kulbasi tepalikning eng cho'qqisida.","why":"Jack's Hill cho'qqisi — A.","hl":"Cooper's cottage"},{"p":"stables","a":"H","ps":87.77,"en":99.07,"si":17,"ev":"Walk up Stafford Street to the dock and turn right. Round the dock till you get to the canal. Cross the bridge over the canal to reach the stables.","uz":"Stafford Street bo'ylab dokkacha boring va o'ngga buriling. Dokni aylanib kanalgacha yuring. Otxonaga borish uchun kanal ko'prigidan o'ting.","why":"Kanalning narigi tomoni — H.","hl":"stables"},{"p":"old school","a":"E","ps":103.48,"en":112.22,"si":22,"ev":"The old school is right on the corner of Stafford Street and Rigby Road.","uz":"Eski maktab Stafford Street va Rigby Road burchagida.","why":"Burchak — E.","hl":"old school"}],"segs":[{"s":5.08,"e":13.92,"t":"So if you take out your maps, I'll just point out a few places you might like to visit. So right now we're standing in the ticket office at the bottom of your maps."},{"s":14.62,"e":18.14,"t":"So, one place I'd recommend is the Old Bakery."},{"s":18.62,"e":23.01,"t":"This is a typical bakery from this area from about 100 years ago."},{"s":23.9,"e":28.7,"t":"To get there from the ticket office, walk up Stafford Street and then turn into Rigby Road."},{"s":29.43,"e":35.9,"t":"Walk down Rigby Road. There are a few interesting places along the way and the old bakery is right next to the canal."},{"s":37.27,"e":40.13,"t":"Another interesting place is the doctor's surgery."},{"s":40.66,"e":46.43,"t":"This was moved here brick by brick and rebuilt on the museum site."},{"s":47.48,"e":50.62,"t":"Walk up Stafford Street until you reach the dock."},{"s":51.48,"e":52.61,"t":"You see the cafe."},{"s":53.46,"e":56.32,"t":"Walk past that and the doctor surgery is just there."},{"s":58.1,"e":61.05,"t":"The campus cottage is also fascinating."},{"s":61.69,"e":64.54,"t":"a workers' cottage from the 19th century."},{"s":65.4,"e":69.05,"t":"Walk up Stafford Street and take the first turning on the left."},{"s":69.94,"e":74.62,"t":"The road curves round to the west, then south, as it climbs Jack's Hill."},{"s":75.26,"e":81.02,"t":"You'll pass a few little houses on the way up and Cooper's cottage is right on the summit of Jack's Hill."},{"s":82.52,"e":84.89,"t":"The stables are also great."},{"s":85.43,"e":87.23,"t":"This is where they kept all the horses."},{"s":87.77,"e":92.48,"t":"Again, walk up Stafford Street to the dock and turn right."},{"s":93.21,"e":95.2,"t":"Round the dock till you get to the canal."},{"s":96.06,"e":99.07,"t":"cross the bridge over the canal to reach the stables."},{"s":99.74,"e":100.29,"t":"also."},{"s":100.76,"e":102.81,"t":"Be sure to visit the old school."},{"s":103.48,"e":112.22,"t":"So, walk north-east, up through the museum, and it's not too far. The old school is right on the corner of Stafford Street and Rigby Road."},{"s":113.24,"e":115.61,"t":"Now, one other thing that I need to mention."}]},{"n":46,"title":"cargo building, car park, domestic terminal…","img":"img/l4/m46.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":235.4,"items":[{"p":"cargo building","a":"H","ps":13.05,"en":22.75,"si":1,"ev":"You'll see a big cargo building on your left as you approach the airport.","uz":"Aeroportga yaqinlashganingizda chap tomonda katta yuk binosini ko'rasiz.","why":"Shahardan kelganda chapdagi birinchi bino — H.","hl":"cargo building"},{"p":"car park","a":"E","ps":13.05,"en":22.75,"si":1,"ev":"And then the car park is a rectangular building beyond this.","uz":"Undan narida to'rtburchak bino — avtoturargoh.","why":"Walkway bilan bog'langan to'rtburchak bino — E.","hl":"car park"},{"p":"domestic terminal","a":"F","ps":35.74,"en":49.37,"si":4,"ev":"Get off at the first bus stop opposite the first building on your right. This is the domestic terminal.","uz":"Birinchi bekatda, o'ngdagi birinchi bino qarshisida tushing. Bu ichki reyslar terminali.","why":"Birinchi bekat qarshisi — F.","hl":"domestic terminal"},{"p":"lifts","a":"D","ps":74.68,"en":80.83,"si":9,"ev":"The toilets are on the left side of the concourse and there are lifts leading up to the next floor on the right.","uz":"Zalning chap tomonida hojatxonalar, o'ng tomonida keyingi qavatga chiqadigan liftlar.","why":"Xalqaro terminal (C) dagi o'ng tomon — D.","hl":"lifts"},{"p":"regional terminal","a":"B","ps":96.5,"en":103.49,"si":12,"ev":"You will need to go to the regional terminal at the north end of the airport.","uz":"Aeroportning shimoliy chetidagi mintaqaviy terminalga borishingiz kerak.","why":"Shimoliy chet — B.","hl":"regional terminal"}],"segs":[{"s":5.56,"e":12.38,"t":"The airport has three terminals which are joined together to form one large building, shaped rather like a crescent."},{"s":13.05,"e":22.75,"t":"If you're coming from the city by car, you'll see a big cargo building on your left as you approach the airport, and then the car park is a rectangular building beyond this."},{"s":23.51,"e":29.28,"t":"You can park your car there and then make your way back into the terminals using the pedestrian walkway."},{"s":30.58,"e":35.07,"t":"For those who arrive from the city by bus, there are two bus stops at the airport."},{"s":35.74,"e":42.78,"t":"If you are flying to a city within Australia, you should get off at the first bus stop opposite the first building on your right."},{"s":43.48,"e":49.37,"t":"This is the domestic terminal, where all the flights to the major cities within Australia leave from."},{"s":50.94,"e":59.17,"t":"If you are going overseas, you will need to go to the International Terminal, which is in the center of the complex, so get off at the next bus stop."},{"s":60.15,"e":65.09,"t":"This terminal has a long, narrow concourse leading down to the departure gates."},{"s":66.04,"e":73.79,"t":"When you walk into the international terminal through the main entrance, you'll find yourself in a large hall where you check in for your flight."},{"s":74.68,"e":80.83,"t":"The toilets are on the left side of the concourse and there are lifts leading up to the next floor on the right."},{"s":81.53,"e":88.13,"t":"You'll find a variety of restaurants and bars on the first floor, and shops selling clothes and souvenirs."},{"s":88.73,"e":95.2,"t":"But remember, there are strict hand luggage limitations, so don't buy more than you can carry in one bag."},{"s":96.5,"e":103.49,"t":"If you are flying to one of the small country towns, you will need to go to the regional terminal at the north end of the airport."},{"s":104.22,"e":111.52,"t":"Facilities are limited in this terminal, but there is a small cafe where you can buy sandwiches and wait for your flight."},{"s":112.34,"e":114.59,"t":"To hear this information again, press one..."}]},{"n":47,"title":"gift shop, beehives, holiday cottages…","img":"img/l4/m47.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":358.5,"items":[{"p":"gift shop","a":"E","ps":37.34,"en":64.96,"si":4,"ev":"The gift shop is to the right of the main house.","uz":"Sovg'alar do'koni asosiy uyning o'ng tomonida.","why":"Manor House o'ngi — E.","hl":"gift shop"},{"p":"beehives","a":"G","ps":65.94,"en":83.71,"si":5,"ev":"If you go through the gate, the left-hand path takes you to the apiary. That's to say, the beehives.","uz":"Darvozadan o'tsangiz, chap yo'lak sizni asalarixonaga olib boradi — ya'ni asalari uyalariga.","why":"Orchards darvozasidan chap yo'lak — G.","hl":"beehives"},{"p":"holiday cottages","a":"A","ps":84.54,"en":102.65,"si":6,"ev":"If you take the right-hand path, you will come to some old farmers' cottages… rented out as holiday cottages.","uz":"O'ng yo'lakdan borsangiz, eski fermer kulbalariga yetasiz… ular dam olish uylari sifatida ijaraga beriladi.","why":"O'ng yo'lak, uylar qatori — A.","hl":"holiday cottages"},{"p":"dairy","a":"C","ps":104.54,"en":122.62,"si":7,"ev":"Crossing the car park and just before you get to the cattle fields you will find a row of three buildings. The middle one is the old dairy.","uz":"Avtoturargohni kesib o'tib, mollar dalasiga yetmasdan uchta bino qatorini ko'rasiz. O'rtadagisi — eski sut zavodi.","why":"Uchta binoning o'rtasi — C.","hl":"dairy"},{"p":"museum","a":"B","ps":123.22,"en":136.99,"si":9,"ev":"Next to that on the left are the former cattle sheds… Nowadays it's used as a museum.","uz":"Uning chap tomonida sobiq mol qo'ralari… Hozir u muzey sifatida ishlatiladi.","why":"C ning chapi — B. (D — Ice House, uydan eng uzoq)","hl":"museum"}],"segs":[{"s":5.91,"e":19.87,"t":"As you know, Holloway Estate is one of the few surviving estates in this area that still retains many of the farming features of the past. Let me quickly explain where you can find some of the key attractions."},{"s":20.31,"e":28.89,"t":"If you take a look on your map, we are now standing at the foot of the steps to the manor house. Can everyone see it marked with an arrow?"},{"s":29.46,"e":33.34,"t":"Don't forget, this is our meeting point for when we leave."},{"s":34.26,"e":36.64,"t":"Directly behind us is the fountain."},{"s":37.34,"e":64.96,"t":"From here, heading left, the path takes you to a gate which leads into the famous Holloway Orchards, where for hundreds of years the estate has been growing its highly prized apples, cherries and plums. Incidentally, if you fancy trying them, a range of delicious Holloway jams and preserves are available in the gift shop, speaking of which, the gift shop is to the right of the main house."},{"s":65.94,"e":83.71,"t":"If you go through the gate, the left-hand path takes you to the apiary. That's to say, the beehives, where Holloway Honey has been collected for more than 250 years. And yes, before anyone asks, you can also buy Holloway Honey."},{"s":84.54,"e":102.65,"t":"If you take the right-hand path, you will come to some old farmers' cottages, which have been renovated and are rented out as holiday cottages. Please feel free to admire them from the outside, but as there may be guests staying in them right now, please respect their privacy."},{"s":104.54,"e":113.92,"t":"From the back of the main house crossing the car park and just before you get to the cattle fields you will find a row of three buildings."},{"s":114.36,"e":122.62,"t":"The middle one is the old dairy. The dairy is actually working, producing butter and cheeses using traditional methods."},{"s":123.22,"e":128.41,"t":"Next to that on the left are the former cattle sheds where the livestock was kept."},{"s":129.4,"e":136.99,"t":"Nowadays it's used as a museum, so those of you who are keen to explore Holloway's farming past should pay to visit."},{"s":137.85,"e":146.4,"t":"The building furthest from the manor house is the old Ice House, which is no longer in use and is due to be restored hopefully next year."},{"s":147.35,"e":155.71,"t":"Last but not least, you may have noticed on the way in that on either side of the main gates are two small houses."},{"s":156.15,"e":159.65,"t":"This is a traditional feature of country houses of the period."},{"s":160.12,"e":165.76,"t":"On the right hand side, as you enter the estate, is what was known as the Gatekeeper's Lodge."},{"s":166.3,"e":171.55,"t":"This has now become the estate office, and the estate manager runs the estate from there."},{"s":172.02,"e":175.26,"t":"Okay, I think that just about covers everything."}]},{"n":48,"title":"sight, shaft, fletching…","img":"img/l4/m48.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGH","dur":287.4,"items":[{"p":"sight","a":"D","ps":31.48,"en":34.88,"si":7,"ev":"Just above the middle of the bow, here is the sight.","uz":"Kamonning o'rtasidan sal yuqorida — mo'ljal.","why":"Kamon o'rtasidan yuqori — D.","hl":"sight"},{"p":"shaft","a":"H","ps":55.32,"en":57.34,"si":13,"ev":"The shafts of our arrows are wooden.","uz":"O'qlarimizning tanasi yog'ochdan.","why":"O'qning o'rta tanasi — H.","hl":"shaft"},{"p":"fletching","a":"C","ps":65.08,"en":72.22,"si":16,"ev":"The fletching, at the top of the arrow, I mean, not the tip end of the arrow, was made of feathers.","uz":"Patlar — o'qning orqa uchida, uchli tomonida emas — patdan yasalgan.","why":"O'qning orqa uchi — C. (A — uchi, tuzoq)","hl":"fletching"},{"p":"quiver","a":"A","ps":83.96,"en":92.16,"si":21,"ev":"All of you have a quiver with six arrows in it. You should tie the strap of the quiver around your waist.","uz":"Hammangizda oltita o'qli o'qdon bor. O'qdon tasmasini belingizga bog'lang.","why":"Belga bog'langan — A.","hl":"quiver"},{"p":"bracer","a":"B","ps":114.84,"en":123.29,"si":28,"ev":"And a bracer. The bracer is a smaller arm pad that protects the inside of your arm from the string.","uz":"Va bilakbog'. Bu qo'lning ichki tomonini ipdan himoya qiladigan kichik yostiqcha.","why":"Qo'ldagi himoya — B.","hl":"bracer"}],"segs":[{"s":5.05,"e":6.75,"t":"Let's take a look at the equipment."},{"s":7.45,"e":8.99,"t":"The bows are fairly heavy."},{"s":9.46,"e":10.69,"t":"You might be surprised."},{"s":11.99,"e":15.87,"t":"We'll spend a moment practicing holding the bow properly before we load one up."},{"s":16.82,"e":20.38,"t":"I'm holding it now in the position in which you'll hold it."},{"s":21.5,"e":26.3,"t":"The drawstring is here and again you might be surprised at the tension."},{"s":27.74,"e":29.98,"t":"You need to practice drawing back the string."},{"s":31.48,"e":34.88,"t":"Just above the middle of the bow, here is the site."},{"s":35.64,"e":38.43,"t":"You look through this as you would with a rifle."},{"s":39.7,"e":43.13,"t":"Using a bow and arrow without a sight is perfectly possible."},{"s":43.74,"e":46.14,"t":"Most master archers do this."},{"s":46.78,"e":50.11,"t":"But having one will certainly help you to start off with."},{"s":51.26,"e":54.17,"t":"Now I'll put the boat down and show you an arrow."},{"s":55.32,"e":57.34,"t":"The shafts of our arrows are wooden."},{"s":58.17,"e":61.15,"t":"Fiberglass arrow shafts are now common too."},{"s":62.17,"e":64.54,"t":"Traditionally, as I'm sure you'll know..."},{"s":65.08,"e":66.11,"t":"the flatching"},{"s":66.58,"e":70.43,"t":"At the top of the arrow, I mean, not the tip end of the arrow."},{"s":71.06,"e":72.22,"t":"was made of feathers."},{"s":73.05,"e":79.07,"t":"We have some arrows with feather-fletching, but we also have some with what we call veins."},{"s":79.61,"e":82.53,"t":"That means the fletching is made of solid plastic."},{"s":83.96,"e":87.26,"t":"All of you have a quiver with six arrows in it."},{"s":87.96,"e":92.16,"t":"You should tie the strap of the quiver around your waist, like this."},{"s":93.62,"e":100.29,"t":"As I've said, you take an arrow from your quiver when I say so, when it's your turn and not before."},{"s":100.86,"e":102.4,"t":"Oh, I nearly forgot."},{"s":103.38,"e":104.0,"t":"protection."},{"s":105.43,"e":110.14,"t":"Everyone has a chest guard and hand guard, like those that I'm wearing."},{"s":111.26,"e":114.08,"t":"I'll show you how to put the chest guard on in a moment."},{"s":114.84,"e":116.29,"t":"and a bracer."},{"s":117.43,"e":123.29,"t":"The brace is a smaller arm pad that protects the inside of your arm from the string."},{"s":124.34,"e":127.55,"t":"For those of you in a t-shirt today, that's important."},{"s":128.54,"e":134.3,"t":"The bracer will also stop the string catching on the sleeve of a jumper or jacket."},{"s":135.8,"e":140.7,"t":"Right, so before we pick up the bows, let's have a look at these chest guards."}]},{"n":49,"title":"mouthpiece, valves, finger button…","img":"img/l4/m49.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFG","dur":238.9,"items":[{"p":"mouthpiece","a":"D","ps":26.23,"en":35.49,"si":2,"ev":"The musician blows continuously into the small metal cup on the left called the mouthpiece, which is shaped to fit the lips.","uz":"Musiqachi chap tomondagi kichik metall kosachaga — lablarga moslab yasalgan munshtukka — uzluksiz puflaydi.","why":"Chapdagi kichik kosacha — D.","hl":"mouthpiece"},{"p":"valves","a":"F","ps":43.83,"en":53.66,"si":4,"ev":"The three valves that extend from above the top to below the bottom of the instrument.","uz":"Asbobning tepasidan pastigacha cho'zilgan uchta klapan.","why":"Uchta vertikal quvur — F.","hl":"valves"},{"p":"finger button","a":"B","ps":66.65,"en":81.09,"si":6,"ev":"The musician does this by pressing one of the finger buttons at the top.","uz":"Musiqachi buni tepadagi barmoq tugmalaridan birini bosib qiladi.","why":"Klapanlar tepasidagi tugma — B.","hl":"finger button"},{"p":"bell","a":"A","ps":81.82,"en":102.21,"si":7,"ev":"Along to the end at the widest part of the body, known as the bell, which projects the powerful sound forwards.","uz":"Korpusning eng keng qismidagi uchiga — kuchli tovushni oldinga chiqaradigan \"qo'ng'iroq\"qa boradi.","why":"Eng keng qism — A.","hl":"bell"},{"p":"water key","a":"G","ps":102.74,"en":112.57,"si":8,"ev":"There is a device on the tuning slide called the water key, which when pressed, lets the water drip out.","uz":"Sozlash quvurida \"suv klapani\" degan moslama bor, bosilganda suv tomib chiqadi.","why":"Tuning slide ustidagi moslama — G.","hl":"water key"}],"segs":[{"s":6.3,"e":13.02,"t":"The trumpet is quite a remarkable instrument. Take the B flat type for instance, the kind of trumpet most people use today."},{"s":13.53,"e":25.69,"t":"If we stretched one out in a straight line, it would measure nearly 140 centimeters in length. What we see in the diagram then is a very long brass tube wrapped around itself in order to save space."},{"s":26.23,"e":35.49,"t":"To produce its characteristic sound, the musician blows continuously into the small metal cup on the left called the mouthpiece, which is shaped to fit the lips."},{"s":36.02,"e":43.33,"t":"The air travels along the lead pipe and around the tuning slide, which can be moved in or out to change the instrument's pitch."},{"s":43.83,"e":53.66,"t":"The air then reaches the feature that distinguishes the trumpet from, for instance, a bugle. The three valves that extend from above the top to below the bottom of the instrument."},{"s":54.17,"e":65.79,"t":"Each valve can send the airflow one of two ways, either along the main pipe, the shortest route, or else into an extra length of tube, thus lowering the pitch of the sound being played."},{"s":66.65,"e":81.09,"t":"The musician does this by pressing one of the finger buttons at the top, diverting the air into the first tube if the first is pressed, into the second and shortest by using the second, or into the longest one, the third, by pressing number three."},{"s":81.82,"e":102.21,"t":"The air then continues its way round the bend in the lead pipe and along to the end at the widest part of the body, known as the bell, which projects the powerful sound forwards. Incidentally, all this breath forced through the metal of the instrument does, of course, contain water vapor, and this will start to condense and form droplets after a certain amount of playing."},{"s":102.74,"e":112.57,"t":"The result is a gurgling sound from the trumpet. So to avoid this, there is a device on the tuning slide called the water key, which when pressed, lets the water drip out."}]},{"n":50,"title":"Hell's Gate Thermal Reserve, Arts and Craft Institute, Volcanic Valley…","img":"img/l4/m50.jpg","letters":"ABCDEFGHI","dur":258.4,"items":[{"p":"Hell's Gate Thermal Reserve","a":"B","ps":47.96,"en":58.59,"si":5,"ev":"We will be visiting the Hellsgate Thermal Reserve. This is the area between the SH30 road and the lake.","uz":"Hell's Gate termal qo'riqxonasiga boramiz. Bu SH30 yo'li bilan ko'l orasidagi hudud.","why":"SH30 va Rotoiti ko'li orasi — B.","hl":"Reserve"},{"p":"Arts and Craft Institute","a":"E","ps":59.1,"en":72.73,"si":7,"ev":"The Arts and Crafts Institute which is just along the SH-30 from the motel where it meets the SH-5 outside the town.","uz":"Hunarmandchilik instituti — moteldan SH30 bo'ylab, u shahar tashqarisida SH5 bilan tutashgan joyda.","why":"SH30 va SH5 kesishmasi — E.","hl":"Institute"},{"p":"Volcanic Valley","a":"H","ps":89.78,"en":99.58,"si":9,"ev":"The valley is on the opposite side of the lake from the mountain.","uz":"Vodiy ko'lning tog'ga qarama-qarshi tomonida.","why":"Rotomahana ko'lining narigi tomoni — H.","hl":"valley"},{"p":"Tamaki Village","a":"G","ps":114.42,"en":123.9,"si":12,"ev":"On the way back towards Rotorua along the SH5 we'll be stopping at Tamaki Village which is on the main road about 12km outside town.","uz":"Rotoruaga SH5 bo'ylab qaytishda shahardan 12 km narida, katta yo'l ustidagi Tamaki qishlog'ida to'xtaymiz.","why":"Katta yo'ldagi qishloq — G. (Buried village — Tarawera bo'yi, boshqa joy)","hl":"Tamaki Village"}],"segs":[{"s":4.12,"e":12.8,"t":"Hello everyone and I'd like to welcome you all to Rotorua, one of the most famous destinations in New Zealand where we have a long history of welcoming visitors."},{"s":13.43,"e":21.15,"t":"I'd like to explain a bit about the geography of this amazing region, famous for its geothermal activity, and tell you what we've planned for your stay."},{"s":22.04,"e":29.79,"t":"Well if you'd like to have a look at the map of the region that's in your welcome pack, if you find Lake Rotorua on the top left, the big triangular lake,"},{"s":30.3,"e":42.37,"t":"We've just driven down along State Highway 5, SH5, down the western side of the lake and then we turned off through the town and we're here at the Lakes Motel just around the southern tip of the lake. OK?"},{"s":42.9,"e":47.42,"t":"Now tomorrow we'll be heading off along SH30 in the opposite direction from the town"},{"s":47.96,"e":52.22,"t":"Towards Lake Ritoyta we will be visiting the Hellsgate Thermal Reserve."},{"s":52.92,"e":58.59,"t":"This is the area between the SH30 road and the lake and I'll be telling you more about this in a minute."},{"s":59.1,"e":72.73,"t":"We'll then be returning to the motel and in the afternoon we'll be visiting the town of Rotorua itself and also the Arts and Crafts Institute which is just along the SH-30 from the motel where it meets the SH-5 outside the town."},{"s":74.26,"e":88.29,"t":"Now if you look directly out of the motel towards the south east in the opposite direction to Lake Rotorua you can just see the peak of Mount Tarawera and the day after tomorrow we'll be visiting the volcanic valley which was formed when this last erupted."},{"s":89.78,"e":99.58,"t":"We'll drive down the SH-5 and then head off towards Lake Rotamahana. The valley is on the opposite side of the lake from the mountain, so you can see what a powerful effect the eruption had."},{"s":100.47,"e":102.69,"t":"also an interesting archaeological site."},{"s":103.35,"e":113.73,"t":"a village buried by the same eruption on the western shores of Lake Tarawera, just to the north. But I'm afraid we won't have time to visit that as a group, although you may wish to go there on your own."},{"s":114.42,"e":123.9,"t":"However on the way back towards Rotorua along the SH5 we'll be stopping at Tamaki Village which is on the main road about 12km outside town."}]}];
